工具","AI开发工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ソースコード解析","ドキュメント生成","開発効率","plan-adr-flowの使い方","plan-adr-flowのインストール","ソースコード解析ツール","ドキュメント生成ツール","AI開発ツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 분석","문서 생성","개발 효율성","plan-adr-flow 사용법","plan-adr-flow 설치","코드 분석 도구","문서 생성 도구","AI 개발 도구"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrollo","cómo usar plan-adr-flow","alternativas a plan-adr-flow","plan-adr-flow vs otras herramientas","instalación de plan-adr-flow","guía de configuración de plan-adr-flow"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour le développement","comment utiliser plan-adr-flow","alternatives à plan-adr-flow","plan-adr-flow vs d''autres outils","installation de plan-adr-flow","guide de configuration de plan-adr-flow"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwicklung","wie man plan-adr-flow verwendet","Alternativen zu plan-adr-flow","plan-adr-flow im Vergleich zu anderen Tools","Installation von plan-adr-flow","Konfigurationsanleitung für plan-adr-flow"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","análise de código","criação de documentação","desenvolvimento de software","plan-adr-flow","alternativas ao plan-adr-flow","como usar plan-adr-flow","guias de instalação do plan-adr-flow","configuração do plan-adr-flow"],"ru":["ии агенты","анализ кода","создание документации","разработка программного обеспечения","plan-adr-flow","альтернативы plan-adr-flow","как использовать plan-adr-flow","руководства по установке plan-adr-flow","настройка plan-adr-flow"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحليل الكود","إنشاء توثيق","تطوير البرمجيات","plan-adr-flow","بديل plan-adr-flow","كيفية استخدام plan-adr-flow","دليل تثبيت plan-adr-flow","إعداد plan-adr-flow"]}},"owner":"fyuuki0jp","repo":"SourceDoc","repoPath":"fyuuki0jp/SourceDoc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.724Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-adr-flow","description":"Plan and document coding tasks with PLAN.md and ADRs in docs/ADR. Use when a task can be decomposed, when asked to create or update PLAN.md, or when capturing technical decisions.","bodyPreview":"# Plan + ADR Flow\n\n## Goal\n\nKeep task planning and technical decisions documented in `PLAN.md` and `docs/ADR/...` before, during, and after implementation.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Triage task size**\n   - If the task is not meaningfully decomposable, proceed without creating `PLAN.md` or ADR unless requested.\n   - If the task is decomposable, draft a plan and confirm with the user before implementation.\n\n2. **Create plan and ADR when planning**\n   - Create or replace `PLAN.md` at repo root with the im","body":"# Plan + ADR Flow\n\n## Goal\n\nKeep task planning and technical decisions documented in `PLAN.md` and `docs/ADR/...` before, during, and after implementation.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Triage task size**\n   - If the task is not meaningfully decomposable, proceed without creating `PLAN.md` or ADR unless requested.\n   - If the task is decomposable, draft a plan and confirm with the user before implementation.\n\n2. **Create plan and ADR when planning**\n   - Create or replace `PLAN.md` at repo root with the implementation plan.\n   - Create `docs/ADR/YYYYMMDD-title.md` for the technical decision record before coding.\n   - Create `docs/ADR/` if missing.\n   - Use a short, lowercase, hyphenated slug for `title`.\n\n3. **Update during implementation**\n   - Treat `PLAN.md` as a living memo; update it frequently to reflect reality.\n   - Append ADR updates when technical issues or new decisions appear; keep prior entries.\n\n4. **Finalize after implementation**\n   - Update ADR with outcomes, changes, and follow-ups.\n   - Mark `PLAN.md` as complete or reflect the final state.\n\n## ADR template (minimum)\n\n```markdown\n# <Title>\n\nDate: YYYY-MM-DD\nStatus: Proposed | Accepted | Superseded\n\n## Context\n- <Why this decision is needed>\n\n## Decision\n- <What is decided>\n\n## Consequences\n- <Impact, tradeoffs, follow-ups>\n\n## Change log\n- YYYY-MM-DD: <What changed and why>\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Keep ADR updates additive; never delete past entries.\n- Keep `PLAN.md` specific to the current task; do not modify `PLANS.md` unless explicitly asked.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:55:05.288Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing structured task planning and technical decision documentation in Markdown format.","zh":"适合需要结构化任务规划和技术决策文档的开发代理，文档格式为Markdown。","ja":"開発エージェントが構造化されたタスクプランニングと技術的意思決定のドキュメントをMarkdown形式で必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"구조화된 작업 계획 및 기술적 의사 결정을 Markdown 형식으로 문서화하는 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan una planificación de tareas estructurada y documentación de decisiones técnicas en formato Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant une planification de tâches structurée et une documentation de décisions techniques au format Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungssagenten, die eine strukturierte Aufgabenplanung und technische Entscheidungsdokumentation im Markdown-Format benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de planejamento de tarefas estruturado e documentação de decisões técnicas no formato Markdown.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется структурированное планирование задач и документация технических решений в формате Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الناشئين الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط مهام منظم وتوثيق القرارات الفنية بصيغة Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage task planning and Architecture Decision Records (ADRs) using Markdown files like `PLAN.md` and `docs/ADR/...`, streamlining development workflows and ensuring transparency through version control.","zh":"赋予代理管理任务规划和架构决策记录（ADRs），使用Markdown文件，如`PLAN.md`和`docs/ADR/...`，简化开发工作流并通过版本控制确保透明度。","ja":"エージェントがタスクプランニングとアーキテクチャ決定レコード（ADRs）を管理できるようにし、`PLAN.md`や`docs/ADR/...`のようなMarkdownファイルを使用して開発ワークフローを合理化し、バージョン管理によって透明性を確保します。","ko":"에이전트가 작업 계획 및 아키텍처 결정 기록(ADRs)을 관리할 수 있도록 하며, `PLAN.md` 및 `docs/ADR/...`와 같은 Markdown 파일을 사용하여 개발 워크플로우를 간소화하고 버전 관리를 통해 투명성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar la planificación de tareas y Registros de Decisiones de Arquitectura (ADRs) utilizando archivos Markdown como `PLAN.md` y `docs/ADR/...`, simplificando los flujos de trabajo de desarrollo y garantizando la transparencia a través del control de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la planification de tâches et les Registres de Décisions d''Architecture (ADRs) en utilisant des fichiers Markdown tels que `PLAN.md` et `docs/ADR/...`, simplifiant les flux de travail de développement et garantissant la transparence grâce au contrôle de version.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Aufgabenplanung und Architektur-Entscheidungs-Records (ADRs) mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien wie `PLAN.md` und `docs/ADR/...` zu verwalten, wodurch die Entwicklungsaufgaben gestrafft und die Transparenz durch Versionskontrolle gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o planejamento de tarefas e Registros de Decisões de Arquitetura (ADRs) usando arquivos Markdown como `PLAN.md` e `docs/ADR/...`, racionalizando os fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvimento e garantindo a transparência por meio do controle de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять планированием задач и Архитектурными Записями Решений (ADRs) с помощью файлов Markdown, таких как `PLAN.md` и `docs/ADR/...`, оптимизируя рабочие процессы разработки и обеспечивая прозрачность посредством контроля версий.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة تخطيط المهام وسجلات قرارات الهندسة المعمارية (ADRs) باستخدام ملفات Markdown مثل `PLAN.md` و `docs/ADR/...`، ويراقب سير عمل التطوير وضمان الشفافية من خلال سيطرة الإصدار."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating task triage and planning","Generating ADR documentation for technical decisions","Maintaining a centralized knowledge base in Markdown"],"zh":["自动化任务_triage_和规划","为技术决策生成ADRs文档","在Markdown中维护集中式知识库"],"ja":["タスクのトリアージと計画の自動化","技術的意思決定のADRsドキュメントを生成","Markdownで集中管理されたナレッジベースを維持"],"ko":["작업 분류 및 계획을 자동화하는 것","기술적 의사 결정을 위한 ADRs 문서 생성","Markdown에서集中 관리된 지식 베이스 유지"],"es":["Automatización de la triage y planificación de tareas","Generación de documentación de ADR para decisiones técnicas","Mantenimiento de una base de conocimientos centralizada en Markdown"],"fr":["Automatisation de la triage et de la planification de tâches","Génération de la documentation de ADR pour les décisions techniques","Maintenance d''une base de connaissances centralisée en Markdown"],"de":["Automatisierung der Aufgaben-Triage und -Planung","Generierung von ADR-Dokumentation für technische Entscheidungen","Wartung einer zentralen Wissensbasis im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem e planejamento de tarefas","Gerar documentação de ADR para decisões técnicas","Manter uma base de conhecimento centralizada em Markdown"],"ru":["Автоматизировать триаж и планирование задач","Генерировать документацию ADR для технических решений","Поддерживать централизованную базу знаний в формате Markdown"],"ar":["أتمتة الفحص والتخطيط للمهام","توليد توثيق ADR للقرارات الفنية","الحفاظ على قاعدة معرفة مركزية بصيغة Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to repository and file system for creating and updating `PLAN.md` and `docs/ADR/...` files","Limited to tasks that can be meaningfully decomposed"],"zh":["需要访问仓库和文件系统以创建和更新`PLAN.md`和`docs/ADR/...`文件","仅适用于可以有意义地分解的任务"],"ja":["`PLAN.md`と`docs/ADR/...`ファイルを作成および更新するためにリポジトリとファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","意味的に分解できるタスクのみに限定"],"ko":["`PLAN.md` 및 `docs/ADR/...` 파일을 생성 및 업데이트하기 위해 저장소 및 파일 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요","의미 있게 분해할 수 있는 작업만 해당"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio y al sistema de archivos para crear y actualizar archivos `PLAN.md` y `docs/ADR/...`","Limitado a tareas que se pueden descomponer de manera significativa"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel et au système de fichiers pour créer et mettre à jour les fichiers `PLAN.md` et `docs/ADR/...`","Limité aux tâches qui peuvent être décomposées de manière significative"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Repository und das Dateisystem, um Dateien `PLAN.md` und `docs/ADR/...` zu erstellen und zu aktualisieren","Begrenzt auf Aufgaben, die sinnvoll zerlegt werden können"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório e sistema de arquivos para criar e atualizar arquivos `PLAN.md` e `docs/ADR/...`","Limitado a tarefas que possam ser significativamente decompostas"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию и файловой системе для создания и обновления файлов `PLAN.md` и `docs/ADR/...`","Ограничен задачами, которые могут быть осмысленно разложены"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى المستودع ونظام الملفات لإنشاء وتحديث ملفات `PLAN.md` و `docs/ADR/...`","محدود بالمهمات التي يمكن تفكيكها بشكل معنوي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7337d5bb3586b1b85f05e8c8c6f8d42d679f7f42c63dd61318e363f027c55823","qualityScore":25}');
