licações com writing-prds"],"ru":["как использовать writing-prds","что такое writing-prds","инструменты ИИ Агентов","writing-prds vs другие инструменты","установить writing-prds","руководство по настройке writing-prds","разработка приложений с writing-prds"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام writing-prds","ما هو writing-prds","أدوات الإيجنت الذكية","writing-prds مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت writing-prds","دليل إعداد writing-prds","تطوير تطبيقات البرامج مع writing-prds"]}},"owner":"dralgorhythm","repo":"claude-agentic-framework","repoPath":"dralgorhythm/claude-agentic-framework","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.728Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"writing-prds","description":"Create Product Requirements Documents. Use when defining new features, projects, or initiatives. Covers user stories, acceptance criteria, and scope definition.","bodyPreview":"# Writing PRDs\n\n## Workflows\n\n- [ ] **Define Goals**: Articulate business goals and success metrics\n- [ ] **Identify Stakeholders**: List all relevant stakeholders\n- [ ] **Draft User Stories**: Capture user needs\n- [ ] **Detail Requirements**: List functional and non-functional requirements\n- [ ] **Save Artifact**: Save to `./artifacts/prd_[feature].md`\n- [ ] **Review**: Conduct stakeholder review\n\n## PRD Structure\n\n1. **Overview**: What and why\n2. **Goals & Success Metrics**: How we measure suc","body":"# Writing PRDs\n\n## Workflows\n\n- [ ] **Define Goals**: Articulate business goals and success metrics\n- [ ] **Identify Stakeholders**: List all relevant stakeholders\n- [ ] **Draft User Stories**: Capture user needs\n- [ ] **Detail Requirements**: List functional and non-functional requirements\n- [ ] **Save Artifact**: Save to `./artifacts/prd_[feature].md`\n- [ ] **Review**: Conduct stakeholder review\n\n## PRD Structure\n\n1. **Overview**: What and why\n2. **Goals & Success Metrics**: How we measure success\n3. **User Stories**: Who benefits and how\n4. **Requirements**: What must be built\n5. **Out of Scope**: What we''re NOT building\n6. **Timeline**: Key milestones\n\n## User Story Format\n\n```\nAs a [role],\nI want [feature],\nSo that [benefit].\n```\n\n### Example\n```\nAs a registered user,\nI want to reset my password via email,\nSo that I can regain access to my account if I forget it.\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\nUse Given/When/Then format:\n\n```\nGiven I am on the login page\nWhen I click \"Forgot Password\"\nThen I see a form to enter my email\n\nGiven I enter a valid registered email\nWhen I submit the form\nThen I receive a password reset email within 5 minutes\n```\n\n## INVEST Criteria\n\nGood user stories are:\n- **I**ndependent: Can be developed separately\n- **N**egotiable: Details can be discussed\n- **V**aluable: Delivers user value\n- **E**stimable: Can be sized\n- **S**mall: Fits in a sprint\n- **T**estable: Has clear acceptance criteria\n\n## Resources\n\n- [PRD Template](./resources/prd.template.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:58:18.668Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Product Development Agents needing structured requirement documentation through PRDs","zh":"适用于需要通过 PRD 进行结构化需求文档的产品开发代理","ja":"PRD を介した構造化された要件文書化が必要な製品開発エージェントに最適","ko":"PRD를 통해 구조화된 요구 사항 문서가 필요한 제품 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de Productos que necesitan documentación de requisitos estructurados a través de PRD","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement de Produits ayant besoin d''une documentation de requêtes structurée via des PRD","de":"Ideal für Produktentwicklungsagenten, die eine strukturierte Anforderungsdokumentation durch PRD benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento de Produto que precisam de documentação de requisitos estruturada por meio de PRDs","ru":"Идеально для агентов по разработке продуктов, которым требуется структурированная документация требований через PRD","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تطوير المنتج الذين يحتاجون إلى توثيق متطلبات منظم عبر PRDs"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to define goals, identify stakeholders, and detail requirements using markdown files, facilitating stakeholder review and version control through artifacts saved in ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md","zh":"赋予代理定义目标、识别利益相关者并使用 markdown 文件详细说明要求，通过在 ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md 中保存的工件来促进利益相关者审查和版本控制","ja":"エージェントが目標を定義し、利害関係者を特定し、markdown ファイルを使用して要件を詳細に記述することを可能にし、./artifacts/prd_[feature].md に保存されたアーティファクトを介して利害関係者のレビューとバージョン管理を促進する","ko":"에이전트가 목표를 정의하고 이해 관계자를 식별하고 마크다운 파일을 사용하여 요구 사항을 자세히 설명할 수 있도록 하며, ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md에 저장된 아티팩트를 통해 이해 관계자 검토 및 버전 관리를 촉진","es":"Habilita a los agentes a definir objetivos, identificar partes interesadas y detallar requisitos utilizando archivos markdown, facilitando la revisión de las partes interesadas y el control de versiones a través de artefactos guardados en ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md","fr":"Permet aux agents de définir des objectifs, d''identifier les parties prenantes et de détailler les exigences en utilisant des fichiers markdown, facilitant l''examen des parties prenantes et le contrôle de version via des artefacts enregistrés dans ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Ziele zu definieren, Stakeholder zu identifizieren und Anforderungen mithilfe von Markdown-Dateien zu detaillieren, wodurch die Überprüfung der Stakeholder und die Versionskontrolle durch in ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md gespeicherte Artefakte erleichtert wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a definir metas, identificar partes interessadas e detalhar requisitos usando arquivos markdown, facilitando a revisão das partes interessadas e o controle de versão por meio de artefatos salvos em ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью определять цели, идентифицировать заинтересованные стороны и детализировать требования с помощью файлов markdown, облегчая проверку заинтересованных сторон и контроль версий через артефакты, сохраненные в ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md","ar":"يُمكّن الوكلاء من تعريف الأهداف وتحديد أصحاب المصلحة وتفصيل المتطلبات باستخدام ملفات markdown، وتسهيل استعراض أصحاب المصلحة ومراقبة الإصدار من خلال الحفاظ على الملفات في ./artifacts/prd_[feature].md"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PRD creation for new features","Generating user stories for agile development","Documenting functional and non-functional requirements"],"zh":["自动化新功能的 PRD 创建","为敏捷开发生成用户故事","记录功能性和非功能性要求"],"ja":["新機能の PRD 作成の自動化","アジャイル開発のためのユーザーストーリーの生成","機能要件と非機能要件のドキュメント化"],"ko":["새 기능의 PRD 생성 자동화","敏捷 개발을 위한 사용자 스토리 생성","기능적 및 비기능적 요구 사항 문서화"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de PRD para nuevas características","Generación de historias de usuario para el desarrollo ágil","Documentación de requisitos funcionales y no funcionales"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de PRD pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités","Génération d''histoires d''utilisateurs pour le développement agile","Documentation des exigences fonctionnelles et non fonctionnelles"],"de":["Automatisierung der PRD-Erstellung für neue Funktionen","Generierung von Benutzerstories für die agile Entwicklung","Dokumentation von funktionalen und nichtfunktionalen Anforderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de PRD para novos recursos","Gerar histórias de usuário para desenvolvimento ágil","Documentar requisitos funcionais e não funcionais"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание PRD для новых функций","Генерировать истории пользователя для гибкой разработки","Документировать функциональные и нефункциональные требования"],"ar":["تансовيم автоматي لإنشاء PRD لسمات جديدة","توليد قصص المستخدمين من أجل التطوير المُرون","توثيق المتطلبات الوظيفية وغير الوظيفية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires markdown file system access","Stakeholder review process needed"],"zh":["需要 markdown 文件系统访问","需要利益相关者审查流程"],"ja":["markdown ファイルシステムへのアクセスが必要","利害関係者のレビュー プロセスが必要"],"ko":["마크다운 파일 시스템 액세스가 필요","이해 관계자 검토 프로세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso al sistema de archivos markdown","Se requiere un proceso de revisión de las partes interesadas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au système de fichiers markdown","Un processus d''examen des parties prenantes est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Markdown-Dateisystem","Ein Überprüfungsprozess der Stakeholder ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao sistema de arquivos markdown","Necessário processo de revisão das partes interessadas"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к системе файлов markdown","Необходим процесс проверки заинтересованных сторон"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى نظام ملفات markdown","يتطلب عملية استعراض أصحاب المصلحة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e3fdcd7c2059cf66fe81d4eb21474feadc32dcf039da420576dfab1975ce1831","qualityScore":25}');
