une plus grande efficacité","Compatible avec les projets de développement de logiciels","Améliore les performances des programmes C","Facile à utiliser et à configurer"],"de":["C-Compiler optimiert für Geschwindigkeit","Geschrieben in MoonBit für höhere Effizienz","Kompatibel mit Software-Entwicklungsprojekten","Verbessert die Leistung von C-Programmen","Einfach zu bedienen und zu konfigurieren"],"pt":["Compilador C otimizado para velocidade","Escrito em MoonBit","Criação de códigos mais eficientes","Melhoria da performance do software","Fácil integração com outros projetos"],"ru":["Оптимизированный компилятор С для скорости","Написанный на MoonBit","Создание более эффективного кода","Повышение производительности программного обеспечения","Легкая интеграция с другими проектами"],"ar":["مُجمع سي مُحسّن للسرعة","مكتوب بلغة MoonBit","إنشاء رموز أكثر كفاءة","تحسين أداء البرمجيات","تكامل سهل مع مشاريع أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MoonBit 语言 AI 工具","速度优化的 C 编译器","如何使用 MoonBit","MoonBit 代替方案","MoonBit 与其他编译器的比较","MoonBit 安装指南","MoonBit 设置教程"],"ja":["MoonBit言語 AIエージェント","速度最適化のCコンパイラ","MoonBitの使い方","MoonBitの代替","MoonBitと他のコンパイラの比較","MoonBitのインストールガイド","MoonBitの設定方法"],"ko":["MoonBit 언어 AI 에이전트","속도 최적화된 C 컴파일러","MoonBit 사용 방법","MoonBit 대체方案","MoonBit와 다른 컴파일러의 비교","MoonBit 설치 가이드","MoonBit 설정 방법"],"es":["herramientas de AI","compilador C","moonbit-lang","desarrollo de software","optimización de velocidad","cómo utilizar moonbit-lang","alternativas a GCC","moonbit-lang vs GCC"],"fr":["outils d''IA","compilateur C","moonbit-lang","développement de logiciels","optimisation de vitesse","comment utiliser moonbit-lang","alternatives à GCC","moonbit-lang vs GCC"],"de":["KI-Tools","C-Compiler","moonbit-lang","Software-Entwicklung","Geschwindigkeitsoptimierung","wie man moonbit-lang verwendet","Alternativen zu GCC","moonbit-lang vs GCC"],"pt":["moonbit-lang","compilador C","velocidade","eficiência","desenvolvimento de software","como usar moonbit-lang","moonbit-lang vs outros compiladores","instalar moonbit-lang"],"ru":["moonbit-lang","компилятор С","скорость","эффективность","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать moonbit-lang","moonbit-lang vs другие компиляторы","установить moonbit-lang"],"ar":["moonbit-lang","مُجمع سي","السرعة","الكفاءة","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام moonbit-lang","moonbit-lang مقابل مُجمعين آخرين","تثبيت moonbit-lang"]}},"owner":"moonbit-community","repo":"fastcc","repoPath":"moonbit-community/fastcc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.738Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"moonbit-lang","description":"MoonBit language reference and coding conventions. Use when writing MoonBit code, asking about syntax, or encountering MoonBit-specific errors. Covers error handling, FFI, async, and common pitfalls.","bodyPreview":"# MoonBit Language Reference\n\n@reference/index.md\n@reference/introduction.md\n@reference/fundamentals.md\n@reference/methods.md\n@reference/derive.md\n@reference/error-handling.md\n@reference/packages.md\n@reference/tests.md\n@reference/benchmarks.md\n@reference/docs.md\n@reference/attributes.md\n@reference/ffi.md\n@reference/async-experimental.md\n@reference/error_codes/index.md\n@reference/toml-parser-parser.mbt\n\n## Official Packages\n\nMoonBit has official packages maintained by the team:\n\n- **moonbitlang/x","body":"# MoonBit Language Reference\n\n@reference/index.md\n@reference/introduction.md\n@reference/fundamentals.md\n@reference/methods.md\n@reference/derive.md\n@reference/error-handling.md\n@reference/packages.md\n@reference/tests.md\n@reference/benchmarks.md\n@reference/docs.md\n@reference/attributes.md\n@reference/ffi.md\n@reference/async-experimental.md\n@reference/error_codes/index.md\n@reference/toml-parser-parser.mbt\n\n## Official Packages\n\nMoonBit has official packages maintained by the team:\n\n- **moonbitlang/x**: Utilities including file I/O (`moonbitlang/x/fs`)\n- **moonbitlang/async**: Asynchronous runtime with TCP, HTTP, async queues, async test, and async main\n\nTo use these packages:\n1. Add the dependency: `moon add moonbitlang/x` or `moon add moonbitlang/async`\n2. Import the specific subpackage in `moon.pkg.json`:\n   ```json\n   {\"import\": [\"moonbitlang/x/fs\"]}\n   ```\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Use `suberror` for error types, `raise` to throw, `try! func() |> ignore` to ignore errors\n- Use `func() |> ignore` not `let _ = func()`\n- When using `inspect(value, content=expected_string)`, don''t declare a separate `let expected = ...` variable - it causes unused variable warnings. Put the expected string directly in the `content=` parameter\n- Use `!condition` not `not(condition)`\n- Use `f(value)` not `f!(value)` (deprecated)\n- Use `for i in 0..<n` not C-style `for i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1`\n- Use `if opt is Pattern(v) { ... }` for single-branch matching, not `match opt {}`\n- Use `arr.clear()` not `while arr.length() > 0 { arr.pop() }`\n- Use `s.code_unit_at(i)` or `for c in s` not `s[i]` (deprecated)\n- Struct/enum visibility: `priv` (hidden) < (none)/abstract (type only) < `pub` (readonly) < `pub(all)` (full)\n- Default to abstract (no modifier) for internal types; use `pub struct` when external code reads fields\n- Use `pub(all) enum` for enums that external code pattern-matches on\n- Use `let mut` only for reassignment, not for mutable containers like Array\n- Use `reinterpret_as_uint()` for unsigned ops, `to_int()` for numeric conversion\n- Use `Array::length()` not `Array::size()`\n- In moon.pkg.json, use \"import\", \"test-import\" and \"wbtest-import\" to manage package importing for \".mbt\", \"_test.mbt\" and \"_wbtest.mbt\"\n- Use `Option::unwrap_or` not `Option::or`\n\n## Parser Style Reference\n\nWhen writing a hand-written parser, follow the style in `reference/toml-parser-parser.mbt` (mirrored from `moonbit-community/toml-parser`).\n\n- Prefer `Parser::parse_*` methods that advance a token view (`view`/`update_view`)\n- Centralize error reporting (e.g. `Parser::error`) and include token locations\n- Keep functions small (`parse_value`, `parse_array`, ...) and separate blocks with `///|`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:35.720Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Compiler Optimization Agents needing advanced C compilation capabilities with MoonBit Language","zh":"适合需要高级 C 编译能力的 MoonBit 语言的编译器优化代理","ja":"MoonBit Language で高度な C コンパイル機能を必要とするコンパイラ最適化エージェントに最適","ko":"MoonBit 언어에서 고급 C 컴파일 기능을 필요로 하는 컴파일러 최적화 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Optimización de Compiladores que necesitan capacidades de compilación de C avanzadas con MoonBit Language","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Optimisation de Compilateurs ayant besoin de capacités de compilation de C avancées avec MoonBit Language","de":"Perfekt für Compiler-Optimierungsagenten, die erweiterte C-Compilierfähigkeiten mit MoonBit Language benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Otimização de Compilador que necessitam de capacidades de compilação C avançadas com MoonBit Language","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов оптимизации компилятора, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности компиляции C с помощью MoonBit Language","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحسين المترجم الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات تجميع متقدمة بلغة MoonBit"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to compile C code with optimized speed using MoonBit, leveraging methods, derive, error-handling, and packages, while also utilizing TOML parser and async-experimental features","zh":"赋予代理使用 MoonBit 编译 C 代码的能力，利用方法、derive、错误处理和包，同时也使用 TOML 解析器和异步实验功能来实现优化的速度","ja":"エージェントが MoonBit を使用して C コードを最適化された速度でコンパイルできるようにし、メソッド、derive、エラー処理、パッケージを利用し、TOML パーサーと非同期実験機能も使用する","ko":"에이전트가 MoonBit를 사용하여 C 코드를 최적화된 속도로 컴파일할 수 있도록 하며, 메서드, derive, 오류 처리 및 패키지를 활용하고, TOML 파서 및 비동기 실험 기능도 함께 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a compilar código C con velocidad optimizada utilizando MoonBit, aprovechando métodos, derive, manejo de errores y paquetes, y también utilizando el analizador TOML y características experimentales asíncronas","fr":"Permet aux agents de compiler du code C avec une vitesse optimisée en utilisant MoonBit, en exploitant les méthodes, derive, la gestion des erreurs et les packages, et en utilisant également l''analyseur TOML et les fonctionnalités expérimentales asynchrones","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, C-Code mit optimierter Geschwindigkeit zu kompilieren, indem MoonBit verwendet wird, wobei Methoden, derive, Fehlerbehandlung und Pakete genutzt werden und auch der TOML-Parser und asynchrone experimentelle Funktionen verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a compilar código C com velocidade otimizada usando MoonBit, aproveitando métodos, derive, tratamento de erros e pacotes, além de utilizar parser TOML e recursos experimentais assíncronos","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью компилировать код C с оптимизированной скоростью с помощью MoonBit, используя методы, derive, обработку ошибок и пакеты, а также использует парсер TOML и экспериментальные асинхронные функции","ar":"يمنح العميل khảية ترجمة كود C بسرعة محسنة باستخدام MoonBit، مستفيداً من الطرق وأستخلاص وآليات معالجة الأخطاء والحزم، بالإضافة إلى استخدام محلل TOML والسمات التجريبية غير المتزامنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Compiling C code for performance-critical applications","Optimizing MoonBit Language code for speed and efficiency","Debugging C compilation errors using MoonBit''s error-handling mechanisms"],"zh":["编译性能关键应用的 C 代码","优化 MoonBit 语言代码以提高速度和效率","使用 MoonBit 的错误处理机制调试 C 编译错误"],"ja":["パフォーマンスクリティカルなアプリケーションの C コードをコンパイルする","MoonBit Language コードを速度と効率のために最適化する","MoonBit のエラー処理メカニズムを使用して C コンパイルエラーをデバッグする"],"ko":["성능에 중요한 애플리케이션의 C 코드 컴파일","속도와 효율성을 위해 MoonBit 언어 코드 최적화","MoonBit의 오류 처리 메커니즘을 사용하여 C 컴파일 오류 디버깅"],"es":["Compilación de código C para aplicaciones críticas de rendimiento","Optimización de código de MoonBit Language para velocidad y eficiencia","Depuración de errores de compilación de C utilizando los mecanismos de manejo de errores de MoonBit"],"fr":["Compilation de code C pour des applications critiques de performance","Optimisation de code MoonBit Language pour la vitesse et l''efficacité","Débogage des erreurs de compilation C en utilisant les mécanismes de gestion des erreurs de MoonBit"],"de":["Kompilierung von C-Code für leistungs kritische Anwendungen","Optimierung von MoonBit Language-Code für Geschwindigkeit und Effizienz","Fehlerbehebung bei der Kompilierung von C mithilfe der Fehlerbehandlungsmechanismen von MoonBit"],"pt":["Compilar código C para aplicações críticas de desempenho","Otimizar código MoonBit Language para velocidade e eficiência","Depurar erros de compilação C usando os mecanismos de tratamento de erros do MoonBit"],"ru":["Компилировать код C для приложений, критичных к производительности","Оптимизировать код MoonBit Language для скорости и эффективности","Отлаживать ошибки компиляции C с помощью механизмов обработки ошибок MoonBit"],"ar":["تجميع كود C لبرامج حرجة الأداء","تحسين كود MoonBit Language لتحقيق السرعة والكفاءة","تصحيح أخطاء تجميع C باستخدام آليات معالجة الأخطاء في MoonBit"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MoonBit Language expertise","Limited to C compilation","Experimental async features may require additional setup"],"zh":["需要 MoonBit 语言的专业知识","仅限 C 编译","实验性的异步功能可能需要额外的设置"],"ja":["MoonBit Language の専門知識が必要","C コンパイルのみ","実験的な非同期機能は追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["MoonBit 언어의 전문 지식이 필요","C 컴파일만 해당","실험적인 비동기 기능은 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en MoonBit Language","Limitado a la compilación de C","Las características asíncronas experimentales pueden requerir una configuración adicional"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en MoonBit Language","Limité à la compilation de C","Les fonctionnalités asynchrones expérimentales peuvent nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire"],"de":["Erfordert Erfahrung mit MoonBit Language","Begrenzt auf die Kompilierung von C","Experimentelle asynchrone Funktionen können eine zusätzliche Einrichtung erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento especializado em MoonBit Language","Limitado à compilação C","Recursos experimentais assíncronos podem exigir configuração adicional"],"ru":["Требует специальных знаний языка MoonBit","Ограничен компиляцией C","Экспериментальные асинхронные функции могут требовать дополнительной настройки"],"ar":["يحتاج إلى معرفة متخصصة بلغة MoonBit","محدود بترجمة C","السمات التجريبية غير المتزامنة قد تتطلب إعداد إضافي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7513df6b34bcf22dfd694441fa6c59d539e200e475f97f8c6d393925fa81c536","qualityScore":25}');
