seline-uiは、AIエージェントのインターフェースを磨くためのスキルセットです","ko":"baseline-ui는 AI 에이전트의 인터페이스를 최적화하는 데 사용되는 스킬 세트입니다","es":"Baseline-ui es un conjunto de habilidades en crecimiento para pulir interfaces de usuario construidas por Agentes de IA","fr":"Baseline-ui est un ensemble de compétences en constante évolution pour affiner les interfaces utilisateur construites par les Agents d''IA","de":"Baseline-ui ist ein wachsender Satz von Fähigkeiten, um Benutzeroberflächen zu verbessern, die von KI-Agents erstellt wurden","pt":"O baseline-ui é um conjunto em crescimento de habilidades para polir interfaces construídas por agentes de IA, melhorando a experiência do usuário","ru":"Baseline-ui - набор навыков для улучшения интерфейсов, построенных ИИ Агентами, для повышения пользовательского опыта","ar":"baseline-ui هو مجموعة مهارات متزايدة لتحسين الواجهات التي بناها الوكلاء الذكية، لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","en":"A growing set of skills to polish interfaces built by agents."},"definition":{"en":"A growing set of skills to polish interfaces built by agents."},"features":{"zh":["界面优化","用户体验提升","AI智能代理支持","可扩展的技能集","简单易用的API"],"ja":["インターフェースの磨き","ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上","AIエージェントのサポート","スキルセットの拡張","シンプルなAPI"],"ko":["인터페이스 최적화","사용자 경험 향상","AI 에이전트 지원","확장 가능한 스킬 세트","간단한 API"],"es":["Mejora de la interfaz de usuario","Desarrollo de aplicaciones con Agentes de IA","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Personalización de la interfaz de usuario","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas"],"fr":["Amélioration de l''interface utilisateur","Développement d''applications avec les Agents d''IA","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes"],"de":["Verbesserung der Benutzeroberfläche","Entwicklung von Anwendungen mit KI-Agents","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen"],"pt":["Melhoria da experiência do usuário","Interface personalizável","Integração com agentes de IA","Desenvolvimento ágil","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos"],"ru":["Улучшение пользовательского опыта","Настраиваемый интерфейс","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Быстрая разработка","Поддержка нескольких устройств"],"ar":["تحسين تجربة المستخدم","واجهة قابلة للتعديل","التكامل مع الوكلاء الذكية","التطوير السريع","دعم الأجهزة المتعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用baseline-ui","什么是AI智能代理","baseline-ui替代品","baseline-ui安装","AI智能代理界面优化","baseline-ui教程","baseline-ui和React","baseline-ui和Node.js"],"ja":["baseline-uiの使い方","AIエージェントとは","baseline-uiの代替","baseline-uiのインストール","AIエージェントのインターフェースを磨く","baseline-uiのチュートリアル","baseline-uiとReact","baseline-uiとNode.js"],"ko":["baseline-ui 사용법","AI 에이전트란","baseline-ui 대안","baseline-ui 설치","AI 에이전트 인터페이스 최적화","baseline-ui 튜토리얼","baseline-ui와 React","baseline-ui와 Node.js"],"es":["cómo usar baseline-ui","qué es baseline-ui","alternativas a baseline-ui","baseline-ui vs competidores","instalación de baseline-ui","guía de configuración de baseline-ui","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Agentes de IA","herramientas de interfaz de usuario para Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser baseline-ui","quoi est baseline-ui","alternatives à baseline-ui","baseline-ui vs concurrents","installation de baseline-ui","guide de configuration de baseline-ui","développement d''applications avec les Agents d''IA","outils d''interface utilisateur pour les Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man baseline-ui verwendet","was ist baseline-ui","alternativen zu baseline-ui","baseline-ui vs wettbewerber","installation von baseline-ui","einrichtungsanleitung für baseline-ui","entwicklung von anwendungen mit KI-Agents","benutzeroberflächen-tools für KI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar baseline-ui","o que é baseline-ui","alternativas para baseline-ui","baseline-ui vs react","instalar baseline-ui","guia de configuração do baseline-ui","desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать baseline-ui","что такое baseline-ui","альтернативы baseline-ui","baseline-ui vs react","установить baseline-ui","руководство по настройке baseline-ui","разработка интерфейсов пользователя","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام baseline-ui","ما هو baseline-ui","بديلات ل baseline-ui","baseline-ui مقابل رياكت","تثبيت baseline-ui","دليل إعداد baseline-ui","تطوير واجهات المستخدم","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"ibelick","repo":"ui-skills","repoPath":"ibelick/ui-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.667Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"baseline-ui","description":"Validates animation durations, enforces typography scale, checks component accessibility, and prevents layout anti-patterns in Tailwind CSS projects. Use when building UI components, reviewing CSS utilities, styling React views, or enforcing design consistency.","bodyPreview":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requ","body":"# Baseline UI\n\nEnforces an opinionated UI baseline to prevent AI-generated interface slop.\n\n## How to use\n\n- `/baseline-ui`\n  Apply these constraints to any UI work in this conversation.\n\n- `/baseline-ui <file>`\n  Review the file against all constraints below and output:\n  - violations (quote the exact line/snippet)\n  - why it matters (1 short sentence)\n  - a concrete fix (code-level suggestion)\n\n## Stack\n\n- MUST use Tailwind CSS defaults unless custom values already exist or are explicitly requested\n- MUST use `motion/react` (formerly `framer-motion`) when JavaScript animation is required\n- SHOULD use `tw-animate-css` for entrance and micro-animations in Tailwind CSS\n- MUST use `cn` utility (`clsx` + `tailwind-merge`) for class logic\n\n## Components\n\n- MUST use accessible component primitives for anything with keyboard or focus behavior (`Base UI`, `React Aria`, `Radix`)\n- MUST use the project’s existing component primitives first\n- NEVER mix primitive systems within the same interaction surface\n- SHOULD prefer [`Base UI`](https://base-ui.com/react/components) for new primitives if compatible with the stack\n- MUST add an `aria-label` to icon-only buttons\n- NEVER rebuild keyboard or focus behavior by hand unless explicitly requested\n\n## Interaction\n\n- MUST use an `AlertDialog` for destructive or irreversible actions\n- SHOULD use structural skeletons for loading states\n- NEVER use `h-screen`, use `h-dvh`\n- MUST respect `safe-area-inset` for fixed elements\n- MUST show errors next to where the action happens\n- NEVER block paste in `input` or `textarea` elements\n\n## Animation\n\n- NEVER add animation unless it is explicitly requested\n- MUST animate only compositor props (`transform`, `opacity`)\n- NEVER animate layout properties (`width`, `height`, `top`, `left`, `margin`, `padding`)\n- SHOULD avoid animating paint properties (`background`, `color`) except for small, local UI (text, icons)\n- SHOULD use `ease-out` on entrance\n- NEVER exceed `200ms` for interaction feedback\n- MUST pause looping animations when off-screen\n- SHOULD respect `prefers-reduced-motion`\n- NEVER introduce custom easing curves unless explicitly requested\n- SHOULD avoid animating large images or full-screen surfaces\n\n## Typography\n\n- MUST use `text-balance` for headings and `text-pretty` for body/paragraphs\n- MUST use `tabular-nums` for data\n- SHOULD use `truncate` or `line-clamp` for dense UI\n- NEVER modify `letter-spacing` (`tracking-*`) unless explicitly requested\n\n## Layout\n\n- MUST use a fixed `z-index` scale (no arbitrary `z-*`)\n- SHOULD use `size-*` for square elements instead of `w-*` + `h-*`\n\n## Performance\n\n- NEVER animate large `blur()` or `backdrop-filter` surfaces\n- NEVER apply `will-change` outside an active animation\n- NEVER use `useEffect` for anything that can be expressed as render logic\n\n## Design\n\n- NEVER use gradients unless explicitly requested\n- NEVER use purple or multicolor gradients\n- NEVER use glow effects as primary affordances\n- SHOULD use Tailwind CSS default shadow scale unless explicitly requested\n- MUST give empty states one clear next action\n- SHOULD limit accent color usage to one per view\n- SHOULD use existing theme or Tailwind CSS color tokens before introducing new ones\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:09.119Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing standardized and polished interface generation with Tailwind CSS.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化和精致界面生成的前端代理，使用 Tailwind CSS。","ja":"Tailwind CSS を使用して標準化されたインターフェース生成が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS를 사용하여 표준화된 인터페이스 생성이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan generación de interfaces estandarizadas y pulidas con Tailwind CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une génération d''interfaces standardisées et polies avec Tailwind CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine standardisierte und polierte Schnittstellengenerierung mit Tailwind CSS benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de geração de interface padronizada e polida com Tailwind CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым нужна стандартизированная и отполированная генерация интерфейса с помощью Tailwind CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد واجهة معيارية ومحسنة مع Tailwind CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a consistent UI baseline, utilizing Tailwind CSS defaults and preventing interface slop, while providing concrete code-level fixes for violations.","zh":"赋予代理人一致的 UI 基线，利用 Tailwind CSS 默认值并防止界面混乱，同时提供代码级修复以解决违规行为。","ja":"エージェントに一貫した UI ベースラインを実施する権限を与え、Tailwind CSS のデフォルト値を利用し、インターフェースの混乱を防ぎ、違反に対する具体的なコードレベルの修正を提供します。","ko":"에이전트에게 일관된 UI 기준을 적용할 수 있는 권한을 부여하여 Tailwind CSS 기본값을 활용하고 인터페이스의 불일치를 방지하며 위반에 대한 구체적인 코드 수준의 수정을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una línea de base de interfaz de usuario coherente, utilizando los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS y evitando la desviación de la interfaz, al tiempo que proporciona soluciones concretas a nivel de código para las violaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une ligne de base d''interface utilisateur cohérente, en utilisant les valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS et en évitant les déviations d''interface, tout en fournissant des corrections concrètes au niveau du code pour les violations.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine konsistente Benutzeroberflächen-Baseline durchzusetzen, indem sie die Standardwerte von Tailwind CSS nutzen und die Schnittstellenabweichung vermeiden, während sie gleichzeitig konkrete Code-Level-Korrekturen für Verletzungen bereitstellen.","pt":"Concede aos agentes a capacidade de impor uma linha de base de interface do usuário consistente, utilizando os padrões do Tailwind CSS e prevenindo a deterioração da interface, ao mesmo tempo em que fornece soluções concretas de nível de código para violações.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить последовательную базовую линию пользовательского интерфейса, используя настройки по умолчанию Tailwind CSS и предотвращая ухудшение интерфейса, а также предоставляя конкретные исправления на уровне кода для нарушений.","ar":"يعطي الوكلاء القدرة على فرض قاعدة موحدة لخط واجهة المستخدم، باستخدام الإعدادات الافتراضية ل Tailwind CSS ومنع الانحدار في الواجهة، مع تقديم إصلاحات محددة على مستوى الكود للانتهاكات."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing uniform UI standards across multiple interfaces","Debugging UI inconsistencies with automated violation detection","Reviewing and refining interface code for compliance with Tailwind CSS defaults"],"zh":["在多个接口中执行统一的 UI 标准","使用自动化的违规检测来调试 UI 不一致性","审查和完善界面代码以符合 Tailwind CSS 默认值"],"ja":["複数のインターフェースで統一された UI 標準を実施する","自動化された違反検出を使用して UI の不一致性をデバッグする","Tailwind CSS のデフォルト値に準拠するインターフェースコードをレビューおよび改良する"],"ko":["여러 인터페이스에 걸쳐 일관된 UI 표준을 구현하는 것","자동화된 위반 감지를 사용하여 UI 불일치성을 디버깅하는 것","Tailwind CSS 기본값을 준수하는 인터페이스 코드를 검토 및 개선하는 것"],"es":["Aplicar normas de interfaz de usuario uniformes en varias interfaces","Depurar inconsistencias de interfaz de usuario con detección automática de violaciones","Revisar y perfeccionar el código de interfaz para que cumpla con los valores predeterminados de Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des normes d''interface utilisateur uniformes sur plusieurs interfaces","Déboguer les incohérences d''interface utilisateur avec la détection automatique des violations","Réviser et affiner le code d''interface pour qu''il soit conforme aux valeurs par défaut de Tailwind CSS"],"de":["Einheitliche Benutzeroberflächen-Standards über mehrere Schnittstellen hinweg durchsetzen","Benutzeroberflächen-Inkonsistenzen mit automatisierter Verletzungs-Erkennung debuggen","Schnittstellen-Code überprüfen und verfeinern, um die Einhaltung der Standardwerte von Tailwind CSS sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Impor padrões de interface do usuário uniformes em várias interfaces","Depurar inconsistências de interface do usuário com detecção automática de violações","Revisar e aperfeiçoar o código de interface para conformidade com os padrões do Tailwind CSS"],"ru":["Внедрение единых стандартов пользовательского интерфейса на нескольких интерфейсах","Отладка несоответствий пользовательского интерфейса с автоматическим обнаружением нарушений","Проверка и доработка кода интерфейса для соответствия настройкам по умолчанию Tailwind CSS"],"ar":["فرض معايير موحدة لواجهة المستخدم عبر واجهات متعددة","تصحيح عدم الاتساق في واجهة المستخدم بالكشف التلقائي عن الانتهكات","مراجعة وتحسين كود واجهة المستخدم للامتثال للقيم الافتراضية ل Tailwind CSS"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS setup","Limited to UI work within the conversation or specified file"],"zh":["需要 Tailwind CSS 设置","仅限于对话或指定文件内的 UI 工作"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS の設定が必要","会話または指定されたファイル内でのみ UI 作業が可能"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 설정이 필요","대화 또는 지정된 파일 내에서의 UI 작업만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Tailwind CSS","Limitado a trabajos de interfaz de usuario dentro de la conversación o del archivo especificado"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Tailwind CSS","Limité aux travaux d''interface utilisateur dans la conversation ou le fichier spécifié"],"de":["Benötigt eine Tailwind CSS-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Benutzeroberflächen-Arbeit innerhalb des Gesprächs oder der angegebenen Datei"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Tailwind CSS","Limitado a trabalhos de interface do usuário dentro da conversa ou arquivo especificado"],"ru":["Требует настройки Tailwind CSS","Ограничен работой с интерфейсом пользователя внутри разговора или указанного файла"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Tailwind CSS","محدود بالعمل على واجهة المستخدم داخل المحادثة أو الملف المحدد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9bb2f868098a9d28ce7d10383039a28169d838cea6299f9df3706ecda7932949","qualityScore":24}');
