rcel和React的最新特性","简化开发流程"],"ja":["開発効率の向上","アプリケーションのパフォーマンスの最適化","専門の開発ガイダンスの提供","VercelとReactの最新機能のサポート","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["개발 효율성 향상","애플리케이션의 성능 최적화","전문적인 개발 가이드 제공","Vercel과 React의 최신 기능 지원","개발 프로세스 간소화"],"es":["Integración de Vercel y React","Automatización de tareas con Agentes de IA","Mejora del rendimiento y la eficiencia","Compatibilidad con hooks y comandos personalizados","Flujo de trabajo flexible y escalable"],"fr":["Intégration de Vercel et React","Automatisation des tâches avec des Outils d''IA","Amélioration des performances et de l''efficacité","Compatibilité avec des hooks et des commandes personnalisés","Flux de travail flexible et évolutif"],"de":["Integration von Vercel und React","Automatisierung von Aufgaben mit KI-Agenten","Verbesserung der Leistung und Effizienz","Kompatibilität mit benutzerdefinierten Hooks und Befehlen","Flexibler und skalierbarer Workflow"],"pt":["Otimização do workflow com agentes e habilidades","Integração com Vercel e React","Recursos avançados de hooks e comandos","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos web escaláveis","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Оптимизация рабочего процесса с помощью агентов и навыков","Интеграция с Vercel и React","Продвинутые функции хуков и команд","Разработка масштабируемых веб-приложений","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки"],"ar":["تحسين تدفق العمل بالوكلاء والمهارات","التكامل مع فركل ورياكت","ميزات متقدمة من الحوكات والأوامر","تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Vercel React最佳实践","AI智能代理","开发效率提高","应用性能优化","Vercel React开发指导","Vercel React最新特性","React开发最佳实践","Vercel开发最佳实践","AI工具","开发工具"],"ja":["Vercel Reactベストプラクティス","AIエージェント","開発効率向上","アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化","Vercel React開発ガイダンス","Vercel React最新機能","React開発ベストプラクティス","Vercel開発ベストプラクティス","AIツール","開発ツール"],"ko":["Vercel React 최적화 방법","AI 에이전트","개발 효율성 향상","애플리케이션의 성능 최적화","Vercel React 개발 가이드","Vercel React 최신 기능","React 개발 최적화 방법","Vercel 개발 최적화 방법","AI 툴","개발 툴"],"es":["Vercel React","Agentes de IA","Mejores prácticas de Vercel","Cómo usar Vercel con React","Alternativas a Vercel","Guía de instalación de Vercel","Configuración de Vercel React","Optimización de rendimiento en Vercel"],"fr":["Vercel React","Outils d''IA","Bonnes pratiques Vercel","Comment utiliser Vercel avec React","Alternatives à Vercel","Guide d''installation de Vercel","Configuration de Vercel React","Optimisation des performances dans Vercel"],"de":["Vercel React","KI-Agenten","Vercel Best Practices","Wie man Vercel mit React verwendet","Alternativen zu Vercel","Vercel-Installationsanleitung","Vercel-React-Konfiguration","Leistungsoptimierung in Vercel"],"pt":["como usar Vercel com React","o que é um plugin de workflow de IA","melhores práticas de desenvolvimento web","Vercel vs Netlify","instalar plugin de workflow de IA","guias de configuração de Vercel","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web escaláveis","ferramentas de desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["как использовать Vercel с React","что такое плагин рабочего процесса ИИ","лучшие практики веб-разработки","Vercel vs Netlify","установка плагина рабочего процесса ИИ","руководства по настройке Vercel","разработка масштабируемых веб-приложений","инструменты веб-разработки"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام فركل مع رياكت","ما هي إضافة تدفق العمل الذكية","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير الويب","فركل مقابل نيتليفي","تثبيت إضافة تدفق العمل الذكية","دلائل إعداد فركل","تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع","أدوات تطوير الويب"]}},"owner":"CloudAI-X","repo":"claude-workflow-v2","repoPath":"CloudAI-X/claude-workflow-v2","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.672Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vercel-react-best-practices","description":"React and Next.js performance optimization guidelines from Vercel Engineering. This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring React/Next.js code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving React components, Next.js pages, data fetching, bundle optimization, or performance improvements.","bodyPreview":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\n### When to Load\n\n- **Trigger**: React or Next.js development, component writing, data fetching patterns, bundle optimization\n- **Skip**: Project does not use React or Next.js\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React com","body":"# Vercel React Best Practices\n\n### When to Load\n\n- **Trigger**: React or Next.js development, component writing, data fetching patterns, bundle optimization\n- **Skip**: Project does not use React or Next.js\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for React and Next.js applications, maintained by Vercel. Contains 45 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n\n- Writing new React components or Next.js pages\n- Implementing data fetching (client or server-side)\n- Reviewing code for performance issues\n- Refactoring existing React/Next.js code\n- Optimizing bundle size or load times\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category                  | Impact      | Prefix       |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 1        | Eliminating Waterfalls    | CRITICAL    | `async-`     |\n| 2        | Bundle Size Optimization  | CRITICAL    | `bundle-`    |\n| 3        | Server-Side Performance   | HIGH        | `server-`    |\n| 4        | Client-Side Data Fetching | MEDIUM-HIGH | `client-`    |\n| 5        | Re-render Optimization    | MEDIUM      | `rerender-`  |\n| 6        | Rendering Performance     | MEDIUM      | `rendering-` |\n| 7        | JavaScript Performance    | LOW-MEDIUM  | `js-`        |\n| 8        | Advanced Patterns         | LOW         | `advanced-`  |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Eliminating Waterfalls (CRITICAL)\n\n- `async-defer-await` - Move await into branches where actually used\n- `async-parallel` - Use Promise.all() for independent operations\n- `async-dependencies` - Use better-all for partial dependencies\n- `async-api-routes` - Start promises early, await late in API routes\n- `async-suspense-boundaries` - Use Suspense to stream content\n\n### 2. Bundle Size Optimization (CRITICAL)\n\n- `bundle-barrel-imports` - Import directly, avoid barrel files\n- `bundle-dynamic-imports` - Use next/dynamic for heavy components\n- `bundle-defer-third-party` - Load analytics/logging after hydration\n- `bundle-conditional` - Load modules only when feature is activated\n- `bundle-preload` - Preload on hover/focus for perceived speed\n\n### 3. Server-Side Performance (HIGH)\n\n- `server-cache-react` - Use React.cache() for per-request deduplication\n- `server-cache-lru` - Use LRU cache for cross-request caching\n- `server-serialization` - Minimize data passed to client components\n- `server-parallel-fetching` - Restructure components to parallelize fetches\n- `server-after-nonblocking` - Use after() for non-blocking operations\n\n### 4. Client-Side Data Fetching (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- `client-swr-dedup` - Use SWR for automatic request deduplication\n- `client-event-listeners` - Deduplicate global event listeners\n\n### 5. Re-render Optimization (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rerender-defer-reads` - Don''t subscribe to state only used in callbacks\n- `rerender-memo` - Extract expensive work into memoized components\n- `rerender-dependencies` - Use primitive dependencies in effects\n- `rerender-derived-state` - Subscribe to derived booleans, not raw values\n- `rerender-functional-setstate` - Use functional setState for stable callbacks\n- `rerender-lazy-state-init` - Pass function to useState for expensive values\n- `rerender-transitions` - Use startTransition for non-urgent updates\n\n### 6. Rendering Performance (MEDIUM)\n\n- `rendering-animate-svg-wrapper` - Animate div wrapper, not SVG element\n- `rendering-content-visibility` - Use content-visibility for long lists\n- `rendering-hoist-jsx` - Extract static JSX outside components\n- `rendering-svg-precision` - Reduce SVG coordinate precision\n- `rendering-hydration-no-flicker` - Use inline script for client-only data\n- `rendering-activity` - Use Activity component for show/hide\n- `rendering-conditional-render` - Use ternary, not && for conditionals\n\n### 7. JavaScript Performance (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- `js-batch-dom-css` - Group CSS changes via classes or cssText\n- `js-index-maps` - Build Map for repeated lookups\n- `js-cache-property-access` - Cache object properties in loops\n- `js-cache-function-results` - Cache function results in module-level Map\n- `js-cache-storage` - Cache localStorage/sessionStorage reads\n- `js-combine-iterations` - Combine multiple filter/map into one loop\n- `js-length-check-first` - Check array length before expensive comparison\n- `js-early-exit` - Return early from functions\n- `js-hoist-regexp` - Hoist RegExp creation outside loops\n- `js-min-max-loop` - Use loop for min/max instead of sort\n- `js-set-map-lookups` - Use Set/Map for O(1) lookups\n- `js-tosorted-immutable` - Use toSorted() for immutability\n\n### 8. Advanced Patterns (LOW)\n\n- `advanced-event-handler-refs` - Store event handlers in refs\n- `advanced-use-latest` - useLatest for stable callback refs\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor the complete guide with all rules expanded and detailed code examples, see: `AGENTS.md`\n\nEach rule contains:\n\n- Brief explanation of why it matters\n- Incorrect code example with explanation\n- Correct code example with explanation\n- Additional context and references\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:16.032Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents focusing on React and Next.js development, seeking to optimize performance and follow best practices","zh":"非常适合专注于React和Next.js开发的前端代理，寻求优化性能和遵循最佳实践","ja":"ReactとNext.jsの開発に重点を置くフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、パフォーマンスを最適化し、ベストプラクティスに従うことを目指している","ko":"React와 Next.js 개발에 중점을 둔 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합하며, 성능을 최적화하고 최선의 관행을 따르는 것을 목표로 하는 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que se centran en el desarrollo de React y Next.js, y que buscan optimizar el rendimiento y seguir las mejores prácticas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui se concentrent sur le développement React et Next.js, et qui cherchent à optimiser les performances et à suivre les meilleures pratiques","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung von React und Next.js konzentrieren und die Leistung optimieren und die besten Praktiken befolgen möchten","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que se concentram no desenvolvimento de React e Next.js, buscando otimizar o desempenho e seguir as melhores práticas","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, специализирующихся на разработке React и Next.js, стремящихся оптимизировать производительность и следовать лучшим практикам","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم التي تركز على تطوير React و Next.js، سعياً لتحسين الأداء اتباع أفضل الممارسات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate refactoring and code generation for React and Next.js applications using Vercel''s comprehensive performance optimization guide, covering 45 rules across 8 categories, including bundle optimization and data fetching patterns","zh":"赋予代理人使用Vercel的综合性能优化指南为React和Next.js应用程序自动化重构和代码生成的能力，涵盖45条规则，跨8个类别，包括包优化和数据获取模式","ja":"Vercelの包括的なパフォーマンス最適化ガイドを使用して、ReactとNext.jsアプリケーションに自動リファクタリングとコード生成を実行する機能をエージェントに与え、45のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたってカバーし、バンドル最適化とデータ取得パターンを含む","ko":"Vercel의 종합적 성능 최적화 가이드를 사용하여 React와 Next.js 애플리케이션에 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행하는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여하며, 45개의 규칙을 8개 범주에 걸쳐 다루며, 번들 최적화 및 데이터 가져오기 패턴을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la refactorización y la generación de código para aplicaciones React y Next.js utilizando la guía integral de optimización del rendimiento de Vercel, que cubre 45 reglas en 8 categorías, incluyendo la optimización de paquetes y los patrones de obtención de datos","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la refactoring et la génération de code pour les applications React et Next.js en utilisant le guide complet d''optimisation des performances de Vercel, couvrant 45 règles dans 8 catégories, notamment l''optimisation des bundles et les modèles de récupération de données","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, die Refactoring und Codegenerierung für React- und Next.js-Anwendungen zu automatisieren, indem sie den umfassenden Leistungs-Optimierungsleitfaden von Vercel verwenden, der 45 Regeln in 8 Kategorien abdeckt, einschließlich Bundle-Optimierung und Datenabrufmuster","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a refatoração e a geração de código para aplicações React e Next.js usando o guia abrangente de otimização de desempenho da Vercel, que abrange 45 regras em 8 categorias, incluindo otimização de bundle e padrões de busca de dados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рефакторинг и генерацию кода для приложений React и Next.js с помощью всестороннего руководства Vercel по оптимизации производительности, охватывающего 45 правил в 8 категориях, включая оптимизацию пакета и шаблоны запроса данных","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تautomatizar إعادة هيكلة وتوليد الكود لتقديم React و Next.js باستخدام دليل شامل لتحسين الأداء من Vercel، الذي يغطي 45 قاعدة في 8 فئات، بما في ذلك تحسين الحزمة وأنماط استرجاع البيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code reviews for React components","Generating optimized code for Next.js pages","Debugging performance issues in React applications"],"zh":["自动化React组件的代码审查","为Next.js页面生成优化代码","调试React应用程序的性能问题"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントのコードレビューを自動化する","Next.jsページの最適化コードを生成する","Reactアプリケーションのパフォーマンスの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트의 코드 리뷰를 자동화","Next.js 페이지의 최적화 코드를 생성","React 애플리케이션의 성능 문제를 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar las revisiones de código para componentes React","Generar código optimizado para páginas Next.js","Depurar problemas de rendimiento en aplicaciones React"],"fr":["Automatiser les revues de code pour les composants React","Générer du code optimisé pour les pages Next.js","Déboguer les problèmes de performances dans les applications React"],"de":["Automatisieren von Code-Reviews für React-Komponenten","Generieren von optimiertem Code für Next.js-Seiten","Debuggen von Leistungsproblemen in React-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de código para componentes React","Gerar código otimizado para páginas Next.js","Depurar problemas de desempenho em aplicações React"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку кода для компонентов React","Генерировать оптимизированный код для страниц Next.js","Отладить проблемы производительности в приложениях React"],"ar":["توسيع مراجعة الكود التلقائي لمكونات React","توليد كود محسّن لأجزاء Next.js","تصحيح مشاكل الأداء في تطبيقات React"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React or Next.js project setup","Limited to React and Next.js frameworks"],"zh":["需要React或Next.js项目设置","仅限于React和Next.js框架"],"ja":["ReactまたはNext.jsプロジェクトの設定が必要","ReactとNext.jsフレームワークのみに限定"],"ko":["React 또는 Next.js 프로젝트 설정이 필요","React와 Next.js 프레임워크에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de proyecto React o Next.js","Limitado a los frameworks React y Next.js"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet React ou Next.js","Limité aux frameworks React et Next.js"],"de":["Benötigt React- oder Next.js-Projektsetup","Begrenzt auf React- und Next.js-Frameworks"],"pt":["Exige configuração do projeto React ou Next.js","Limitado aos quadros React e Next.js"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта React или Next.js","Ограничен фреймворками React и Next.js"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع React أو Next.js","محدود بإطارات العمل React و Next.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4c0cd31ccfe6314b8209218baaf9e1721d08ee30955ff023d2e6cd48fde0e945","qualityScore":24}');
