AI 에이전트 스킬의集合으로, AI 애플리케이션의 개발과 배포에 사용됩니다","es":"La colección de habilidades del agente de AI en Python ofrece una variedad de herramientas y recursos para desarrolladores","fr":"La collection de compétences de l''agent IA en Python propose une variété d''outils et de ressources pour les développeurs","de":"Die Sammlung von Fähigkeiten des AI-Agents in Python bietet eine Vielzahl von Tools und Ressourcen für Entwickler","pt":"Aprenda a criar soluções de IA em Python com nossa coleção de habilidades de agentes de IA","ru":"Узнайте, как создавать решения ИИ на Python с нашей коллекцией навыков ИИ агентов","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي بال파이썬 مع مجموعة مهارات وكالات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"A collection of AI agent skills following the Agent Skills open format"},"definition":{"en":"A collection of AI agent skills following the Agent Skills open format"},"features":{"zh":["支持Python开发和部署AI智能代理","遵循Agent Skills开放格式","提供AI应用开发和部署的解决方案","支持多种AI算法和模型","易于使用和集成"],"ja":["Pythonを使用したAIエージェントの開発と展開をサポート","AIエージェントスキルのオープンフォーマットに基づく","AIアプリケーションの開発と展開のソリューションを提供","多種のAIアルゴリズムとモデルをサポート","使用と統合が容易"],"ko":["Python을 사용하여 AI 에이전트의 개발과 배포를 지원","AI 에이전트 스킬의 오픈 포맷을 따름","AI 애플리케이션의 개발과 배포의 솔루션을 제공","다양한 AI 알고리즘과 모델을 지원","사용과 통합이 용이"],"es":["Soporte para Python 3.x","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con diferentes frameworks","Documentación detallada","Comunidad activa de desarrolladores"],"fr":["Prise en charge de Python 3.x","Intégration avec des outils de développement","Compatibilité avec différents frameworks","Documentation détaillée","Communauté active de développeurs"],"de":["Unterstützung für Python 3.x","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Frameworks","Detaillierte Dokumentation","Aktive Entwicklergemeinschaft"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA em Python","Integração com bibliotecas de aprendizado de máquina","Criação de agentes de IA personalizados","Otimização de desempenho de agentes de IA","Integração com outros serviços de IA"],"ru":["Разработка решений ИИ на Python","Интеграция с библиотеками машинного обучения","Создание индивидуальных ИИ агентов","Оптимизация производительности ИИ агентов","Интеграция с другими сервисами ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي بال파이썬","التكامل مع مكتبات التعلم الآلي","إنشاء وكالات الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة","تحسين أداء وكالات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع خدمات الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python AI智能代理","AI智能代理开发","AI应用开发","Python AI开发","AI代理技能","Agent Skills开放格式","Python AI工具","AI智能代理工具"],"ja":["Python AIエージェント","AIエージェント開発","AIアプリケーション開発","Python AI開発","AIエージェントスキル","AIエージェントスキルのオープンフォーマット","Python AIツール","AIエージェントツール"],"ko":["Python AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 개발","AI 애플리케이션 개발","Python AI 개발","AI 에이전트 스킬","AI 에이전트 스킬의 오픈 포맷","Python AI 도구","AI 에이전트 도구"],"es":["cómo usar Python para AI","herramientas de AI en Python","alternativas a Python para AI","instalación de Python para AI","guía de configuración de Python para AI","desarrollo de agentes de AI en Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser Python pour l''IA","outils d''IA en Python","alternatives à Python pour l''IA","installation de Python pour l''IA","guide de configuration de Python pour l''IA","développement d''agents IA en Python"],"de":["wie man Python für AI verwendet","AI-Tools in Python","Alternativen zu Python für AI","Installation von Python für AI","Konfigurationshandbuch für Python für AI","Entwicklung von AI-Agents in Python"],"pt":["como usar python para ia","o que é agente de ia","alternativas para python","python vs java","instalar python para desenvolvimento de ia","guia de configuração de python para ia","desenvolvimento de soluções de ia em python"],"ru":["как использовать python для ии","что такое ии агент","альтернативы python","python vs java","установка python для разработки ии","руководство по настройке python для ии","разработка решений ии на python"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام 파이썬 للذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هي وكالة الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل ل파이썬","파이썬 مقابل جافا","تثبيت 파이썬 لتنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد 파이썬 للذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي بال파ي썬"]}},"owner":"pproenca","repo":"dot-skills","repoPath":"pproenca/dot-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.950Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python","description":"Python 3.11+ performance optimization guidelines (formerly python-311). This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring Python code to ensure optimal performance patterns. Triggers on tasks involving asyncio, data structures, memory management, concurrency, loops, strings, or Python idioms.","bodyPreview":"# Python 3.11 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Python 3.11+ applications. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Python async I/O code\n- Choosing data structures for collections\n- Optimizing memory usage in data-intensive applications\n- Implementing concurrent or parallel processing\n- Reviewing Python code for performance issu","body":"# Python 3.11 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Python 3.11+ applications. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Writing new Python async I/O code\n- Choosing data structures for collections\n- Optimizing memory usage in data-intensive applications\n- Implementing concurrent or parallel processing\n- Reviewing Python code for performance issues\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | I/O & Async Patterns | CRITICAL | `io-` |\n| 2 | Data Structure Selection | CRITICAL | `ds-` |\n| 3 | Memory Optimization | HIGH | `mem-` |\n| 4 | Concurrency & Parallelism | HIGH | `conc-` |\n| 5 | Loop & Iteration | MEDIUM | `loop-` |\n| 6 | String Operations | MEDIUM | `str-` |\n| 7 | Function & Call Overhead | LOW-MEDIUM | `func-` |\n| 8 | Python Idioms & Micro | LOW | `py-` |\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n1. [I/O & Async Patterns](references/_sections.md#1-io--async-patterns) — **CRITICAL**\n   - 1.1 [Defer await Until Value Needed](references/io-defer-await.md) — CRITICAL (2-5× faster for dependent operations)\n   - 1.2 [Use aiofiles for Async File Operations](references/io-aiofiles.md) — CRITICAL (prevents event loop blocking)\n   - 1.3 [Use asyncio.gather() for Concurrent I/O](references/io-async-gather.md) — CRITICAL (2-10× throughput improvement)\n   - 1.4 [Use Connection Pooling for Database Access](references/io-connection-pooling.md) — CRITICAL (100-200ms saved per connection)\n   - 1.5 [Use Semaphores to Limit Concurrent Operations](references/io-semaphore.md) — CRITICAL (prevents resource exhaustion)\n   - 1.6 [Use uvloop for Faster Event Loop](references/io-uvloop.md) — CRITICAL (2-4× faster async I/O)\n\n2. [Data Structure Selection](references/_sections.md#2-data-structure-selection) — **CRITICAL**\n   - 2.1 [Use bisect for O(log n) Sorted List Operations](references/ds-bisect-sorted.md) — CRITICAL (O(n) to O(log n) search)\n   - 2.2 [Use defaultdict to Avoid Key Existence Checks](references/ds-defaultdict.md) — CRITICAL (eliminates redundant lookups)\n   - 2.3 [Use deque for O(1) Queue Operations](references/ds-deque-for-queue.md) — CRITICAL (O(n) to O(1) for popleft)\n   - 2.4 [Use Dict for O(1) Key-Value Lookup](references/ds-dict-for-lookup.md) — CRITICAL (O(n) to O(1) lookup)\n   - 2.5 [Use frozenset for Hashable Set Keys](references/ds-frozenset-for-hashable.md) — CRITICAL (enables set-of-sets patterns)\n   - 2.6 [Use Set for O(1) Membership Testing](references/ds-set-for-membership.md) — CRITICAL (O(n) to O(1) lookup)\n\n3. [Memory Optimization](references/_sections.md#3-memory-optimization) — **HIGH**\n   - 3.1 [Intern Repeated Strings to Save Memory](references/mem-intern-strings.md) — HIGH (reduces duplicate string storage)\n   - 3.2 [Use __slots__ for Memory-Efficient Classes](references/mem-slots.md) — HIGH (20-50% memory reduction per instance)\n   - 3.3 [Use array.array for Homogeneous Numeric Data](references/mem-array-for-numeric.md) — HIGH (4-8× memory reduction for numbers)\n   - 3.4 [Use Generators for Large Sequences](references/mem-generators.md) — HIGH (100-1000× memory reduction)\n   - 3.5 [Use weakref for Caches to Prevent Memory Leaks](references/mem-weak-references.md) — HIGH (prevents unbounded cache growth)\n\n4. [Concurrency & Parallelism](references/_sections.md#4-concurrency--parallelism) — **HIGH**\n   - 4.1 [Use asyncio for I/O-Bound Concurrency](references/conc-asyncio-for-io.md) — HIGH (300% throughput improvement for I/O)\n   - 4.2 [Use multiprocessing for CPU-Bound Parallelism](references/conc-multiprocessing-cpu.md) — HIGH (4-8× speedup on multi-core systems)\n   - 4.3 [Use Queue for Thread-Safe Communication](references/conc-queue-communication.md) — HIGH (prevents race conditions)\n   - 4.4 [Use TaskGroup for Structured Concurrency](references/conc-taskgroup.md) — HIGH (prevents resource leaks on failure)\n   - 4.5 [Use ThreadPoolExecutor for Blocking Calls in Async](references/conc-threadpool-blocking.md) — HIGH (prevents event loop blocking)\n\n5. [Loop & Iteration](references/_sections.md#5-loop--iteration) — **MEDIUM**\n   - 5.1 [Hoist Loop-Invariant Computations](references/loop-hoist-invariants.md) — MEDIUM (avoids N× redundant work)\n   - 5.2 [Use any() and all() for Boolean Aggregation](references/loop-any-all.md) — MEDIUM (O(n) to O(1) best case)\n   - 5.3 [Use dict.items() for Key-Value Iteration](references/loop-dict-items.md) — MEDIUM (single lookup vs double lookup)\n   - 5.4 [Use enumerate() for Index-Value Iteration](references/loop-enumerate.md) — MEDIUM (cleaner code, avoids index errors)\n   - 5.5 [Use itertools for Efficient Iteration Patterns](references/loop-itertools.md) — MEDIUM (2-3× faster iteration patterns)\n   - 5.6 [Use List Comprehensions Over Explicit Loops](references/loop-comprehension.md) — MEDIUM (2-3× faster iteration)\n\n6. [String Operations](references/_sections.md#6-string-operations) — **MEDIUM**\n   - 6.1 [Use f-strings for Simple String Formatting](references/str-fstring.md) — MEDIUM (20-30% faster than .format())\n   - 6.2 [Use join() for Multiple String Concatenation](references/str-join-concatenation.md) — MEDIUM (4× faster for 5+ strings)\n   - 6.3 [Use str.startswith() with Tuple for Multiple Prefixes](references/str-startswith-tuple.md) — MEDIUM (single call vs multiple comparisons)\n   - 6.4 [Use str.translate() for Character-Level Replacements](references/str-translate.md) — MEDIUM (10× faster than chained replace())\n\n7. [Function & Call Overhead](references/_sections.md#7-function--call-overhead) — **LOW-MEDIUM**\n   - 7.1 [Reduce Function Calls in Tight Loops](references/func-reduce-calls.md) — LOW-MEDIUM (100ms savings per 1M iterations)\n   - 7.2 [Use functools.partial for Pre-Filled Arguments](references/func-partial.md) — LOW-MEDIUM (50% faster debugging via introspection)\n   - 7.3 [Use Keyword-Only Arguments for API Clarity](references/func-keyword-only.md) — LOW-MEDIUM (prevents positional argument errors)\n   - 7.4 [Use lru_cache for Expensive Function Memoization](references/func-lru-cache.md) — LOW-MEDIUM (avoids repeated computation)\n\n8. [Python Idioms & Micro](references/_sections.md#8-python-idioms--micro) — **LOW**\n   - 8.1 [Leverage Zero-Cost Exception Handling](references/py-zero-cost-exceptions.md) — LOW (zero overhead in happy path (Python 3.11+))\n   - 8.2 [Prefer Local Variables Over Global Lookups](references/py-local-variables.md) — LOW (faster name resolution)\n   - 8.3 [Use dataclass for Data-Holding Classes](references/py-dataclass.md) — LOW (reduces boilerplate by 80%)\n   - 8.4 [Use Lazy Imports for Faster Startup](references/py-lazy-import.md) — LOW (10-15% faster startup)\n   - 8.5 [Use match Statement for Structural Pattern Matching](references/py-match-statement.md) — LOW (reduces branch complexity)\n   - 8.6 [Use Walrus Operator for Assignment in Expressions](references/py-walrus-operator.md) — LOW (eliminates redundant computations)\n\n## References\n\n1. [Python 3.11 Release Notes](https://docs.python.org/3/whatsnew/3.11.html)\n2. [PEP 8 Style Guide](https://peps.python.org/pep-0008/)\n3. [Python Wiki - Performance Tips](https://wiki.python.org/moin/PythonSpeed/PerformanceTips)\n4. [Real Python - Async IO](https://realpython.com/async-io-python/)\n5. [Real Python - LEGB Rule](https://realpython.com/python-scope-legb-rule/)\n6. [Real Python - String Concatenation](https://realpython.com/python-string-concatenation/)\n7. [Python Tutorial - Data Structures](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/datastructures.html)\n8. [CPython Exception Handling](https://github.com/python/cpython/blob/main/InternalDocs/exception_handling.md)\n9. [DataCamp - Python Generators](https://www.datacamp.com/tutorial/python-generators)\n10. [JetBrains - Performance Hacks](https://blog.jetbrains.com/pycharm/2025/11/10-smart-performance-hacks-for-faster-python-code/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:11:33.481Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced performance optimization and code generation capabilities for Python 3.11+ applications.","zh":"非常适合需要高级性能优化和代码生成能力的Python分析代理，支持Python 3.11+应用程序。","ja":"Python 3.11+アプリケーション向けに高度なパフォーマンス最適化とコード生成機能を必要とするPython分析エージェントに最適。","ko":"Python 3.11+ 애플리케이션을 위한 고급 성능 최적화 및 코드 생성 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan una optimización de rendimiento avanzada y capacidades de generación de código para aplicaciones de Python 3.11+.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python ayant besoin d''une optimisation de performances avancée et de capacités de génération de code pour les applications Python 3.11+.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die eine erweiterte Leistungsoptimierung und Codegenerierungsfunktionen für Python-3.11+-Anwendungen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de otimização de desempenho avançada e capacidades de geração de código para aplicações Python 3.11+.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация производительности и возможности генерации кода для приложений Python 3.11+.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين أداء متقدم وقدرات توليد رمز لتطبيقات بايثون 3.11+."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to apply 42 prioritized rules across 8 categories for automated refactoring, optimizing memory usage, and implementing concurrent or parallel processing using Python async I/O code and data structures for collections.","zh":"赋予代理应用42个优先规则，跨8个类别，实现自动重构、优化内存使用、并使用Python异步I/O代码和数据结构实现并发或并行处理。","ja":"エージェントに、42の優先ルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって適用する力を与え、自動リファクタリング、メモリ使用量の最適化、Python async I/Oコードおよびデータ構造を使用したコンカレントまたは並行処理を実現。","ko":"에이전트가 42개의 우선 규칙을 8개 범주에 걸쳐 적용할 수 있도록 하여 자동 리팩토링, 메모리 사용량 최적화, Python async I/O 코드 및 데이터 구조를 사용한 동시 또는 병렬 처리를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar 42 reglas prioritarias en 8 categorías para un refactorizado automatizado, optimización del uso de memoria e implementación de procesamiento concurrente o paralelo utilizando código de E/S asíncrono de Python y estructuras de datos para colecciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer 42 règles prioritaires dans 8 catégories pour un refactoring automatisé, l''optimisation de l''utilisation de la mémoire et la mise en œuvre d''un traitement concurrent ou parallèle en utilisant le code d''E/S asynchrone Python et les structures de données pour les collections.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, 42 priorisierte Regeln in 8 Kategorien anzuwenden, um ein automatisiertes Refactoring, die Optimierung des Speicherbedarfs und die Implementierung von konkurrierendem oder parallelem Verarbeiten unter Verwendung von Python-Async-I/O-Code und Datenstrukturen für Sammlungen durchzuführen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a aplicar 42 regras priorizadas em 8 categorias para refatoração automatizada, otimização do uso de memória e implementação de processamento concorrente ou paralelo usando código de I/O assíncrono Python e estruturas de dados para coleções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам применять 42 приоритизированные правила в 8 категориях для автоматической рефакторинга, оптимизации использования памяти и реализации параллельной или конкуретной обработки с помощью асинхронного кода Python I/O и структур данных для коллекций.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من تطبيق 42 قاعدة ذات أولوية في 8 فئات للتحديث التلقائي وتحسين استخدام الذاكرة وتنفيذ المعالجة المتوازية أو المتوالية باستخدام رمز بايثون I/O غير المتزامن والهياكل البيانية لل مجموعات."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing memory usage in data-intensive applications","Implementing concurrent or parallel processing in Python","Reviewing Python code for performance issues and automated refactoring"],"zh":["在数据密集型应用程序中优化内存使用","在Python中实现并发或并行处理","审查Python代码以查找性能问题并自动重构"],"ja":["データ集中アプリケーションでのメモリ使用量の最適化","Pythonでのコンカレントまたは並行処理の実装","パフォーマンスの問題を検出して自動リファクタリングするためのPythonコードのレビュー"],"ko":["데이터 집약적 애플리케이션에서 메모리 사용량 최적화","Python에서 동시 또는 병렬 처리 구현","성능 문제를 검색하고 자동 리팩토링하기 위한 Python 코드 검토"],"es":["Optimizar el uso de memoria en aplicaciones intensivas de datos","Implementar procesamiento concurrente o paralelo en Python","Revisar el código Python en busca de problemas de rendimiento y refactorizado automatizado"],"fr":["Optimiser l''utilisation de la mémoire dans les applications intensives de données","Mettre en œuvre un traitement concurrent ou parallèle en Python","Examiner le code Python pour les problèmes de performances et le refactoring automatisé"],"de":["Optimieren des Speicherbedarfs in datenintensiven Anwendungen","Implementieren von konkurrierendem oder parallelem Verarbeiten in Python","Überprüfen des Python-Codes auf Leistungsprobleme und automatisiertes Refactoring"],"pt":["Otimização do uso de memória em aplicações intensivas de dados","Implementação de processamento concorrente ou paralelo em Python","Revisão do código Python para problemas de desempenho e refatoração automatizada"],"ru":["Оптимизация использования памяти в данных интенсивных приложениях","Реализация параллельной или конкуретной обработки в Python","Проверка кода Python на наличие проблем с производительностью и автоматический рефакторинг"],"ar":["تحسين استخدام الذاكرة في التطبيقات الكثيفة بالبيانات","تنفيذ المعالجة المتوازية أو المتوالية في بايثون","مراجعة رمز بايثون لمشاكل الأداء والتحديث التلقائي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.11+","Specific to Python async I/O code and data structures"],"zh":["需要Python 3.11+","特定于Python异步I/O代码和数据结构"],"ja":["Python 3.11+が必要","Python async I/Oコードおよびデータ構造に特定"],"ko":["Python 3.11+가 필요","Python async I/O 코드 및 데이터 구조에 특정"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.11+","Específico para código de E/S asíncrono de Python y estructuras de datos"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.11+","Spécifique au code d''E/S asynchrone Python et aux structures de données"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.11+","Spezifisch für Python-Async-I/O-Code und Datenstrukturen"],"pt":["Requer Python 3.11+","Específico para código de I/O assíncrono Python e estruturas de dados"],"ru":["Требуется Python 3.11+","Специфичен для асинхронного кода Python I/O и структур данных"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3.11+","محدد لرمز بايثون I/O غير المتزامن والهياكل البيانية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3edd3aec6633d9ebff35c7e2e59948dc069a4dbb957ad0c08353c19885b6953f","qualityScore":24}');
