nd lots more. Inspired by Rails."},"features":{"zh":["内置代码生成","认证和权限管理","ORM（gorm）支持","会话管理","部署和作业队列","pub/sub（通过WebSockets）"],"ja":["コード生成","認証と権限管理","ORM（gorm）サポート","セッション管理","デプロイとジョブキュー","pub/sub（WebSockets経由）"],"ko":["코드 생성","인증 및 권한 관리","ORM（gorm）지원","세션 관리","배포 및 작업 큐","pub/sub（WebSocket을 통해）"],"es":["Soporte integrado para generación de código","Autenticación y autorización","ORM con gorm","Colas de trabajo y publicación/suscripción","Despliegues y sesiones"],"fr":["Prise en charge intégrée de la génération de code","Authentification et autorisation","ORM avec gorm","Files d''attente et publication/abonnement","Déploiements et sessions"],"de":["Integrierte Unterstützung für Codegenerierung","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","ORM mit gorm","Job-Queues und Pub/Sub","Deployments und Sitzungen"],"pt":["Geração de código","Autenticação","ORM (gorm)","Sessões","Deployments","Fila de trabalhos"],"ru":["Кодогенерация","Аутентификация","ORM (gorm)","Сессии","Развертывания","Очередь заданий"],"ar":["генерація コード","المصادقة","ORM (gorm)","الدورات","التحديثات","طابور المهام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Go框架","全栈开发","monolith-websocket-pubsub教程","Go语言开发","Web应用开发","代码生成工具","认证和权限管理","ORM框架","部署和作业队列","pub/sub消息队列"],"ja":["Goフレームワーク","フルスタック開発","monolith-websocket-pubsubチュートリアル","Go言語開発","Webアプリケーション開発","コード生成ツール","認証と権限管理","ORMフレームワーク","デプロイとジョブキュー","pub/subメッセージキュー"],"ko":["Go 프레임워크","풀스택 개발","monolith-websocket-pubsub 튜토리얼","Go 언어 개발","웹 애플리케이션 개발","코드 생성 도구","인증 및 권한 관리","ORM 프레임워크","배포 및 작업 큐","pub/sub 메시지 큐"],"es":["cómo usar monolith-websocket-pubsub","qué es monolith-websocket-pubsub","alternativas a monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs Rails","instalación de monolith-websocket-pubsub","guía de configuración de monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"fr":["comment utiliser monolith-websocket-pubsub","qu''est-ce que monolith-websocket-pubsub","alternatives à monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs Rails","installation de monolith-websocket-pubsub","guide de configuration de monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"de":["wie man monolith-websocket-pubsub verwendet","was ist monolith-websocket-pubsub","alternativen zu monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs Rails","installation von monolith-websocket-pubsub","konfigurationsanleitung für monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"pt":["como usar monolith-websocket-pubsub","o que é monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub alternativa","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs rails","instalar monolith-websocket-pubsub","guia de configuração monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ru":["как использовать monolith-websocket-pubsub","что такое monolith-websocket-pubsub","альтернатива monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub vs rails","установить monolith-websocket-pubsub","руководство по настройке monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام monolith-websocket-pubsub","ما هو monolith-websocket-pubsub","بديل monolith-websocket-pubsub","monolith-websocket-pubsub مقابل ريلز","تثبيت monolith-websocket-pubsub","دليل إعداد monolith-websocket-pubsub"]}},"owner":"cggonzal","repo":"monolith","repoPath":"cggonzal/monolith","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.904Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"monolith-websocket-pubsub","description":"Use when implementing real-time functionality using the built-in websocket pub/sub layer (`/ws`), including subscribe/message protocol and channel design.","bodyPreview":"# Monolith WebSocket Pub/Sub\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Building chat/live updates.\n- Debugging channel subscriptions or message broadcast behavior.\n\n## Entry points\n- Route: `GET /ws` in `app/routes/routes.go`\n- Implementation: `ws/ws.go`\n- Persistent message model: `app/models/ws.go`\n\n## Client protocol\nSend JSON commands:\n- Subscribe: `{\"command\":\"subscribe\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\"}`\n- Publish: `{\"command\":\"message\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\",\"data\":\"Hello\"}`\n\n## Server behavior\n- Hub track","body":"# Monolith WebSocket Pub/Sub\n\n## Use this skill when\n- Building chat/live updates.\n- Debugging channel subscriptions or message broadcast behavior.\n\n## Entry points\n- Route: `GET /ws` in `app/routes/routes.go`\n- Implementation: `ws/ws.go`\n- Persistent message model: `app/models/ws.go`\n\n## Client protocol\nSend JSON commands:\n- Subscribe: `{\"command\":\"subscribe\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\"}`\n- Publish: `{\"command\":\"message\",\"identifier\":\"ChatChannel\",\"data\":\"Hello\"}`\n\n## Server behavior\n- Hub tracks channel subscriptions.\n- `message` commands are persisted then broadcast to subscribed clients.\n- Client loop handles register/unregister and ping/pong lifecycle.\n\n## Extension workflow\n1. Pick channel naming strategy (room, user, domain event).\n2. Add frontend websocket client logic in `static/js/application.js` or app-specific JS.\n3. Optionally enforce auth checks before allowing subscribe/publish.\n4. Add tests in `ws/ws_test.go` style for command handling.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:58:45.579Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Real-time Update Agents requiring efficient WebSocket-based pub/sub functionality in Go","zh":"适用于需要在Go中实现高效的基于WebSocket的pub/sub功能的实时更新代理","ja":"Goで効率的なWebSocketベースのpub/sub機能を必要とするリアルタイム更新エージェントに適している","ko":"Go에서 효율적인 WebSocket 기반 pub/sub 기능을 필요로 하는 실시간 업데이트 에이전트에 적합함","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Actualización en Tiempo Real que requieren funcionalidad de pub/sub basada en WebSocket eficiente en Go","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Mise à Jour en Temps Réel nécessitant une fonctionnalité de pub/sub basée sur WebSocket efficace en Go","de":"Ideal für Echtzeit-Update-Agents, die eine effiziente WebSocket-basierte Pub/Sub-Funktionalität in Go erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Atualização em Tempo Real que exigem funcionalidade de pub/sub baseada em WebSocket eficiente em Go","ru":"Идеально для агентов обновления в реальном времени, требующих эффективной функциональности pub/sub на основе WebSocket в Go","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء التحديث في الوقت الفعلي الذين يتطلبون وظيفة pub/sub القائمة على WebSocket بكفاءة في Go"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to establish bi-directional communication using WebSockets, enabling real-time updates and live messaging via JSON commands, with built-in support for code generation, authentication, and ORM using gorm","zh":"赋予代理建立双向通信的能力，使用WebSockets实现实时更新和实时消息传递，通过JSON命令，并内置代码生成、认证和使用gorm的ORM支持","ja":"エージェントに双方向の通信を確立する能力を与え、WebSocketsを使用してリアルタイム更新とリアルタイムメッセージングを実現し、JSONコマンドを使用し、コード生成、認証、およびgormを使用したORMサポートを内蔵する","ko":"에이전트에 양방향 통신을 설정할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, WebSockets를 사용하여 실시간 업데이트와 실시간 메시징을 구현하며, JSON 명령을 사용하며, 코드 생성, 인증, gorm을 사용한 ORM 지원을 내장한다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a establecer una comunicación bidireccional utilizando WebSockets, permitiendo actualizaciones en tiempo real y mensajería en vivo a través de comandos JSON, con soporte integrado para generación de código, autenticación y ORM utilizando gorm","fr":"Permet aux agents d''établir une communication bidirectionnelle en utilisant les WebSockets, permettant des mises à jour en temps réel et un messagerie en direct via des commandes JSON, avec un support intégré pour la génération de code, l''authentification et l''ORM en utilisant gorm","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine bidirektionale Kommunikation über WebSockets herzustellen, ermöglicht Echtzeit-Updates und Live-Nachrichten über JSON-Befehle, mit integrierter Unterstützung für Codegenerierung, Authentifizierung und ORM unter Verwendung von gorm","pt":"Habilita os agentes a estabelecer uma comunicação bidirecional usando WebSockets, permitindo atualizações em tempo real e mensagens ao vivo via comandos JSON, com suporte integrado para geração de código, autenticação e ORM usando gorm","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать двустороннюю связь с помощью WebSockets, позволяя получать обновления в реальном времени и живую рассылку сообщений через JSON-команды, с встроенной поддержкой генерации кода, аутентификации и ORM с помощью gorm","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء اتصال ثنائي الاتجاه باستخدام WebSockets، مما يسمح بالتحديثات في الوقت الفعلي والتراسل المباشر عبر أوامر JSON، مع دعم مدمج لتحويل البرمجيات، المصادقة، والتعامل مع قواعد البيانات باستخدام gorm"},"useCases":{"en":["Building live update features for web applications","Debugging WebSocket channel subscriptions","Implementing real-time messaging systems"],"zh":["为Web应用程序构建实时更新功能","调试WebSocket频道订阅","实现实时消息系统"],"ja":["Webアプリケーション用のリアルタイム更新機能を構築する","WebSocketチャネルサブスクリプションのデバッグ","リアルタイムメッセージングシステムを実装する"],"ko":["웹 애플리케이션을 위한 실시간 업데이트 기능 구축","WebSocket 채널 구독 디버깅","실시간 메시징 시스템 구현"],"es":["Construir funciones de actualización en vivo para aplicaciones web","Depurar suscripciones de canales WebSocket","Implementar sistemas de mensajería en tiempo real"],"fr":["Créer des fonctionnalités de mise à jour en temps réel pour les applications Web","Déboguer les abonnements aux canaux WebSocket","Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de messagerie en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellen von Echtzeit-Update-Funktionen für Webanwendungen","Debuggen von WebSocket-Kanälen-Abonnements","Implementieren von Echtzeit-Nachrichtensystemen"],"pt":["Construir recursos de atualização ao vivo para aplicações web","Depurar assinaturas de canal WebSocket","Implementar sistemas de mensagens em tempo real"],"ru":["Построение функций обновления в реальном времени для веб-приложений","Отладка подписок на канал WebSocket","Реализация систем обмена сообщениями в реальном времени"],"ar":["بناء ميزات التحديث المباشر للتطبيقات الوب","تصحيح أخطاء اشتراكات قناة WebSocket","تنفيذ أنظمة الرسائل في الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go environment","Dependent on WebSocket protocol","Specific to monolith-websocket-pubsub framework"],"zh":["需要Go环境","依赖于WebSocket协议","特定于monolith-websocket-pubsub框架"],"ja":["Go環境が必要","WebSocketプロトコルに依存している","monolith-websocket-pubsubフレームワークに特有"],"ko":["Go 환경이 필요함","WebSocket 프로토콜에 의존함","monolith-websocket-pubsub 프레임워크에 특정됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Go","Dependiente del protocolo WebSocket","Específico del framework monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Go","Dépendant du protocole WebSocket","Spécifique au framework monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"de":["Benötigt eine Go-Umgebung","Abhängig vom WebSocket-Protokoll","Spezifisch für das monolith-websocket-pubsub-Framework"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Go","Depende do protocolo WebSocket","Específico para framework monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ru":["Требует среды Go","Зависит от протокола WebSocket","Конкретно для фреймворка monolith-websocket-pubsub"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Go","يعتمد على بروتوكول WebSocket","محدد لإطار العمل monolith-websocket-pubsub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"43f2fd627b5158f47587208d1600798762d12f6ab1a53d12f384c63c4ee4a68f","qualityScore":23}');
