uity-ledger-Tutorial","Kontinuitätsprotokoll für Entwicklungsprojekte","Alternativen zu cockpit-continuity-ledger","Installation von cockpit-continuity-ledger","Konfigurationsleitfäden für cockpit-continuity-ledger","was ist cockpit-continuity-ledger","Anwendungen von cockpit-continuity-ledger in Entwicklungsprojekten"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","cockpit-continuity-ledger","fapple codex","desenvolvimento de software","ia para desenvolvedores","guias de instalação","configuração de projetos"],"ru":["ии агенты","cockpit-continuity-ledger","fapple codex","разработка программного обеспечения","ии для разработчиков","руководства по установке","настройка проектов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","cockpit-continuity-ledger","fapple codex","تطوير البرمجيات","الذكاء الاصطناعي لملحقي التطوير","دليل التثبيت","إعداد المشاريع"]}},"owner":"future3OOO","repo":"agentic-cockpit","repoPath":"future3OOO/agentic-cockpit","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T21:17:04Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cockpit-continuity-ledger","description":"Maintain a compact continuity ledger so long-running workflows survive session compaction and restarts.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"","bodyPreview":"# Cockpit Continuity Ledger\n\nMaintain `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` as the compact source of truth for ongoing work.\n\n## Required behavior\n- Initialize once: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs init`.\n- Validate when needed: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs check`.\n- Trim when too long: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs trim`.\n- Pathing rule: when editing with patch tools, use workspace-relative `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` (never absolute `/home/...` paths).\n\n## Content quality\n- Keep entries factual a","body":"# Cockpit Continuity Ledger\n\nMaintain `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` as the compact source of truth for ongoing work.\n\n## Required behavior\n- Initialize once: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs init`.\n- Validate when needed: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs check`.\n- Trim when too long: `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs trim`.\n- Pathing rule: when editing with patch tools, use workspace-relative `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` (never absolute `/home/...` paths).\n\n## Content quality\n- Keep entries factual and short.\n- Keep the file secret-free.\n- Mark uncertainty as `UNCONFIRMED`.\n- Update at start/end of meaningful slices and when Goal/Now/Next changes.\n\n## Learned heuristics (SkillOps)\n<!-- SKILLOPS:LEARNED:BEGIN -->\n<!-- SKILLOPS:LEARNED:END -->\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:45:14.225Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing version-controlled continuity management and ledgering capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要版本控制连续性管理和账本功能的开发代理","ja":"開発エージェントがバージョン管理された連続性管理と台帳機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"버전 관리 된 연속성 관리 및 원장 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan gestión de continuidad controlada por versión y capacidades de contabilidad.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement qui ont besoin d''une gestion de continuité contrôlée par version et de capacités de comptabilité.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine versionskontrollierte Kontinuitätsverwaltung und Führungskapazitäten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de gerenciamento de continuidade controlado por versão e capacidades de ledgering.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности управления континуитетом с контролем версий и ведением журнала.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة الاستمرارية التي تسيطر عليها الإصدارات وقدرات دفتر الأستاذ."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to maintain a compact source of truth for ongoing work using `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` files, enabling validation and trimming of continuity ledgers via `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs` commands.","zh":"使代理能够使用 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 文件维护紧凑的真相源，启用通过 `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs` 命令验证和修剪连续性账本","ja":"エージェントが `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` ファイルを使用して作業のコンパクトな真実源を維持できるようにし、`node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs` コマンドを介して連続性台帳の検証とトリミングを有効にする","ko":"에이전트가 `.codex/CONTINUITY.md` 파일을 사용하여 작업의 컴팩트한 진실 소스를 유지할 수 있도록 하며, `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs` 명령을 통해 연속성 원장의 검증 및 修剪을 활성화합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a mantener una fuente de verdad compacta para el trabajo en curso utilizando archivos `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`, lo que permite la validación y el recorte de los registros de continuidad a través de comandos `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de maintenir une source de vérité compacte pour les travaux en cours en utilisant des fichiers `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`, ce qui permet la validation et le débordement des registres de continuité via des commandes `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine kompakte Wahrheitsquelle für laufende Arbeiten mithilfe von `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`-Dateien zu erhalten, wodurch die Validierung und das Beschneiden von Kontinuitätsbüchern über `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`-Befehle ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a manter uma fonte compacta de verdade para o trabalho em andamento usando arquivos `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`, permitindo a validação e o corte de registros de continuidade via comandos `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью поддерживать компактный источник правды для текущей работы, используя файлы `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`, что позволяет выполнять проверку и обрезку журналов континуитета с помощью команд `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`.","ar":"يوفر للوكلاء إمكانية الحفاظ على مصدر مضغوط للحقيقة للعمل الجاري باستخدام ملفات `.codex/CONTINUITY.md`، مما يسمح بإمكانية التحقق وتقليم سجلات الاستمرارية عبر أوامر `node scripts/continuity-ledger.mjs`."},"useCases":{"en":["Initializing continuity ledgers","Validating ledger integrity","Trimming lengthy continuity records"],"zh":["初始化连续性账本","验证账本完整性","修剪冗长的连续性记录"],"ja":["連続性台帳の初期化","台帳の完全性の検証","長い連続性レコードのトリミング"],"ko":["연속성 원장 초기화","원장 무결성 검증","길이 연속성 기록 修剪"],"es":["Inicialización de registros de continuidad","Validación de la integridad del registro","Recorte de registros de continuidad largos"],"fr":["Initialisation des registres de continuité","Validation de l''intégrité du registre","Rognage des enregistrements de continuité longs"],"de":["Initialisierung von Kontinuitätsbüchern","Validierung der Integrität des Buches","Beschneiden von langen Kontinuitätsaufzeichnungen"],"pt":["Inicializar registros de continuidade","Validar integridade do registro","Cortar registros de continuidade longos"],"ru":["Инициализация журналов континуитета","Проверка целостности журнала","Обрезка длинных журналов континуитета"],"ar":["ت 初ية سجلات الاستمرارية","التحقق من سلامة السجل","تقليم سجلات الاستمرارية الطويلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Workspace-relative pathing necessary"],"zh":["需要 Node.js 环境","工作区相对路径必要"],"ja":["Node.js 環境が必要","ワークスペース相対パスが必要"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요","작업 공간 상대 경로가 필요"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Node.js","Ruta relativa al espacio de trabajo necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Chemin d''accès relatif à l''espace de travail nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Arbeitsbereichsrelative Pfadangabe erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Necessário caminho relativo ao espaço de trabalho"],"ru":["Требуется среда Node.js","Необходимо относительное пути рабочего пространства"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","مطلوب مسار نسبي لمساحة العمل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"558a2d9b3e353184731ff1670dfde18882020b87e0238799cc4ef7ab6a75fa45","qualityScore":23}');
