ce en ligne de commande facile à utiliser"],"de":["Chat im WoW-Chat 3.3.5a aus der Konsole","CLI-Lösung für die Kommunikation mit anderen Spielern","KI-Tool für Gamer","Kompatibilität mit WoW 3.3.5a","Benutzerfreundliche Kommandozeilenoberfläche"],"pt":["Chat WoW 3.3.5a no terminal","Ferramenta de IA inovadora","Instalação e configuração fáceis","Solução para desenvolvedores","Compatibilidade com sistemas operacionais"],"ru":["Чат WoW 3.3.5a из терминала","Инновационный ИИ агент","Легкая установка и настройка","Решение для разработчиков","Совместимость с операционными системами"],"ar":["دردشة WoW 3.3.5a من الطرفية","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي مبتكرة","تثبيت وتكوين سهل","حل للمطورين","توافق مع أنظمة التشغيل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["tuicraft AI工具","WoW 3.3.5a终端聊天","如何使用tuicraft","tuicraft安装指南","tuicraft与其他AI工具的比较","WoW 3.3.5a游戏辅助工具","终端聊天工具","AI驱动的聊天功能"],"ja":["tuicraft AIエージェント","WoW 3.3.5aターミナルチャット","tuicraftの使い方","tuicraftインストールガイド","tuicraftと他のAIツールの比較","WoW 3.3.5aゲーム支援ツール","ターミナルチャットツール","AI駆動のチャット機能"],"ko":["tuicraft AI 에이전트","WoW 3.3.5a 터미널 채팅","tuicraft 사용법","tuicraft 설치 가이드","tuicraft와 다른 AI 도구의 비교","WoW 3.3.5a 게임 보조 도구","터미널 채팅 도구","AI 구동 채팅 기능"],"es":["herramientas de AI para gamers","cómo usar tuicraft","tuicraft vs otros chats de WoW","instalación de tuicraft","guía de configuración de tuicraft","alternativas a tuicraft","mejores herramientas de AI para WoW","tuicraft para principiantes"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les gamers","comment utiliser tuicraft","tuicraft vs autres chats de WoW","installation de tuicraft","guide de configuration de tuicraft","alternatives à tuicraft","meilleurs outils d''IA pour WoW","tuicraft pour les débutants"],"de":["KI-Tools für Gamer","wie man tuicraft verwendet","tuicraft vs andere WoW-Chats","Installation von tuicraft","Konfigurationsanleitung für tuicraft","Alternativen zu tuicraft","beste KI-Tools für WoW","tuicraft für Anfänger"],"pt":["tuicraft","ferramentas de IA","chat WoW 3.3.5a","terminal","desenvolvedores","instalação tuicraft","configuração tuicraft","alternativas tuicraft","guia de instalação tuicraft"],"ru":["tuicraft","ИИ агенты","чат WoW 3.3.5a","терминал","разработчики","установка tuicraft","настройка tuicraft","алтернативы tuicraft","руководство по установке tuicraft"],"ar":["tuicraft","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دردشة WoW 3.3.5a","الطرفية","المطورين","تثبيت tuicraft","تكوين tuicraft","بديلات tuicraft","دليل تثبيت tuicraft"]}},"owner":"tvararu","repo":"tuicraft","repoPath":"tvararu/tuicraft","stars":4,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T01:07:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tuicraft","description":"Use when interacting with a WoW 3.3.5a game world — sending chat messages, reading events, querying players, or managing groups via the tuicraft CLI","bodyPreview":"# tuicraft\n\nCLI client for World of Warcraft 3.3.5a. A background daemon maintains the game connection and buffers events. The daemon starts automatically on first use and stays running for 30 minutes of inactivity.\n\n## Status\n\n    tuicraft status\n\nReturns CONNECTED or an error. Check this before other commands.\n\n## Sending Messages\n\n    tuicraft send \"message\"               # say (nearby players)\n    tuicraft send -y \"message\"            # yell (wider range)\n    tuicraft send -p \"message\"","body":"# tuicraft\n\nCLI client for World of Warcraft 3.3.5a. A background daemon maintains the game connection and buffers events. The daemon starts automatically on first use and stays running for 30 minutes of inactivity.\n\n## Status\n\n    tuicraft status\n\nReturns CONNECTED or an error. Check this before other commands.\n\n## Sending Messages\n\n    tuicraft send \"message\"               # say (nearby players)\n    tuicraft send -y \"message\"            # yell (wider range)\n    tuicraft send -p \"message\"            # party chat\n    tuicraft send -g \"message\"            # guild chat\n    tuicraft send -w PlayerName \"message\" # whisper to player\n\nSlash commands work too:\n\n    tuicraft send \"/raid message\"         # raid chat\n    tuicraft send \"/e waves hello\"        # text emote\n    tuicraft send \"/dnd busy right now\"   # toggle DND status\n    tuicraft send \"/afk grabbing coffee\"  # toggle AFK status\n    tuicraft send \"/roll\"                  # roll 1-100\n    tuicraft send \"/roll 50\"               # roll 1-50\n    tuicraft send \"/roll 10 20\"            # roll 10-20\n    tuicraft send \"/1 message\"            # channel 1\n    tuicraft send \"/2 message\"            # channel 2\n\n## Reading Events\n\n    tuicraft read                  # buffered events since last read\n    tuicraft read --wait 5         # wait 5 seconds, then return events\n    tuicraft tail                  # continuous stream (blocks)\n\nAdd `--json` for structured output. Each JSON line:\n\n    {\"type\":\"PARTY\",\"sender\":\"PlayerName\",\"message\":\"hello\"}\n\n## Event Types\n\n| Type             | Meaning                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| SAY              | Nearby /say chat                                 |\n| YELL             | /yell chat                                       |\n| PARTY            | Party member message                             |\n| PARTY_LEADER     | Party leader message                             |\n| GUILD            | Guild chat                                       |\n| OFFICER          | Officer chat                                     |\n| RAID             | Raid chat                                        |\n| RAID_LEADER      | Raid leader message                              |\n| RAID_WARNING     | Raid warning                                     |\n| WHISPER          | Incoming whisper                                 |\n| WHISPER_TO       | Outgoing whisper confirmation                    |\n| CHANNEL          | Custom channel message                           |\n| EMOTE            | Player emote                                     |\n| SYSTEM           | System messages and unimplemented packet notices |\n| ENTITY_APPEAR    | NPC/player/object appeared nearby (--json only)  |\n| ENTITY_DISAPPEAR | Entity left range (--json only)                  |\n| ENTITY_UPDATE    | Entity field changed (--json only)               |\n| FRIEND_ONLINE    | Friend came online                               |\n| FRIEND_OFFLINE   | Friend went offline                              |\n| FRIEND_ADDED     | Friend added to list                             |\n| FRIEND_REMOVED   | Friend removed from list                         |\n| FRIEND_ERROR     | Friend operation error                           |\n\nThe `channel` field appears on CHANNEL events only.\n\nEntity events include `guid`, `objectType`, `name`, and type-specific fields like `level`, `health`, `maxHealth`, `x`, `y`, `z`.\n\n## Who Queries\n\n    tuicraft who              # all online players\n    tuicraft who \"warrior\"    # filter by name/class/etc\n\n## Group Commands\n\n    tuicraft send \"/invite PlayerName\"   # invite to group\n    tuicraft send \"/kick PlayerName\"     # remove from group\n    tuicraft send \"/leave\"               # leave group\n    tuicraft send \"/leader PlayerName\"   # transfer leadership\n    tuicraft send \"/accept\"              # accept group invite\n    tuicraft send \"/decline\"             # decline group invite\n\n## Friends List\n\n    tuicraft send \"/friends\"                # show friends list\n    tuicraft send \"/friend add PlayerName\"  # add friend\n    tuicraft send \"/friend remove PlayerName\" # remove friend\n\nIPC verbs:\n\n    echo \"FRIENDS\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n    echo \"FRIENDS_JSON\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n    echo \"ADD_FRIEND PlayerName\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n    echo \"DEL_FRIEND PlayerName\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n\n## Entity Queries\n\nThe daemon exposes `NEARBY` and `NEARBY_JSON` IPC verbs for querying tracked entities:\n\n    echo \"NEARBY\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n    echo \"NEARBY_JSON\" | nc -U $TMPDIR/tuicraft-$(id -u)/sock\n\nIn the TUI, toggle entity event display with `/tuicraft entities on|off`.\n\n## Openclaw Integration\n\nComplete example: forward party chat to an openclaw agent, filtering out the\nagent''s own character to prevent feedback loops. Each agent turn runs in the\nbackground so the pipeline doesn''t block.\n\n    tuicraft tail --json \\\n      | jq -r --unbuffered ''\n          select((.type == \"PARTY\" or .type == \"PARTY_LEADER\")\n            and .sender != \"Xia\")\n          | \"\\(.sender): \\(.message)\"'' \\\n      | while IFS= read -r line; do\n          openclaw agent --agent x \\\n            --message \"$line\" \\\n            </dev/null >/dev/null 2>&1 &\n        done\n\nReplace `Xia` with the agent''s WoW character name and `x` with the openclaw\nagent id. The agent can respond in-game with `tuicraft send -p \"message\"`.\n\nTo watch different event types, change the jq `select` filter:\n\n| Filter               | Events                         |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `.type == \"WHISPER\"` | Incoming whispers only         |\n| `.type == \"GUILD\"`   | Guild chat only                |\n| `.type != \"SYSTEM\"`  | Everything except system noise |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T02:18:21.043Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Terminal Interaction Agents requiring seamless World of Warcraft 3.3.5a chat integration","zh":"适用于需要无缝集成World of Warcraft 3.3.5a聊天功能的终端交互代理","ja":"World of Warcraft 3.3.5aのチャット機能を無制限に統合するターミナルインタラクションエージェントに最適","ko":"World of Warcraft 3.3.5a 채팅 기능을无缝으로 통합해야 하는 터미널 상호 작용 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Interacción de Terminal que requieren una integración de chat de World of Warcraft 3.3.5a sin problemas","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Interaction de Terminal nécessitant une intégration de chat de World of Warcraft 3.3.5a sans interruption","de":"Ideal für Terminal-Interaktionsagenten, die eine nahtlose World of Warcraft 3.3.5a-Chat-Integration erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Interação de Terminal que exigem integração de chat sem interrupções do World of Warcraft 3.3.5a","ru":"Идеально для агентов терминального взаимодействия, требующих бесперебойной интеграции чата World of Warcraft 3.3.5a","ar":"مثالي لعميل التفاعل الطرفي الذي يتطلب دمج الدردشة بدون انقطاع مع لعبة World of Warcraft 3.3.5a"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to send messages via the CLI client, utilizing commands like ''tuicraft send'' for nearby players, ''tuicraft send -y'' for yelling, and maintaining a background daemon for persistent game connection, all while handling events and buffering through protocols like the WoW 3.3.5a API","zh":"赋予代理通过CLI客户端发送消息的能力，使用诸如''tuicraft send''的命令向附近的玩家发送消息，使用''tuicraft send -y''进行大喊，并保持后台守护进程以保持游戏连接，同时处理事件并通过诸如WoW 3.3.5a API的协议进行缓冲","ja":"CLIクライアント経由でメッセージを送信するエージェントの能力を提供し、''tuicraft send''などのコマンドを使用して近くのプレイヤーにメッセージを送信し、''tuicraft send -y''を使用して大声で叫び、バックグラウンドデーモンを維持してゲーム接続を維持し、イベントを処理し、WoW 3.3.5a APIなどのプロトコルを介してバッファリング","ko":"에이전트가 CLI 클라이언트를 통해 메시지를 전송할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, ''tuicraft send''와 같은 명령어를 사용하여 근처의 플레이어에게 메시지를 전송하고, ''tuicraft send -y''를 사용하여 큰 소리로 외치고, 게임 연결을 유지하기 위해 백그라운드 데몬을 유지하며, 이벤트를 처리하고 WoW 3.3.5a API와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 버퍼링","es":"Habilita a los agentes para enviar mensajes a través del cliente CLI, utilizando comandos como ''tuicraft send'' para jugadores cercanos, ''tuicraft send -y'' para gritar, y mantener un daemon en segundo plano para una conexión de juego persistente, todo mientras se manejan eventos y se realizan bufferizaciones a través de protocolos como la API de WoW 3.3.5a","fr":"Permet aux agents d''envoyer des messages via le client CLI, en utilisant des commandes comme ''tuicraft send'' pour les joueurs à proximité, ''tuicraft send -y'' pour crier, et en maintenant un démon en arrière-plan pour une connexion de jeu persistante, le tout en gérant les événements et en tamponnant à travers des protocoles comme l''API de WoW 3.3.5a","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Nachrichten über den CLI-Client zu senden, indem Befehle wie ''tuicraft send'' für nahegelegene Spieler, ''tuicraft send -y'' für laute Nachrichten und das Aufrechterhalten eines Hintergrund-Daemons für eine persistente Spielverbindung verwendet werden, während Ereignisse und Puffer über Protokolle wie die WoW 3.3.5a-API gehandhabt werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes enviem mensagens por meio do cliente CLI, utilizando comandos como ''tuicraft send'' para jogadores próximos, ''tuicraft send -y'' para gritar, e manter um daemon em segundo plano para conexão de jogo persistente, lidando com eventos e bufferizando por meio de protocolos como a API do WoW 3.3.5a","ru":"Позволяет агентам отправлять сообщения через клиент CLI, используя команды типа ''tuicraft send'' для ближайших игроков, ''tuicraft send -y'' для крика, и поддерживая фоновый демон для постоянного соединения с игрой, обрабатывая события и буферизируя через протоколы типа API WoW 3.3.5a","ar":"يمكن للعميل إرسال الرسائل من خلال العميل CLI، باستخدام أوامر مثل ''tuicraft send'' لللاعبين القريبين، و ''tuicraft send -y'' للصياح، والحفاظ على ديمون في الخلفية للاتصال المستمر باللعبة، معالجة الأحداث وتخزين البيانات المؤقتة من خلال بروتوكولات مثل وو وو 3.3.5a API"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating in-game communication through terminal commands","Sending targeted messages to nearby players or wider ranges","Monitoring connection status with ''tuicraft status'' for error handling"],"zh":["通过终端命令自动化游戏内通信","向附近的玩家或更广泛的范围发送有针对性的消息","使用''tuicraft status''监控连接状态以进行错误处理"],"ja":["ターミナルコマンドを使用したゲーム内通信の自動化","近くのプレイヤーまたはより広範な範囲にターゲットを絞ったメッセージを送信","''tuicraft status''を使用した接続状態の監視によるエラーハンドリング"],"ko":["터미널 명령어를 사용한 게임 내 통신 자동화","근처의 플레이어 또는 더 넓은 범위에 대상이 지정된 메시지를 전송","''tuicraft status''를 사용한 연결 상태 모니터링을 통한 오류 처리"],"es":["Automatizar la comunicación en el juego a través de comandos de terminal","Enviar mensajes dirigidos a jugadores cercanos o a rangos más amplios","Supervisar el estado de la conexión con ''tuicraft status'' para el manejo de errores"],"fr":["Automatiser la communication en jeu via des commandes de terminal","Envoyer des messages ciblés à des joueurs à proximité ou à des plages plus larges","Surveiller l''état de la connexion avec ''tuicraft status'' pour la gestion des erreurs"],"de":["Automatisieren der Kommunikation im Spiel über Terminalbefehle","Gezielte Nachrichten an nahegelegene Spieler oder weiter gefasste Bereiche senden","Überwachung des Verbindungszustands mit ''tuicraft status'' für die Fehlerbehandlung"],"pt":["Automatizar a comunicação dentro do jogo por meio de comandos de terminal","Enviar mensagens direcionadas a jogadores próximos ou a uma faixa mais ampla","Monitorar o status da conexão com ''tuicraft status'' para tratamento de erros"],"ru":["Автоматизировать коммуникацию внутри игры посредством терминальных команд","Отправлять целевые сообщения ближайшим игрокам или более широкому кругу","Отслеживать статус соединения с помощью ''tuicraft status'' для обработки ошибок"],"ar":["توفير آلي للاتصال داخل اللعبة من خلال أوامر الطرفية","إرسال رسائل مستهدفة إلى اللاعبين القريبين أو إلى نطاق أوسع","مراقبة حالة الاتصال بواسطة ''tuicraft status'' لمعالجة الأخطاء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires WoW 3.3.5a game connection","Daemon stays running for 30 minutes of inactivity","Specific to WoW 3.3.5a version"],"zh":["需要WoW 3.3.5a游戏连接","守护进程在30分钟不活动后保持运行","特定于WoW 3.3.5a版本"],"ja":["WoW 3.3.5aゲーム接続の必要性","デーモンは30分間の不活動後に実行を継続","WoW 3.3.5aバージョンに特有"],"ko":["WoW 3.3.5a 게임 연결이 필요","데몬은 30분 동안의 비활성 상태 후에도 실행을 계속","WoW 3.3.5a 버전에 특정"],"es":["Requiere conexión al juego WoW 3.3.5a","El daemon permanece en ejecución durante 30 minutos de inactividad","Específico para la versión WoW 3.3.5a"],"fr":["Nécessite une connexion au jeu WoW 3.3.5a","Le démon reste en cours d''exécution pendant 30 minutes d''inactivité","Spécifique à la version WoW 3.3.5a"],"de":["Benötigt eine Verbindung zum Spiel WoW 3.3.5a","Der Daemon bleibt 30 Minuten lang nach Inaktivität aktiv","Spezifisch für die Version WoW 3.3.5a"],"pt":["Exige conexão com o jogo WoW 3.3.5a","O daemon permanece em execução por 30 minutos de inatividade","Específico para a versão WoW 3.3.5a"],"ru":["Требует соединения с игрой WoW 3.3.5a","Демон остается запущенным в течение 30 минут бездействия","Специфичен для версии WoW 3.3.5a"],"ar":["يتطلب الاتصال باللعبة وو وو 3.3.5a","يظل الدايمون قيد التشغيل لمدة 30 دقيقة من عدم النشاط","محدد لإصدار وو وو 3.3.5a"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"452375802f7a8a0182aa14b142c86721aee34188dbf02118fa63078bd5a42049","qualityScore":21}');
