hotkey","Gestion de fenêtres efficace"],"de":["Schnelle und reaktionsfreudige Alternative zu Alt-Tab","Integration mit Komorebi","Verbesserung der Produktivität in Windows","Kompatibilität mit Autohotkey","Effiziente Fensterverwaltung"],"pt":["Alternativa rápida e responsiva para Alt-Tab","Integração com Komorebi para melhorar a produtividade","Gestão de janelas eficiente no Windows","Compatibilidade com Autohotkey","Melhoria da experiência do usuário"],"ru":["Быстрый и отзывчивый替ACEMENT для Alt-Tab","Интеграция с Komorebi для повышения производительности","Эффективное управление окнами в Windows","Совместимость с Autohotkey","Улучшение пользовательского опыта"],"ar":["بديل سريع ومتجاوب لAlt-Tab","دمج مع Komorebi لتحسين الإنتاجية","إدارة نوافذ فعالة على نظام ويندوز","توافق مع Autohotkey","تحسين تجربة المستخدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI工具","什么是Alt-Tab","Komorebi替代工具","Windows生产力提高","AI工具安装","Autohotkey脚本教程","Alt-Tab快捷键","Windows窗口管理","生产力工具比较"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","Alt-Tabとは","Komorebiの代替ツール","Windowsの生産性を向上させる","AIエージェントのインストール","Autohotkeyスクリプトのチュートリアル","Alt-Tabショートカット","Windowsウィンドウ管理","生産性ツールの比較"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용법","Alt-Tab란","Komorebi 대체 도구","Windows 생산성 향상","AI 에이전트 설치","Autohotkey 스크립트 튜토리얼","Alt-Tab 단축키","Windows 창 관리","생산성 도구 비교"],"es":["herramientas de revisión de cobertura","alternativas a Alt-Tab","Komorebi","productividad en Windows","cómo usar Autohotkey","mejores herramientas de productividad"],"fr":["outils d''examen de couverture","alternatives à Alt-Tab","Komorebi","productivité sur Windows","comment utiliser Autohotkey","meilleurs outils de productivité"],"de":["AI-Tools zur Überprüfung von Werkzeugabdeckung","Alternativen zu Alt-Tab","Komorebi","Produktivität in Windows","wie man Autohotkey verwendet","beste Produktivitätstools"],"pt":["ferramenta de revisão de cobertura de ferramentas","alternativa para Alt-Tab","Komorebi","produtividade","gestão de janelas","Autohotkey","como usar ferramenta de revisão de cobertura de ferramentas","o que é ferramenta de revisão de cobertura de ferramentas"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для просмотра инструментов","альтернатива для Alt-Tab","Komorebi","производительность","управление окнами","Autohotkey","как использовать ИИ Агент для просмотра инструментов","что такое ИИ Агент для просмотра инструментов"],"ar":["أداة مراجعة تغطية الأدوات","بديل لAlt-Tab","Komorebi","الإنتاجية","إدارة النوافذ","Autohotkey","كيفية استخدام أداة مراجعة تغطية الأدوات","ما هي أداة مراجعة تغطية الأدوات"]}},"owner":"cwilliams5","repo":"Alt-Tabby","repoPath":"cwilliams5/Alt-Tabby","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T02:02:59Z","topics":["alt-tab","autohotkey","komorebi","productivity","window-manager","windows"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-tool-coverage","description":"Audit query tools for accuracy, gaps, and retirement candidates","bodyPreview":"Enter planning mode. Audit the query tools in `tools/` for fitness. Use parallelism where possible.\n\n## Context\n\nQuery tools (`tools/query_*.ps1`) exist to give structured answers without loading full files into context. CLAUDE.md lists only the most-used tools — niche tools are intentionally omitted to save per-session context, but they''re still referenced by skills when relevant. \"Unused by CLAUDE.md\" does NOT mean unused.\n\n## Current Inventory\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `query_c","body":"Enter planning mode. Audit the query tools in `tools/` for fitness. Use parallelism where possible.\n\n## Context\n\nQuery tools (`tools/query_*.ps1`) exist to give structured answers without loading full files into context. CLAUDE.md lists only the most-used tools — niche tools are intentionally omitted to save per-session context, but they''re still referenced by skills when relevant. \"Unused by CLAUDE.md\" does NOT mean unused.\n\n## Current Inventory\n\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `query_config.ps1` | Config registry search — sections, groups, usage |\n| `query_function.ps1` | Extract function body by name |\n| `query_function_visibility.ps1` | Function definition, public/private, all callers |\n| `query_global_ownership.ps1` | Global declaration, writers, readers, manifest |\n| `query_instrumentation.ps1` | Profiler coverage map |\n| `query_interface.ps1` | File public surface (functions + globals) |\n| `query_ipc.ps1` | IPC message senders/handlers |\n| `query_messages.ps1` | Windows message (WM_) handler/sender mapping |\n| `query_profile.py` | Speedscope profile analysis |\n| `query_state.ps1` | State machine branch extractor |\n| `query_timers.ps1` | SetTimer inventory by file |\n| `query_visibility.ps1` | Public functions with few external callers |\n\n## Audit Steps\n\n### 1. Accuracy — do tools match the codebase?\n\nRun each `query_*.ps1` tool with no args (or a known-good sample query) and check:\n- Does the output parse the current file format correctly?\n- Have any source files been renamed, restructured, or split since the tool was written?\n- Are regex patterns still matching the right constructs?\n\nFlag tools that produce **silently wrong** output (no errors, but stale/incorrect data). A tool that errors loudly is less dangerous than one that lies quietly.\n\n### 2. Gaps — are there new \"load big file to find small answer\" patterns?\n\nLook for patterns in the codebase that suggest a missing tool:\n- Files over 300 lines where agents typically only need a small slice\n- Common grep patterns that could return structured answers instead of raw lines\n- Questions that require cross-referencing multiple files (e.g., \"who sends message X and who handles it\" — `query_messages.ps1` already covers this for WM_ messages; is there an equivalent need for other patterns?)\n\nThe bar: would a new tool save **>50 lines of context per use**? If not, grep is fine.\n\n### 3. Retirement — are any tools dead weight?\n\nA tool nobody invokes is dead code with maintenance cost. Check:\n- Is the tool referenced by any skill in `.claude/skills/`?\n- Is the tool listed in CLAUDE.md?\n- Does the tool''s domain still exist in the codebase? (e.g., if a subsystem was removed, its query tool should go too)\n\nNote: a tool referenced only by skills (not CLAUDE.md) is NOT a retirement candidate — it''s a niche tool by design.\n\n### 4. Cross-references — could existing skills benefit from niche tools?\n\nCheck each skill in `.claude/skills/` — could any benefit from referencing a query tool they don''t currently mention? Skills only load on invocation, so adding a niche tool reference costs zero per-session context.\n\n## Plan Format\n\n**Section 1 — Accuracy issues** (tools producing wrong output):\n\n| Tool | Issue | Fix |\n|------|-------|-----|\n| `query_config.ps1` | Registry format changed, parser misses `fmt` field | Update regex on line 42 |\n\n**Section 2 — Gap candidates** (potential new tools):\n\n| Pattern | Frequency | Context Saved | Recommendation |\n|---------|-----------|--------------|----------------|\n| \"Which files #Include X\" | ~2/session | ~80 lines | New tool: `query_includes.ps1` |\n\n**Section 3 — Retirement candidates** (genuinely unused):\n\n| Tool | Last Relevant Use | Recommendation |\n|------|------------------|----------------|\n| `query_foo.ps1` | Subsystem removed in v0.7 | Delete |\n\n**Section 4 — Skill cross-references** (niche tools that skills should mention):\n\n| Skill | Tool to Add | Why |\n|-------|------------|-----|\n| `review-dead-code` | `query_visibility.ps1` | Finds public functions with 0 callers |\n\nIgnore any existing plans — create a fresh one.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:43:11.042Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing comprehensive content analysis and tool auditing capabilities","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的 AI Agent，它们需要全面内容分析和工具审计能力","ja":"AutoGPTやLangChainのような、包括的なコンテンツ分析とツール監査能力を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"전체적인 콘텐츠 분석과 도구 감사 기능이 필요한 AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de análisis de contenido integral y auditoría de herramientas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une analyse de contenu complète et des capacités d''audit d''outils","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die umfassende Inhaltsanalyse- und Werkzeug-Audit-Funktionen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA como AutoGPT e LangChain que precisam de análise de conteúdo e auditoria de ferramentas abrangentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов AI, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, нуждающихся в всестороннем анализе контента и возможностях аудита инструментов","ar":"يُفضل لآي AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى تحليل المحتوى والتحقق من الأدوات بشكل شامل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to audit query tools in parallel using PowerShell scripts, ensuring fitness and optimizing tool coverage, while integrating with tools like Komorebi for enhanced functionality","zh":"赋予代理使用PowerShell脚本并行审计查询工具的能力，确保适用性和优化工具覆盖，同时与Komorebi等工具集成以增强功能","ja":"PowerShellスクリプトを使用してエージェントが並列でクエリツールを監査できるようにし、適合性を確保し、ツールのカバー範囲を最適化し、Komorebiなどのツールと統合して機能を強化する","ko":"PowerShell 스크립트를 사용하여 에이전트가 병렬로 쿼리 도구를 감사할 수 있도록 하여 적합성을 보장하고 도구 범위를 최적화하며 Komorebi와 같은 도구와 통합하여 기능을 강화","es":"Permite a los agentes auditar herramientas de consulta en paralelo utilizando scripts de PowerShell, garantizando la idoneidad y optimizando la cobertura de herramientas, mientras se integra con herramientas como Komorebi para una funcionalidad mejorada","fr":"Permet aux agents d''auditer des outils de requête en parallèle à l''aide de scripts PowerShell, en garantissant l''adéquation et en optimisant la couverture des outils, tout en s''intégrant à des outils comme Komorebi pour une fonctionnalité améliorée","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Abfrage-Tools parallel mit PowerShell-Skripten zu auditen, dabei die Eignung sicherzustellen und die Tool-Abdeckung zu optimieren, während es mit Tools wie Komorebi für eine verbesserte Funktionalität integriert wird","pt":"Empode agents a auditarem ferramentas de consulta em paralelo usando scripts PowerShell, garantindo a adequação e otimizando a cobertura de ferramentas, enquanto integra com ferramentas como Komorebi para funcionalidade aprimorada","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать инструменты запроса в параллельном режиме с помощью скриптов PowerShell, обеспечивая пригодность и оптимизируя покрытие инструментов, а также интегрируя с инструментами типа Komorebi для повышенной функциональности","ar":"يُمنح وكلاء إمكانية اختبار أدوات الاستعلام في متوازيل باستخدام скрипты PowerShell، وضمان ملاءمة و tối ưu hóa التغطية،同时 يدمج مع أدوات مثل Komorebi لتحسين الوظائف"},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing query tools for fitness and coverage","Optimizing tool inventory using parallelism","Integrating with Komorebi for enhanced Windows functionality"],"zh":["审计查询工具以确保适用性和覆盖范围","使用并行性优化工具库存","与Komorebi集成以增强Windows功能"],"ja":["適合性とカバー範囲を確保するためにクエリツールを監査する","並列性を使用してツールインベントリを最適化する","Komorebiと統合してWindows機能を強化する"],"ko":["적합성과 범위를 보장하기 위해 쿼리 도구를 감사","병렬성을 사용하여 도구 재고를 최적화","Komorebi와 통합하여 Windows 기능을 강화"],"es":["Auditoría de herramientas de consulta para idoneidad y cobertura","Optimización del inventario de herramientas mediante paralelismo","Integración con Komorebi para funcionalidad mejorada de Windows"],"fr":["Audit d''outils de requête pour l''adéquation et la couverture","Optimisation de l''inventaire d''outils à l''aide du parallélisme","Intégration avec Komorebi pour une fonctionnalité améliorée de Windows"],"de":["Auditing von Abfrage-Tools für Eignung und Abdeckung","Optimierung des Tool-Bestands durch Parallelverarbeitung","Integration mit Komorebi für verbesserte Windows-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Auditar ferramentas de consulta para adequação e cobertura","Otimizar o inventário de ferramentas usando paralelismo","Integrar com Komorebi para funcionalidade aprimorada do Windows"],"ru":["Аудит инструментов запроса для пригодности и покрытия","Оптимизировать инвентарь инструментов с помощью параллелизма","Интегрировать с Komorebi для повышенной функциональности Windows"],"ar":["اختبار أدوات الاستعلام لتحديد ملاءمة و تغطية","تحسين مخزن الأدوات باستخدام متوازيل","دمج مع Komorebi لتحسين الوظائف في Windows"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PowerShell scripting knowledge","Windows-specific due to Komorebi integration","Dependent on tool inventory in ''tools/'' directory"],"zh":["需要PowerShell脚本知识","由于Komorebi集成而特定于Windows","依赖于''tools/''目录中的工具库存"],"ja":["PowerShellスクリプトの知識が必要","Komorebiの統合によりWindowsに特化","''tools/''ディレクトリ内のツールインベントリに依存"],"ko":["PowerShell 스크립트 지식이 필요","Komorebi 통합으로 인해 Windows에 특화","도구/ 디렉토리 내의 도구 재고에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de scripting de PowerShell","Específico de Windows debido a la integración con Komorebi","Dependiente del inventario de herramientas en el directorio ''tools/''"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en scripting PowerShell","Spécifique à Windows en raison de l''intégration avec Komorebi","Dépendant de l''inventaire d''outils dans le répertoire ''tools/''"],"de":["Benötigt PowerShell-Skript-Kenntnisse","Windows-spezifisch aufgrund der Komorebi-Integration","Abhängig vom Tool-Bestand im Verzeichnis ''tools/''"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação em PowerShell","Específico para Windows devido à integração com Komorebi","Dependente do inventário de ferramentas no diretório ''tools/''"],"ru":["Требует знания программирования на PowerShell","Ориентирован на Windows из-за интеграции с Komorebi","Зависит от инвентаря инструментов в директории ''tools/''"],"ar":["يُطلب معرفة البرمجة باستخدام PowerShell","محدد ل Windows بسبب التكامل مع Komorebi","يعتمد على مخزن الأدوات في دليل ''tools/''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1e73ebaf48415347d7ec9714594bf48c792c06bddd8ac3fa3d693640798e1d41","qualityScore":21}');
