","Animações complexas e pixel perfeitas","Integração com Heaps","Ferramenta de IA para melhorar habilidades de desenvolvimento","Suporte a animações personalizadas"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых интерфейсов пользователя","Сложные анимации и пиксельная точность","Интеграция с Heaps","ИИ инструмент для улучшения навыков разработки","Поддержка настраиваемых анимаций"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","رسوم متحركة معقدة ومثالية","التكامل مع Heaps","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين مهارات التحwicklung","دعم الرسوم المتحركة المخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用precommit","precommit教程","Heaps动画库","像素完美UI设计","precommit安装","precommit设置指南","precommit替代品"],"ja":["precommitの使い方","precommitチュートリアル","Heapsアニメーションライブラリ","ピクセルパーフェクトなUIデザイン","precommitインストール","precommit設定ガイド","precommitの代替"],"ko":["precommit 사용법","precommit 튜토리얼","Heaps 애니메이션 라이브러리","픽셀 퍼펙트 UI 디자인","precommit 설치","precommit 설정 가이드","precommit 대체품"],"es":["herramientas de AI","precommit","animaciones perfectas","Heaps","cómo usar precommit","precommit vs otras bibliotecas","instalación de precommit","guía de configuración de precommit"],"fr":["outils d''IA","precommit","animations parfaites","Heaps","comment utiliser precommit","precommit vs autres bibliothèques","installation de precommit","guide de configuration de precommit"],"de":["KI-Tools","precommit","perfekte Animationen","Heaps","wie man precommit verwendet","precommit vs andere Bibliotheken","Installation von precommit","Konfigurationsanleitung für precommit"],"pt":["precommit","animação pixel perfeita","biblioteca de animação/UI","Heaps","ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de interfaces de usuário","animações complexas","como usar precommit","precommit vs outras bibliotecas"],"ru":["precommit","пиксельная точность","библиотека анимации/UI","Heaps","ИИ инструменты","разработка интерфейсов пользователя","сложные анимации","как использовать precommit","precommit против других библиотек"],"ar":["precommit","الرسوم المتحركة المثالية","مكتبة الرسوم المتحركة/واجهة المستخدم","Heaps","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحwicklung واجهات المستخدم","الرسوم المتحركة المعقدة","كيفية استخدام precommit","precommit مقابل مكتبات أخرى"]}},"owner":"bh213","repo":"hx-multianim","repoPath":"bh213/hx-multianim","stars":6,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T22:59:02Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"precommit","description":"Run pre-commit documentation and code hygiene checks before committing. Reviews changes since last commit, updates changelog/docs/todos, checks for missing items, and suggests a commit message.","bodyPreview":"# Pre-Commit Checks\n\nPerform the following pre-commit workflow. Report findings concisely.\n\n## 1. Review Changes\n\n- Run `git log --oneline -5` to see recent commits\n- Run `git diff --stat HEAD` to see changed files\n- Run `git diff HEAD` to see the full diff\n- Analyze all changes to understand what was added/changed/fixed\n\n## 2. Update CHANGELOG.md\n\n- Read `CHANGELOG.md` and check if any changes in the diff are NOT yet documented\n- Add entries for new features, fixes, and breaking changes under t","body":"# Pre-Commit Checks\n\nPerform the following pre-commit workflow. Report findings concisely.\n\n## 1. Review Changes\n\n- Run `git log --oneline -5` to see recent commits\n- Run `git diff --stat HEAD` to see changed files\n- Run `git diff HEAD` to see the full diff\n- Analyze all changes to understand what was added/changed/fixed\n\n## 2. Update CHANGELOG.md\n\n- Read `CHANGELOG.md` and check if any changes in the diff are NOT yet documented\n- Add entries for new features, fixes, and breaking changes under the current dev version section\n- Follow the existing format (bullet points with bold feature name and description)\n\n## 3. Update Documentation\n\n- Check if changes affect `.manim` syntax or builder/codegen API\n- If so, update `docs/manim-reference.md` (quick-lookup reference)\n- If substantial, also update `docs/manim.md` (detailed documentation)\n- Update `CLAUDE.md` if architectural patterns or key instructions changed\n\n## 4. Clean Up TODO Files\n\n- Read `todo/TODO.md` and other `todo/*.md` files\n- Remove items that have been completed (check against CHANGELOG and recent commits)\n- Do NOT remove items that are still pending or in-progress\n\n## 5. Check for Missing Items\n\nVerify:\n- No sensitive files (.env, credentials) in the diff\n- All reference images updated if visual tests changed\n- No inconsistencies between code changes and documentation\n- MEMORY.md is up to date with any new patterns or pitfalls discovered. \n- Check if anything can be removed from MEMORY.md because it is no longer relevant. Ask user if unsure.\n\n## 6. Suggest Commit Message\n\n- Follow the project''s commit message style (see recent commits)\n- Format: `area: short description` on first line\n- Add bullet points for significant changes in the body\n- Keep the first line under 72 characters\n- Do not include TODO file changes.\n\n## 7. Report Summary\n\nPresent a summary table:\n- Files changed (count)\n- Changelog entries added\n- Docs updated\n- TODOs cleaned\n- Any issues found\n- Suggested commit message\n\nDo NOT create the commit at all. Present the summary and user will commit.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T01:56:58.808Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing precise commit analysis and CHANGELOG management.","zh":"非常适合需要精确提交分析和CHANGELOG管理的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントが正確なコミット分析とCHANGELOG管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"정확한 커밋 분석 및 CHANGELOG 관리가 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan un análisis de commit preciso y gestión de CHANGELOG.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Révision de Code ayant besoin d''une analyse de commit précise et d''une gestion de CHANGELOG.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine präzise Commit-Analyse und CHANGELOG-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que precisam de análise de commit precisa e gerenciamento de CHANGELOG.","ru":"Идеально для агентов код-ревью, которым требуется точный анализ коммитов и управление CHANGELOG.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تحليل دقيق للالتزامات وإدارة CHANGELOG."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce rigorous pre-commit checks using git log, git diff, and CHANGELOG updates, ensuring accurate documentation of changes, fixes, and new features in libraries like Heaps.","zh":"赋予代理执行严格的预提交检查的能力，使用git log、git diff和CHANGELOG更新，确保像Heaps这样的库中对更改、修复和新功能的准确文档记录。","ja":"git log、git diff、CHANGELOGの更新を使用して、厳格な事前コミットチェックを実行するエージェントの能力を提供し、Heapsなどのライブラリで変更、修正、ニューフィーチャーの正確なドキュメント化を保証します。","ko":"git log, git diff 및 CHANGELOG 업데이트를 사용하여 엄격한 사전 커밋 검사를 수행하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 Heaps와 같은 라이브러리에서 변경 사항, 수정 사항 및 새로운 기능의 정확한 문서화를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar controles pre-commit rigurosos utilizando git log, git diff y actualizaciones de CHANGELOG, garantizando una documentación precisa de los cambios, correcciones y nuevas características en bibliotecas como Heaps.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des contrôles pré-commit rigoureux en utilisant git log, git diff et des mises à jour de CHANGELOG, garantissant une documentation précise des modifications, des correctifs et des nouvelles fonctionnalités dans des bibliothèques comme Heaps.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, strenge Vor-Commit-Prüfungen mithilfe von git log, git diff und CHANGELOG-Aktualisierungen durchzuführen, um eine genaue Dokumentation von Änderungen, Korrekturen und neuen Funktionen in Bibliotheken wie Heaps sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor verificações rigorosas pré-commit usando git log, git diff e atualizações do CHANGELOG, garantindo documentação precisa das alterações, correções e novos recursos em bibliotecas como Heaps.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проводить строгие проверки перед коммитом с помощью git log, git diff и обновлений CHANGELOG, обеспечивая точную документацию изменений, исправлений и новых функций в библиотеках như Heaps.","ar":"تمكن العوامل من فرض عمليات فحص صارمة قبل الالتزام باستخدام git log و git diff وتحديثات CHANGELOG، مما يضمن توثيق دقيق للتغييرات والإصلاحات والميزات الجديدة في المكتبات مثل Heaps."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing commit history with git log --oneline","Updating CHANGELOG.md for new features and fixes","Validating commit integrity with git diff --stat HEAD"],"zh":["使用git log --oneline分析提交历史","为新功能和修复更新CHANGELOG.md","使用git diff --stat HEAD验证提交完整性"],"ja":["git log --onelineを使用してコミット履歴を分析する","新機能や修正のためにCHANGELOG.mdを更新する","git diff --stat HEADを使用してコミットの完全性を検証する"],"ko":["git log --oneline을 사용하여 커밋 기록을 분석합니다.","새로운 기능 및 수정 사항에 대한 CHANGELOG.md 업데이트","git diff --stat HEAD를 사용하여 커밋 무결성을 확인합니다."],"es":["Analizar el historial de commits con git log --oneline","Actualizar CHANGELOG.md para nuevas características y correcciones","Validar la integridad de los commits con git diff --stat HEAD"],"fr":["Analyser l''historique des commits avec git log --oneline","Mettre à jour CHANGELOG.md pour de nouvelles fonctionnalités et correctifs","Valider l''intégrité des commits avec git diff --stat HEAD"],"de":["Analysieren des Commit-Verlaufs mit git log --oneline","Aktualisieren von CHANGELOG.md für neue Funktionen und Korrekturen","Validieren der Commit-Integrität mit git diff --stat HEAD"],"pt":["Analisar histórico de commits com git log --oneline","Atualizar CHANGELOG.md para novos recursos e correções","Validar integridade de commit com git diff --stat HEAD"],"ru":["Анализ истории коммитов с git log --oneline","Обновление CHANGELOG.md для новых функций и исправлений","Проверка целостности коммита с git diff --stat HEAD"],"ar":["تحليل تاريخ الالتزامات باستخدام git log --oneline","تحديث CHANGELOG.md لMUX الجديدة والإصلاحات","التحقق من سلامة الالتزام باستخدام git diff --stat HEAD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git version control system","Needs access to CHANGELOG.md file"],"zh":["需要git版本控制系统","需要访问CHANGELOG.md文件"],"ja":["gitバージョン管理システムが必要","CHANGELOG.mdファイルへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["git 버전 관리 시스템이 필요합니다.","CHANGELOG.md 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere sistema de control de versiones git","Necesita acceso al archivo CHANGELOG.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un système de contrôle de version git","A besoin d''un accès au fichier CHANGELOG.md"],"de":["Benötigt ein git-Versionssystem","Benötigt Zugriff auf die CHANGELOG.md-Datei"],"pt":["Requer sistema de controle de versão git","Necessita acesso ao arquivo CHANGELOG.md"],"ru":["Требует систему контроля версий git","Требует доступа к файлу CHANGELOG.md"],"ar":["يتطلب نظام التحكم في الإصدار git","يتطلب الوصول إلى ملف CHANGELOG.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ed004f4d5614083932863864c4e378245b7653347fe366d55bd5215ca19e9eed","qualityScore":21}');
