程","C/C++编程语言","AI工具","C/C++快速参考","C/C++编程资源","如何使用C/C++","C/C++与Java比较","C/C++安装指南","C/C++设置教程"],"ja":["C/C++チュートリアル","C/C++プログラミング言語","AIエージェント","C/C++チートシート","C/C++プログラミングリソース","C/C++の使い方","C/C++とJavaの比較","C/C++インストールガイド","C/C++設定チュートリアル"],"ko":["C/C++ 튜토리얼","C/C++ 프로그래밍 언어","AI 에이전트","C/C++ 치트 시트","C/C++ 프로그래밍 리소스","C/C++ 사용 방법","C/C++와 자바 비교","C/C++ 설치 가이드","C/C++ 설정 튜토리얼"],"es":["c++ tutorial","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","programación en c","c++ vs java","instalación de c++","guias de programación","desarrollo de software","c++ para principiantes","c++ avanzado"],"fr":["tutoriel c++","outils d''intelligence artificielle","programmation en c","c++ vs java","installation de c++","guides de programmation","développement de logiciels","c++ pour débutants","c++ avancé"],"de":["c++ tutorial","ki tools","programmierung in c","c++ vs java","installation von c++","programmierleitfäden","softwareentwicklung","c++ für anfänger","c++ fortgeschritten"],"pt":["como usar C++","o que é C++","C++ vs Java","instalar C++","guia de configuração C++","alternativas ao C++","C++ para iniciantes","tutoriais de C++","recursos de C++"],"ru":["как использовать С++","что такое С++","С++ vs Java","установить С++","руководство по настройке С++","альтернативы С++","С++ для начинающих","туториалы по С++","ресурсы С++"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام سي++","ما هو سي++","سي++ مقابل جافا","تثبيت سي++","دليل إعداد سي++","بديل سي++","سي++ للمبتدئين","دروس سي++","موارد سي++"]}},"owner":"crazyguitar","repo":"cppcheatsheet","repoPath":"crazyguitar/cppcheatsheet","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.673Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cpp","description":"Comprehensive C/C++ programming reference covering everything from C11-C23 and C++11-C++23, system programming, CUDA GPU computing, debugging tools, Rust interop, and advanced topics. Use for: C/C++ questions, modern language features, RAII/memory management, templates/generics, CUDA programming, system programming, debugging/profiling, performance optimization, cross-platform development, build systems, assembly, shell scripting, and any C/C++/CUDA development tasks.","bodyPreview":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available","body":"# C/C++ Comprehensive Cheat Sheets (/cpp)\n\nComplete C/C++ development reference combining local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, covering everything from basic syntax to advanced GPU programming and system-level development.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWhen you ask C/C++ questions, I will:\n1. **Fetch live examples** from https://cppcheatsheet.com/\n2. **Enhance with local docs** if in the cppcheatsheet repository\n3. **Provide current, comprehensive answers** from the best available sources\n\n## Coverage Areas\n\n### Modern C Programming (C11-C23)\n**Core Language:** Syntax, types, memory management, preprocessor macros\n**GNU Extensions:** Compiler-specific features and optimizations\n**Build Systems:** Makefiles, compilation, linking\n**Assembly:** X86 assembly integration and inline assembly\n\n### Modern C++ Programming (C++11-C++23)\n**Core Features:** RAII, templates, STL containers, iterators, algorithms\n**Modern Standards:** Move semantics, constexpr, lambdas, concepts, coroutines, modules\n**Memory Management:** Smart pointers, resource management, optimization (RVO)\n**Build Systems:** CMake, package management, cross-platform builds\n\n### System Programming\n**Process Management:** POSIX processes, signals, process communication\n**File Systems:** File I/O, directory operations, filesystem monitoring\n**Networking:** Sockets, protocols, network programming patterns\n**Threading:** Multithreading, synchronization, parallel programming\n**IPC:** Inter-process communication, shared memory, message queues\n\n### CUDA Programming\n**GPU Computing:** CUDA kernels, memory hierarchy, performance optimization\n**Advanced CUDA:** libcu++, Thrust library, cooperative groups\n**Multi-GPU:** GPU-GPU communication, hardware topology, NVSHMEM\n**Async Programming:** CUDA pipelines, memory visibility, asynchronous execution\n\n### Debugging & Profiling\n**Debug Tools:** GDB debugging, Valgrind memory analysis, sanitizers, binary inspection (nm, readelf, objdump, otool)\n**Performance:** Perf profiling, tracing, performance optimization\n**GPU Debugging:** Nsight Systems, CUDA debugging and profiling\n\n### System Tools & Automation\n**Shell Scripting:** Bash programming, system administration\n**System Tools:** OS utilities, networking tools, hardware inspection\n**Service Management:** Systemd, process management, system monitoring\n\n### Cross-Language Development\n**Rust Interop:** Rust for C++ developers, FFI, memory safety comparison\n**Language Bridging:** C/C++ integration, foreign function interfaces\n\n### Advanced Topics\n**Blog Content:** Deep-dive articles, RDMA networking, GPU-initiated communication\n**Low-Level Programming:** Hardware interfaces, performance tuning\n**Architecture:** System design, scalable applications\n\n## References\n\nFor detailed information, I can access:\n- **[Structure](references/structure.md)** - Complete topic-to-URL reference map\n- **[Guidelines](references/guidelines.md)** - Code quality and best practices\n\n## Quick Examples\n\n### C/C++ Core\n- \"Modern C++23 features with examples\" → Latest language standards\n- \"RAII and smart pointer patterns\" → Memory management best practices\n- \"Template metaprogramming techniques\" → Advanced generic programming\n\n### System Programming\n- \"POSIX socket programming examples\" → Network programming patterns\n- \"Multithreading with std::thread and synchronization\" → Concurrent programming\n- \"Signal handling and process management\" → System-level programming\n\n### CUDA & GPU Programming\n- \"CUDA kernel optimization techniques\" → GPU performance programming\n- \"Multi-GPU communication with NVSHMEM\" → Distributed GPU computing\n- \"CUDA memory hierarchy and optimization\" → Memory-efficient GPU code\n\n### Debugging & Tools\n- \"GDB debugging C++ applications\" → Interactive debugging techniques\n- \"Valgrind memory leak detection\" → Memory analysis and debugging\n- \"Performance profiling with perf\" → System performance analysis\n\n### Build & Development\n- \"CMake cross-platform build systems\" → Modern C++ project setup\n- \"Makefile patterns and best practices\" → C build automation\n- \"Cross-compilation and toolchain setup\" → Multi-platform development"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:18.102Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents requiring comprehensive C/C++ development capabilities and GPU programming expertise.","zh":"适合于需要全面C/C++开发能力和GPU编程专业知识的代码生成代理。","ja":"包括C/C++開発のための包括的な機能とGPUプログラミングの専門知識を必要とするコード生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"포괄적인 C/C++ 개발 능력과 GPU 프로그래밍 전문 지식을 요구하는 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Código que requieren capacidades de desarrollo de C/C++ completas y experiencia en programación de GPU.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Génération de Code nécessitant des capacités de développement C/C++ complètes et une expertise en programmation GPU.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungs-Agents, die umfassende C/C++-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten und GPU-Programmierkenntnisse erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Código que requerem capacidades de desenvolvimento abrangentes em C/C++ e especialização em programação de GPU.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по генерации кода, требующих всесторонних возможностей разработки на C/C++ и опыта программирования на GPU.","ar":"مثالي لعميل 代碼 التوليد الذي يتطلب قدرات تطوير شاملة في C/C++ وخبير برمجة GPU."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to fetch live examples from cppcheatsheet.com, enhance with local documentation, and provide current, comprehensive answers covering basic syntax to advanced system-level development using libraries and protocols specific to C/C++.","zh":"赋予代理从cppcheatsheet.com获取实时示例、使用本地文档进行增强，并提供从基本语法到使用C/C++特定库和协议的高级系统级开发的最新、全面的答案的能力。","ja":"cppcheatsheet.comからライブエクサンプルを取得し、ローカルドキュメントで強化し、基本的な構文からC/C++特有のライブラリやプロトコルを使用した高度なシステムレベルの開発までを網羅した最新の包括的な回答を提供する能力をエージェントに与えます。","ko":"cppcheatsheet.com에서 라이브 예제를 가져와 로컬 문서로 강화하고, 기본 구문에서 C/C++ 특정 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 사용하는 고급 시스템 수준 개발에 이르는 최신의 완전한 답변을 제공할 수 있는 능력을 에이전트에게 부여합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes recuperar ejemplos en vivo desde cppcheatsheet.com, mejorar con documentación local y proporcionar respuestas actuales y completas que cubren la sintaxis básica hasta el desarrollo de nivel de sistema avanzado utilizando bibliotecas y protocolos específicos de C/C++.","fr":"Permet aux agents de récupérer des exemples en direct depuis cppcheatsheet.com, d''améliorer la documentation locale et de fournir des réponses actuelles et complètes couvrant la syntaxe de base à l''amélioration du développement de niveau système en utilisant des bibliothèques et des protocoles spécifiques à C/C++.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Live-Beispiele von cppcheatsheet.com abzurufen, die lokale Dokumentation zu verbessern und aktuelle, umfassende Antworten zu liefern, die die grundlegende Syntax bis hin zur Entwicklung auf Systemebene mit Bibliotheken und Protokollen, die spezifisch für C/C++ sind, abdecken.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a buscar exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com, melhorar com documentação local e fornecer respostas atuais e abrangentes que cobrem a sintaxe básica ao desenvolvimento de nível de sistema avançado usando bibliotecas e protocolos específicos do C/C++.","ru":"Позволяет агентам получать живые примеры с cppcheatsheet.com, улучшать с помощью локальной документации и предоставлять актуальные и всесторонние ответы, охватывающие базовую синтаксис до продвинутого системного развития с использованием библиотек и протоколов, специфичных для C/C++.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء الحصول على أمثلة حية من cppcheatsheet.com وتحسين الوثائق المحلية وتقديم إجابات شاملة وحديثة تغطي الصياغة الأساسية إلى تطوير نظام متقدم باستخدام المكتبات والبروتوكولات المحددة ل C/C++."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating optimized C/C++ code snippets","Debugging system-level development issues","Enhancing local documentation with live examples from cppcheatsheet.com"],"zh":["生成优化的C/C++代码片段","调试系统级开发问题","使用cppcheatsheet.com的实时示例增强本地文档"],"ja":["最適化されたC/C++コードスニペットを生成する","システムレベルの開発問題をデバッグする","cppcheatsheet.comのライブエクサンプルを使用してローカルドキュメントを強化する"],"ko":["최적화된 C/C++ 코드 스니펫을 생성하는 것","시스템 수준 개발 문제를 디버깅하는 것","cppcheatsheet.com의 라이브 예제를 사용하여 로컬 문서를 강화하는 것"],"es":["Generación de fragmentos de código C/C++ optimizados","Depuración de problemas de desarrollo de nivel de sistema","Mejora de la documentación local con ejemplos en vivo desde cppcheatsheet.com"],"fr":["Génération de fragments de code C/C++ optimisés","Débogage des problèmes de développement de niveau système","Amélioration de la documentation locale avec des exemples en direct depuis cppcheatsheet.com"],"de":["Generierung von optimierten C/C++-Code-Snippets","Fehlerbehebung bei der Systementwicklung","Verbesserung der lokalen Dokumentation mit Live-Beispielen von cppcheatsheet.com"],"pt":["Geração de trechos de código C/C++ otimizados","Depuração de problemas de desenvolvimento de nível de sistema","Melhoria da documentação local com exemplos ao vivo do cppcheatsheet.com"],"ru":["Генерация оптимизированных фрагментов кода C/C++","Отладка проблем системного уровня разработки","Улучшение локальной документации с помощью живых примеров с cppcheatsheet.com"],"ar":["توليد شفرات C/C++ المثالية","تصحيح أخطاء تطوير نظام المستو