oration du flux de travail","Compatibilité avec les outils de développement existants"],"de":["Schneller Rust-Bundler","Rollup-kompatibler API","Unterstützung für JavaScript/TypeScript","Verbesserung des Arbeitsablaufs","Kompatibilität mit bestehenden Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Empacotador Rust rápido","API compatível com Rollup","Suporte a JavaScript/TypeScript","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Melhoria do desempenho da aplicação"],"ru":["Быстрый пакетный менеджер Rust","API, совместимый с Rollup","Поддержка JavaScript/TypeScript","Интеграция с инструментами разработки","Улучшение производительности приложения"],"ar":["حزمة رست سريعة","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع رولاب","دعم جافاسكريبت/تايبسكريبت","التكامل مع أدوات التطوير","تحسين أداء التطبيق"]},"keywords":{"zh":["upgrade-oxc教程","Rust打包器","JavaScript打包工具","TypeScript打包工具","Rollup兼容API","如何使用upgrade-oxc","upgrade-oxc安装","upgrade-oxc设置指南"],"ja":["upgrade-oxcの使い方","Rustバンドラー","JavaScriptバンドルツール","TypeScriptバンドルツール","Rollup互換API","upgrade-oxcのインストール","upgrade-oxcの設定ガイド","upgrade-oxcの代替"],"ko":["upgrade-oxc 사용법","Rust 번들러","JavaScript 번들링 도구","TypeScript 번들링 도구","Rollup 호환 API","upgrade-oxc 설치","upgrade-oxc 설정 가이드","upgrade-oxc 대체"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","upgrade-oxc","empaquetador rápido de Rust","cómo usar upgrade-oxc","alternativas a Rollup","upgrade-oxc vs Webpack","instalación de upgrade-oxc","guía de configuración de upgrade-oxc"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","upgrade-oxc","bundleur rapide Rust","comment utiliser upgrade-oxc","alternatives à Rollup","upgrade-oxc vs Webpack","installation d''upgrade-oxc","guide de configuration d''upgrade-oxc"],"de":["KI-Tools","upgrade-oxc","schneller Rust-Bundler","wie man upgrade-oxc verwendet","Alternativen zu Rollup","upgrade-oxc vs Webpack","Installation von upgrade-oxc","Konfigurationsleitfaden für upgrade-oxc"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","upgrade-oxc","empacotador rust","rollup","javascript","typescript","desenvolvimento web","otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["ии агенты","upgrade-oxc","пакетный менеджер rust","rollup","javascript","typescript","веб-разработка","оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","upgrade-oxc","حزمة رست","رولاب","جافاسكريبت","تايبسكريبت","تطوير الويب","تحسين الأداء"]}},"owner":"rolldown","repo":"rolldown","repoPath":"rolldown/rolldown","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.682Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upgrade-oxc","description":"Upgrade oxc, run codegen, and fix any breaking changes.","bodyPreview":"# Upgrade OXC\n\nCRITICAL: Run each step sequentially ONE AT A TIME. Wait for each command to FULLY COMPLETE before proceeding to the next step. DO NOT run multiple commands in parallel - they have dependencies on each other.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. `git checkout main && git pull origin main`\n2. `just setup`\n3. `npm view @oxc-project/types version` - note the version\n4. Edit `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: update `@oxc-project/runtime`, `@oxc-project/types`, `oxc-minify`, `oxc-parser`, `oxc-transform` to the version","body":"# Upgrade OXC\n\nCRITICAL: Run each step sequentially ONE AT A TIME. Wait for each command to FULLY COMPLETE before proceeding to the next step. DO NOT run multiple commands in parallel - they have dependencies on each other.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. `git checkout main && git pull origin main`\n2. `just setup`\n3. `npm view @oxc-project/types version` - note the version\n4. Edit `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: update `@oxc-project/runtime`, `@oxc-project/types`, `oxc-minify`, `oxc-parser`, `oxc-transform` to the version from step 3 (use `=x.y.z` format)\n5. `cargo search oxc_allocator --limit 1` - note the version\n6. `cargo search oxc_resolver --limit 1` - note the version\n7. Edit `Cargo.toml`: update `oxc`, `oxc_allocator`, `oxc_ecmascript`, `oxc_minify_napi`, `oxc_parser_napi`, `oxc_transform_napi`, `oxc_traverse` to version from step 5; update `oxc_resolver`, `oxc_resolver_napi` to version from step 6\n8. `cargo update oxc oxc_allocator oxc_ecmascript oxc_minify_napi oxc_parser_napi oxc_transform_napi oxc_traverse oxc_resolver oxc_resolver_napi oxc_sourcemap oxc_index`\n9. `pnpm install` - install updated npm packages\n10. `cargo check` - if there are errors, fix all breaking changes before proceeding. Common breaking changes include renamed types, changed method signatures, or removed APIs. Study the error messages carefully and update the code accordingly.\n11. `just update-generated-code`\n12. `just test-update`\n13. `just ued`\n14. `just roll` - run the full build, lint, and test suite. Fix any remaining breaking changes or test failures before proceeding.\n15. `git status --short && git diff --stat` - verify expected files changed\n16. Summarize the upgrade by reporting: (a) the old and new versions, (b) number of files changed, (c) any breaking changes that were fixed, and (d) notable changes in the diff\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:35.895Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript/TypeScript Agents needing fast and efficient bundling with Rollup-compatible API.","zh":"适合需要快速高效打包的JavaScript/TypeScript代理，支持Rollup兼容API。","ja":"Rollup互換APIを使用した高速で効率的なバンドルが必要なJavaScript/TypeScriptエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Rollup 호환 API를 사용하여 빠르고 효율적인 번들링이 필요한 JavaScript/TypeScript 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes JavaScript/TypeScript que necesitan un empaquetado rápido y eficiente con API compatible con Rollup.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript/TypeScript nécessitant un regroupement rapide et efficace avec une API compatible Rollup.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript/TypeScript-Agents, die ein schnelles und effizientes Bündeln mit einer Rollup-kompatiblen API benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para JavaScript/TypeScript Agents que precisam de bundling rápido e eficiente com API compatível com Rollup.","ru":"Идеально для JavaScript/TypeScript Agents, которые нуждаются в быстром и эффективном сборе с API, совместимым с Rollup.","ar":"المناسب لJavaScript/TypeScript Agents الذين يحتاجون إلى Bundling سريع و فعال مع API Rollup."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage dependencies and versions of @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser, and oxc-transform using git and npm, streamlining the development process with pnpm-workspace.yaml updates.","zh":"赋予代理管理@oxc-project/types、@oxc-project/runtime、oxc-minify、oxc-parser和oxc-transform的依赖项和版本，使用git和npm，通过pnpm-workspace.yaml更新来简化开发过程。","ja":"gitとnpmを使用して、@oxc-project/types、@oxc-project/runtime、oxc-minify、oxc-parser、およびoxc-transformの依存関係とバージョンを管理し、pnpm-workspace.yamlの更新により開発プロセスを簡素化するエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"git과 npm을 사용하여 @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser 및 oxc-transform의 종속성 및 버전을 관리하고 pnpm-workspace.yaml 업데이트를 통해 개발 프로세스를简化합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar dependencias y versiones de @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser y oxc-transform utilizando git y npm, simplificando el proceso de desarrollo con actualizaciones de pnpm-workspace.yaml.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les dépendances et les versions de @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser et oxc-transform en utilisant git et npm, simplifiant le processus de développement avec des mises à jour de pnpm-workspace.yaml.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Abhängigkeiten und Versionen von @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser und oxc-transform mit git und npm zu verwalten, wodurch der Entwicklungsprozess durch pnpm-workspace.yaml-Aktualisierungen vereinfacht wird.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a gerenciar dependências e versões de @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser e oxc-transform usando git e npm, simplificando o processo de desenvolvimento com atualizações de pnpm-workspace.yaml.","ru":"Эмподера агентов управлять зависимостями и версиями @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser и oxc-transform с помощью git и npm, упрощая процесс разработки с обновлениями pnpm-workspace.yaml.","ar":"يثق Agents ب管理 зависимости و نسخ من @oxc-project/types, @oxc-project/runtime, oxc-minify, oxc-parser و oxc-transform باستخدام git و npm, مما يُبسّط عملية تطوير مع تحديثات pnpm-workspace.yaml."},"useCases":{"en":["Upgrading OXC dependencies to the latest version","Managing workspace configurations with pnpm-workspace.yaml","Ensuring compatibility with Rollup API for efficient bundling"],"zh":["将OXC依赖项升级到最新版本","使用pnpm-workspace.yaml管理工作空间配置","确保与Rollup API兼容以实现高效打包"],"ja":["OXCの依存関係を最新バージョンにアップグレードする","pnpm-workspace.yamlを使用してワークスペースの設定を管理する","Rollup APIとの互換性を確保して効率的なバンドルを実現する"],"ko":["OXC 종속성을 최신 버전으로 업그레이드","pnpm-workspace.yaml을 사용하여 작업공간 구성을 관리","Rollup API와의 호환성을 보장하여 효율적인 번들링을实现"],"es":["Actualización de dependencias OXC a la última versión","Gestión de configuraciones de espacio de trabajo con pnpm-workspace.yaml","Garantía de compatibilidad con la API Rollup para un empaquetado eficiente"],"fr":["Mise à jour des dépendances OXC vers la dernière version","Gestion des configurations d''espace de travail avec pnpm-workspace.yaml","Assurance de la compatibilité avec l''API Rollup pour un regroupement efficace"],"de":["Aktualisierung von OXC-Abhängigkeiten auf die neueste Version","Verwaltung von Arbeitsbereichskonfigurationen mit pnpm-workspace.yaml","Sicherstellung der Kompatibilität mit der Rollup-API für ein effizientes Bündeln"],"pt":["Atualizar dependências OXC para a versão mais recente","Gerenciar configurações de espaço de trabalho com pnpm-workspace.yaml","Garantir compatibilidade com API Rollup para bundling eficiente"],"ru":["Обновить зависимости OXC до последней версии","Управлять конфигурациями рабочего пространства с помощью pnpm-workspace.yaml","Гарантировать совместимость с API Rollup для эффективного сборки"],"ar":["تحديث зависимости OXC إلى النسخة الأخيرة","إدارة تكوينات_SPACE WORKER مع pnpm-workspace.yaml","ضمان توافق مع API Rollup لل_BUNDLING_ الفعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires sequential execution of commands","Dependencies on specific versions of @oxc-project/types and other packages","Needs git and npm access"],"zh":["需要顺序执行命令","依赖于@oxc-project/types和其他包的特定版本","需要git和npm访问"],"ja":["コマンドの順序実行が必要","@oxc-project/typesおよび他のパッケージの特定のバージョンに依存","gitおよびnpmへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["명령을 순차적으로 실행해야 함","@oxc-project/types 및 기타 패키지의 특정 버전에 종속","git 및 npm 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere la ejecución secuencial de comandos","Dependencias de versiones específicas de @oxc-project/types y otros paquetes","Necesita acceso a git y npm"],"fr":["Nécessite l''exécution séquentielle de commandes","Dépendances de versions spécifiques de @oxc-project/types et d''autres packages","Nécessite un accès à git et npm"],"de":["Erfordert die sequenzielle Ausführung von Befehlen","Abhängigkeiten von spezifischen Versionen von @oxc-project/types und anderen Paketen","Benötigt Zugriff auf git und npm"],"pt":["Requer execução sequencial de comandos","Dependências de versões específicas de @oxc-project/types e outros pacotes","Necessita acesso a git e npm"],"ru":["Требует последовательного выполнения команд","Зависимости от конкретных версий @oxc-project/types и других пакетов","Требует доступ к git и npm"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ متسلسل من الأوامر","اعتماديات على نسخة محددة من @oxc-project/types و OTHERS","يتطلب الوصول إلى git و npm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3e5b430e4e4486fabfd5bdafc4a83b94bb61ae7f64628550e9700c945f66610a","qualityScore":21}');
