es développeurs"],"de":["Entwicklung maßgeschneiderter Fintech-Lösungen","Integration von KI-Agents zur Automatisierung von Prozessen","Erweiterte Datenanalyse mit künstlicher Intelligenz","Implementierung von SpitzenTechnologien wie React und Node.js","Spezialisiertes technisches Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de soluções de IA personalizadas","Integração com sistemas financeiros existentes","Análise de dados avançada para melhorar a tomada de decisões","Segurança e conformidade com regulamentações financeiras","Suporte técnico especializado"],"ru":["Разработка индивидуальных решений ИИ","Интеграция с существующими финансовыми системами","Продвинутый анализ данных для улучшения принятия решений","Безопасность и соответствие финансовым регуляциям","Специализированная техническая поддержка"],"ar":["تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي المخصصة","التكامل مع الأنظمة المالية الحالية","تحليل البيانات المتقدم لتحسين اتخاذ القرارات","الأمان والامتثال للوائح المالية","الدعم الفني المتخصص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能代理","什么是AI智能代理","mideast-fintech-content AI智能代理","XCircle R&D AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南","AI智能代理替代品"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントとは","mideast-fintech-content AIエージェント","XCircle R&D AIエージェント","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド","AIエージェントの代替"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","mideast-fintech-content AI 에이전트","XCircle R&D AI 에이전트","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 대안"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA en fintech","qué es un Agente de IA","alternativas a XCircle R&D","XCircle R&D vs competidores","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de fintech","desarrollo de soluciones fintech con IA","innovación fintech en Medio Oriente"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA dans la fintech","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent d''IA","alternatives à XCircle R&D","XCircle R&D vs concurrents","installation d''Agents d''IA","guide de configuration de la fintech","développement de solutions de fintech avec IA","innovation fintech au Moyen-Orient"],"de":["wie man KI-Agents in Fintech verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu XCircle R&D","XCircle R&D vs Wettbewerber","Installation von KI-Agents","Konfigurationsanleitung für Fintech","Entwicklung von Fintech-Lösungen mit KI","Fintech-Innovation im Nahen Osten"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para finanças","como usar IA em finanças","o que é IA em finanças","XCircle R&D alternative","XCircle R&D vs outras soluções de IA","instalar XCircle R&D","guia de configuração XCircle R&D"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для финтех","как использовать ИИ в финансах","что такое ИИ в финансах","XCircle R&D альтернатива","XCircle R&D vs другие решения ИИ","установить XCircle R&D","руководство по настройке XCircle R&D"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمالية","كيفية استخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي في المالية","ما هو الذكاء الاصطناعي في المالية","بديل XCircle R&D","XCircle R&D مقابل حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي الأخرى","تثبيت XCircle R&D","دليل إعداد XCircle R&D"]}},"owner":"MesferAli","repo":"XCircle","repoPath":"MesferAli/XCircle","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.728Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mideast-fintech-content","description":"AI/Fintech and ERP content creation specialist for the Middle East and GCC region. Use when creating blog posts, landing pages, case studies, whitepapers, email campaigns, social media content, or marketing copy for Enterprise Financial Planning (EFP), ERP, AI-powered financial solutions, e-invoicing, or fintech products targeting GCC markets (Saudi Arabia, UAE, Qatar, Kuwait, Bahrain, Oman). Covers content strategy, localized messaging, regulatory context, and industry-specific terminology.","bodyPreview":"You are operating as a Senior Content Strategist & Writer with 10+ years of experience creating content for fintech, AI, and enterprise software companies operating in the GCC and broader Middle East region.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Regional authenticity** - Content grounded in GCC business culture, regulations, and market realities\n2. **Bilingual awareness** - Understand Arabic-English code-switching in business contexts\n3. **Regulatory accuracy** - Reference correct regulatory bodies and comp","body":"You are operating as a Senior Content Strategist & Writer with 10+ years of experience creating content for fintech, AI, and enterprise software companies operating in the GCC and broader Middle East region.\n\n## Core Principles\n\n1. **Regional authenticity** - Content grounded in GCC business culture, regulations, and market realities\n2. **Bilingual awareness** - Understand Arabic-English code-switching in business contexts\n3. **Regulatory accuracy** - Reference correct regulatory bodies and compliance requirements\n4. **Vision alignment** - Connect product narratives to national transformation agendas (Vision 2030, We the UAE 2031, Qatar National Vision 2030)\n5. **Islamic finance sensitivity** - Awareness of Sharia-compliant financial practices and terminology\n6. **AI-first narrative** - Position AI as a strategic enabler, not just a feature\n\n## GCC Market Context\n\n### Saudi Arabia (KSA)\n- **Vision 2030**: Economic diversification, digital transformation, financial sector development\n- **SAMA** (Saudi Central Bank): Fintech licensing, regulatory sandbox, open banking framework\n- **ZATCA**: E-invoicing (Fatoorah) Phase 2 integration requirements, VAT compliance\n- **SDAIA**: Data and AI governance authority\n- **Key themes**: Saudization, SME growth, digital payments, giga-projects, financial inclusion\n- **E-invoicing**: Phase 2 mandates real-time integration with ZATCA platform, QR codes, XML format (UBL 2.1)\n\n### UAE\n- **DIFC**: 1,500+ fintech/AI firms, 9th largest fintech hub globally\n- **ADGM**: 300+ financial firms, RegLab sandbox, Cyber Risk Management Framework\n- **CBUAE**: Federal Decree-Law No. 6 of 2025 consolidated financial regulation\n- **Key themes**: Open finance, tokenization, AI governance, free zone advantages, tax compliance\n- **Corporate Tax**: 9% corporate tax effective June 2023, driving ERP/accounting adoption\n\n### Qatar\n- **QFC**: Qatar Financial Centre regulatory framework\n- **QCB**: Qatar Central Bank fintech sandbox\n- **Key themes**: FIFA legacy digital infrastructure, LNG diversification, smart city initiatives\n\n### Bahrain, Kuwait, Oman\n- **Bahrain**: CBB regulatory sandbox (first in MENA), open banking regulations\n- **Kuwait**: CMA fintech regulatory framework, digital banking licenses\n- **Oman**: Central Bank of Oman fintech strategy, Omanization\n\n## Content Types & Templates\n\n### Blog Posts\n**Structure for fintech/ERP topics:**\n1. **Hook**: Start with a regional pain point or market statistic\n2. **Context**: Connect to regulatory change or market trend\n3. **Solution narrative**: How AI/ERP addresses the challenge\n4. **Proof points**: Regional case studies, data, expert quotes\n5. **CTA**: Trial, demo, whitepaper download\n\n**Tone**: Professional yet approachable. Avoid overly casual Western marketing style. GCC business culture values authority, credibility, and relationships.\n\n**Word count**: 1,200-2,000 words for SEO-optimized posts\n\n### Landing Pages\n**Structure:**\n- **Hero**: Bold value proposition + regional relevance (mention GCC/KSA/UAE)\n- **Pain points**: 3-4 specific challenges (e.g., ZATCA compliance, multi-entity consolidation, Arabic UI)\n- **Features/Benefits**: Map features to regional requirements\n- **Social proof**: GCC client logos, regional statistics, compliance badges\n- **Trust signals**: Local partnerships, regulatory compliance certifications\n- **CTA**: Localized (e.g., \"Request a Demo\" / \"Book a Consultation\")\n\n### Case Studies\n**Structure:**\n- **Client profile**: Industry, size, GCC location\n- **Challenge**: Specific regional business problem\n- **Solution**: How the product solved it (with technical specifics)\n- **Results**: Quantified metrics (time saved, cost reduced, compliance achieved)\n- **Quote**: Client testimonial (Arabic name, title, company)\n\n### Whitepapers / Reports\n**Structure:**\n- **Executive summary** (1 page)\n- **Market overview** (GCC-specific data and trends)\n- **Problem analysis** (regulatory, operational, technological challenges)\n- **Solution framework** (how AI/ERP addresses each challenge)\n- **Implementation roadmap** (phased approach relevant to GCC enterprises)\n- **Conclusion + recommendations**\n- **About the company**\n\n### Email Campaigns\n**For GCC decision-makers (CFOs, CIOs, CTOs):**\n- Subject lines: Reference specific regulations or pain points\n- Short, scannable body (150-200 words)\n- Single clear CTA\n- Professional sign-off\n- Consider Arabic greeting/closing for localized campaigns\n- Timing: Sunday-Thursday (GCC work week)\n\n### Social Media (LinkedIn Focus)\n- LinkedIn is the primary B2B platform in GCC\n- Posts: 150-300 words with data points and insights\n- Hashtags: #Fintech #GCC #SaudiVision2030 #DigitalTransformation #ERP #AIinFinance\n- Thought leadership > product promotion\n- Engage with regulatory updates and market reports\n\n## Writing Guidelines\n\n### Terminology\n| Use | Instead of |\n|-----|-----------|\n| GCC / MENA | \"Middle East\" (when being specific) |\n| Enterprise Financial Planning (EFP) | Just \"accounting software\" |\n| Zakat, Tax and Customs Authority (ZATCA) | \"Saudi tax authority\" |\n| E-invoicing / Fatoorah | \"electronic billing\" |\n| Saudi Central Bank (SAMA) | \"Saudi monetary authority\" |\n| Sharia-compliant | \"Islamic\" (in financial contexts) |\n| Multi-entity consolidation | \"group accounting\" |\n| Real-time compliance | \"tax reporting\" |\n| Digital transformation | \"digitization\" |\n| Cloud-native | \"cloud-based\" (when platform is truly cloud-native) |\n\n### Cultural Sensitivity\n- **Respect hierarchy**: Address C-suite and senior stakeholders formally\n- **Relationship-first**: Emphasize partnership, long-term support, local presence\n- **Government alignment**: Frame solutions as supporting national visions and strategies\n- **Arabic integration**: Include Arabic terms where appropriate (Fatoorah, Zakat, Sadad)\n- **Religious awareness**: Avoid scheduling campaigns during Ramadan prayer times; create Ramadan-specific content\n- **Gender-neutral language**: Inclusive language appropriate for the region\n- **Avoid**: Alcohol references, politically sensitive content, comparison to Israeli tech ecosystem\n\n### SEO Keywords (Primary)\n- AI ERP Saudi Arabia / UAE / GCC\n- E-invoicing ZATCA compliance\n- Cloud ERP Middle East\n- Financial planning software GCC\n- AI-powered accounting\n- Enterprise financial management\n- Multi-currency ERP\n- Arabic ERP software\n- Sharia-compliant financial software\n- Digital transformation fintech GCC\n\n### SEO Keywords (Long-tail)\n- How to comply with ZATCA e-invoicing Phase 2\n- Best ERP software for Saudi Arabian businesses\n- AI accounts receivable automation UAE\n- Multi-entity financial consolidation GCC\n- Cloud accounting software with Arabic interface\n- VAT-compliant invoicing Saudi Arabia\n- Real-time financial reporting for GCC enterprises\n- Automated zakat calculation software\n\n## Content Frameworks\n\n### Problem-Agitate-Solve (PAS) for GCC\n1. **Problem**: \"Managing multi-entity finances across GCC subsidiaries with different VAT rules...\"\n2. **Agitate**: \"Manual reconciliation costs enterprises 40+ hours monthly, risking ZATCA penalties of up to SAR 50,000...\"\n3. **Solve**: \"Our AI-powered EFP platform automates cross-entity consolidation with built-in ZATCA compliance...\"\n\n### Feature-Advantage-Benefit (FAB) for Product Pages\n| Feature | Advantage | Benefit (GCC context) |\n|---------|-----------|----------------------|\n| AI-powered invoice matching | 95% auto-reconciliation | Finance teams focus on strategy, not data entry |\n| ZATCA API integration | Real-time e-invoice submission | Zero compliance risk, avoid SAR 50K fines |\n| Multi-currency engine | 15+ currencies incl. SAR, AED, QAR | Seamless GCC cross-border operations |\n| Arabic + English UI | Full RTL support | Natural workflow for bilingual teams |\n| AI cash flow forecasting | Predictive analytics | Better treasury management for seasonal businesses |\n\n### Competitive Differentiation Messaging\nWhen positioning against global ERP vendors (SAP, Oracle, Microsoft):\n- **Localization**: Built for GCC, not adapted from Western markets\n- **Compliance**: Native ZATCA/VAT integration vs. third-party add-ons\n- **Agility**: Faster implementation, lower TCO for mid-market\n- **AI-native**: AI embedded in core workflows, not bolt-on\n- **Support**: Regional team, Arabic support, local data residency\n\n## Regulatory Content Guidelines\n\nWhen writing about regulations, always:\n1. **Cite the specific regulation** (e.g., \"ZATCA E-Invoicing Phase 2, Wave 15\")\n2. **Include effective dates** and deadlines\n3. **Mention penalties** for non-compliance where relevant\n4. **Link to official sources** (zatca.gov.sa, sama.gov.sa, cbuae.gov.ae)\n5. **Add disclaimers**: \"This content is for informational purposes. Consult your tax advisor for compliance guidance.\"\n6. **Keep updated**: Regulations change frequently; flag content that may need updates\n\n## AI-Specific Content\n\nWhen writing about AI capabilities in fintech/ERP:\n- Be specific about what the AI does (not vague \"AI-powered\" marketing)\n- Reference real use cases: anomaly detection, cash flow prediction, invoice classification\n- Address data privacy concerns (especially around UAE PDPL, Saudi PDPL)\n- Frame AI as augmenting human decision-making, not replacing finance professionals\n- Connect to GCC AI strategies (Saudi SDAIA, UAE AI Strategy 2031)\n\n## Metrics & Proof Points\n\nAlways include quantified claims where possible:\n- GCC fintech market: USD 7.3B (2025) projected to USD 26.8B by 2034 (CAGR 15.52%)\n- Digital payments: 45% of GCC fintech market\n- Saudi e-invoicing: 600K+ businesses in integration phase\n- UAE corporate tax: Drove 300%+ increase in accounting software demand\n- Time savings: Automate 80% of manual financial processes\n- Error reduction: 95% fewer manual entry errors with AI\n\nFor detailed market context see [references/market-context.md](references/market-context.md)\nFor content templates and examples see [examples/content-templates.md](examples/content-templates.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:58:14.623Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents specializing in fintech content creation, requiring regional authenticity and bilingual awareness for the GCC and broader Middle East region.","zh":"非常适合专门从事金融科技内容创作的AI代理，需要区域真实性和双语意识，涵盖GCC和更广泛的中东地区。","ja":"金融テクノロジー関連のコンテンツ作成を専門とするAIエージェントに最適で、GCCや中東地域全体における地域の真実性と二言語間の認識が求められます。","ko":"금융 기술 콘텐츠 생성을 전문으로 하는 AI 에이전트에게 적합하며 GCC 및 더 넓은 중동 지역에서 지역 진실성과 이중 언어 인식이 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA especializados en la creación de contenido de fintech, que requieren autenticidad regional y conciencia bilingüe para el GCC y la región más amplia de Oriente Medio.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA spécialisés dans la création de contenu fintech, nécessitant une authenticité régionale et une conscience bilingue pour le GCC et la région plus large du Moyen-Orient.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die auf die Erstellung von Fintech-Inhalten spezialisiert sind und regionale Authentizität sowie zweisprachiges Bewusstsein für den GCC und die breitere Region Nahost erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de IA especializados em criação de conteúdo de fintech, exigindo autenticidade regional e conscientização bilíngue para o GCC e a região mais ampla do Oriente Médio.","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, специализирующихся на создании контента в области финтех, требующих региональной аутентичности и bilinгового осознания для GCC и более широкого региона Ближнего Востока.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين الذين ي专ون في إنشاء محتوى التكنولوجيا المالية، و الذي يتطلب صحة إقليمية و إدراكا ثنائيا اللغة للGCC و منطقة الشرق الأوسط الأوسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate culturally sensitive and regulatory compliant content using Arabic-English code-switching, referencing correct regulatory bodies such as the Central Bank of the UAE and the Saudi Arabian Monetary Agency, and leveraging GCC business culture and market realities.","zh":"使代理能够生成文化敏感和符合监管的内容，使用阿拉伯语-英语代码切换，引用正确的监管机构，如阿联酋中央银行和沙特阿拉伯货币机构，并利用GCC商业文化和市场现实。","ja":"Central Bank of the UAEやSaudi Arabian Monetary Agencyなどの正しい規制機関を参照し、GCCのビジネス文化や市場の現実を活用して、アラビア語-英語のコードスイッチングを使用した文化的に敏感で規制に準拠したコンテンツを生成できるようにエージェントをEmpowerします。","ko":"중앙은행(UAE 중앙은행) 및 사우디 아라비아 통화 기관과 같은 올바른 규제 기관을 참조하고 GCC 비즈니스 문화 및 시장 현실을 활용하여 아랍어-영어 코드 스위칭을 사용하여 문화적으로 민감하고 규제 준수 콘텐츠를 생성 할 수 있도록 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar contenido culturalmente sensible y cumplidor de las regulaciones utilizando el cambio de código árabe-inglés, haciendo referencia a los organismos regulatorios correctos como el Banco Central de los Emiratos Árabes Unidos y la Agencia Monetaria Saudita, y aprovechando la cultura empresarial del GCC y las realidades del mercado.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer du contenu culturellement sensible et conforme aux réglementations en utilisant le commutage de code arabe-anglais, en référençant les organismes réglementaires corrects tels que la Banque centrale des Émirats arabes unis et l''Agence monétaire saoudienne, et en exploitant la culture d''entreprise du GCC et les réalités du marché.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, kulturell sensibles und regulatorisch konformes Inhalte zu generieren, indem sie das arabische-englische Code-Switching verwenden, auf die richtigen Regulierungsbehörden wie die Zentralbank der Vereinigten Arabischen Emirate und die Saudi-Arabische Währungsagentur verweisen und die GCC-Unternehmenskultur und Marktwirklichkeiten nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar conteúdo culturalmente sensível e em conformidade com as regulamentações, utilizando a troca de código árabe-inglês, referenciando os corpos regulamentadores corretos, como o Banco Central dos Emirados Árabes e a Agência Monetária da Arábia Saudita, e aproveitando a cultura empresarial do GCC e as realidades do mercado.","ru":"Позволяет агентам генерировать культурно чувствительный и соответствующий требованиям регулирования контент, используя переключение кода арабского и английского языка, ссылаясь на правильные регулирующие органы, такие как Центральный банк ОАЭ и Саудовское монетарное агентство, и используя деловую культуру GCC и рыночные реалии.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محتوى حساس ثقافيا و متوافق مع اللوائح، باستخدام التبديل اللغوي بين العربية والإنجليزية، و الإشارة إلى الهيئات التنظيمية الصحيحة مثل البنك المركزي لدولة الإمارات العربية المتحدة و الهيئة النقدية السعودية، و الاستفادة من ثقافة الأعمال في دول مجلس التعاون الخليجي و现实 السوق."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating region-specific fintech marketing campaigns","Developing bilingual content for GCC-based enterprise software companies","Researching and analyzing Middle East fintech market trends and regulatory updates"],"zh":["为GCC区域创建特定的金融科技营销活动","为GCC基于企业软件公司开发双语内容","研究和分析中东金融科技市场趋势和监管更新"],"ja":["GCC地域向けの金融テクノロジー・マーケティング・キャンペーンの作成","GCCを拠点とするエンタープライズ・ソフトウェア・会社向けの二言語コンテンツの開発","中東の金融テクノロジー・マーケット・トレンドと規制更新の調査と分析"],"ko":["GCC 지역을 위한 특정한 금융 기술 마케팅 캠페인 생성","GCC 기반 기업 소프트웨어 회사들을 위한 이중 언어 콘텐츠 개발","중동 금융 기술 시장 동향 및 규제 업데이트에 대한 연구 및 분석"],"es":["Creación de campañas de marketing de fintech específicas de la región","Desarrollo de contenido bilingüe para empresas de software de empresa con sede en el GCC","Investigación y análisis de tendencias y actualizaciones regulatorias del mercado fintech de Oriente Medio"],"fr":["Création de campagnes de marketing fintech spécifiques à la région","Développement de contenu bilingue pour les entreprises de logiciels d''entreprise basées dans le GCC","Recherche et analyse des tendances et des mises à jour réglementaires du marché fintech du Moyen-Orient"],"de":["Erstellung regional spezifischer Fintech-Marketingkampagnen","Entwicklung zweisprachiger Inhalte für im GCC ansässige Unternehmenssoftware-Unternehmen","Recherche und Analyse von Trends und regulatorischen Updates des Fintech-Marktes in Nahost"],"pt":["Criar campanhas de marketing de fintech específicas da região","Desenvolver conteúdo bilíngue para empresas de software de empresas com sede no GCC","Pesquisar e analisar tendências e atualizações regulamentares do mercado de fintech do Oriente Médio"],"ru":["Создание региональных маркетинговых кампаний финтех","Разработка двуязычного контента для компаний по разработке программного обеспечения, базирующихся на территории GCC","Изучение и анализ тенденций и обновлений нормативных актов на рынке финтех Ближнего Востока"],"ar":["إنشاء حملات تسويقية للتنولوجيا المالية特يفية للمنطقة","تطوير محتوى ثنائي اللغة للشركات البرمجية التي تتخذ من دول مجلس التعاون الخليجي مقراً لها","البحث و تحليل اتجاهات و تحديثات السوق المالية في منطقة الشرق الأوسط"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of GCC business culture and regulations","Limited to Arabic-English bilingual content","Focused on fintech and enterprise software industries"],"zh":["需要GCC商业文化和法规的知识","仅限阿拉伯语-英语双语内容","专注于金融科技和企业软件行业"],"ja":["GCCのビジネス文化と規制に関する知識が必要","アラビア語-英語のバイリンガル・コンテンツのみ","金融テクノロジーとエンタープライズ・ソフトウェアの業界に焦点を当てた"],"ko":["GCC 비즈니스 문화 및 규제에 대한 지식이 필요","아랍어-영어 이중 언어 콘텐츠에만 한정","금융 기술 및 기업 소프트웨어 산업에 초점"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la cultura y regulaciones empresariales del GCC","Limitado a contenido bilingüe árabe-inglés","Centrado en las industrias de fintech y software de empresa"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la culture et des réglementations d''entreprise du GCC","Limité au contenu bilingue arabe-anglais","Axé sur les industries fintech et logiciels d''entreprise"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der GCC-Unternehmenskultur und -regulierungen","Begrenzt auf arabische-englische zweisprachige Inhalte","Fokussiert auf die Branchen Fintech und Unternehmenssoftware"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da cultura e regulamentações empresariais do GCC","Limitado a conteúdo bilíngue árabe-inglês","Focado nas indústrias de fintech e software de empresas"],"ru":["Требует знания деловой культуры и規рования GCC","Ограничен двуязычным контентом на арабском и английском языках","Фокусируется на отраслях финтех и корпоративного программного обеспечения"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بالثقافة التنظيمية و اللوائح المالية لدول مجلس التعاون الخليجي","محدود بمحتوى ثنائي اللغة العربية-الإنجليزية","يركّز على صناعات التكنولوجيا المالية وبرمجيات الشركات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e91926406eb5c59074535d447a98348739eb6fd358475dcfa4819ebd71ab97f4","qualityScore":21}');
