,"ja":"plan-app は Claude Code トレーニングのためのワークショップ設定ツールで、開発者が迅速に開発環境を設定できるようにします","ko":"plan-app는 Claude Code 교육을 위한 워크샵 설정 도구로 개발자가 빠르게 개발 환경을 설정할 수 있도록 합니다","es":"Configuración de plan-app para el entrenamiento de Claude Code con tecnologías como React y Node.js","fr":"Configuration de plan-app pour la formation de Claude Code avec des technologies comme React et Node.js","de":"Einrichtung von plan-app für die Ausbildung von Claude Code mit Technologien wie React und Node.js","pt":"O plan-app é uma ferramenta de IA para configuração de workshops de treinamento de Claude Code. Aprenda a usá-lo.","ru":"Plan-app - это ИИ Агент для настройки мастерских для обучения Claude Code. Узнайте, как им пользоваться.","ar":"plan-app هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتهيئة ورش العمل لتدريب Claude Code. تعلم كيفية استخدامه.","en":"Workshop setup bootstrap for Claude Code training"},"definition":{"en":"Workshop setup bootstrap for Claude Code training"},"features":{"zh":["快速搭建 Claude Code 培训环境","支持多种开发语言和框架","提供高效的开发和部署工具","集成 Claude Code 训练数据和模型","支持命令行接口 (CLI) 操作"],"ja":["Claude Code トレーニング環境の迅速な設定","複数の開発言語とフレームワークのサポート","開発とデプロイの効率化ツールの提供","Claude Code トレーニングデータとモデルの統合","コマンドラインインターフェース (CLI) 操作のサポート"],"ko":["Claude Code 교육 환경을 빠르게 설정","다수의 개발 언어와 프레임워크를 지원","개발과 배포를 효율화하는 도구를 제공","Claude Code 교육 데이터와 모델을 통합","명령줄 인터페이스 (CLI) 동작을 지원"],"es":["Configuración de entornos de desarrollo con React","Integración con Node.js para el entrenamiento de Claude Code","Herramientas de AI para la optimización del código","Soporte para la línea de comandos (CLI) para una mayor flexibilidad","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Configuration d''environnements de développement avec React","Intégration avec Node.js pour la formation de Claude Code","Outils d''IA pour l''optimisation du code","Prise en charge de la ligne de commande (CLI) pour une plus grande flexibilité","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes de développement"],"de":["Einrichtung von Entwicklungsumgebungen mit React","Integration mit Node.js für die Ausbildung von Claude Code","KI-Tools für die Optimierung des Codes","Unterstützung für die Kommandozeile (CLI) für eine größere Flexibilität","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Entwicklungsumgebungen"],"pt":["Configuração de workshops de treinamento de Claude Code","Integração com ferramentas de IA","Suporte à criação de ambientes de treinamento personalizados","Otimização do processo de treinamento","Interface de usuário intuitiva"],"ru":["Настройка мастерских для обучения Claude Code","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Поддержка создания индивидуальных сред обучения","Оптимизация процесса обучения","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя"],"ar":["تهيئة ورش العمل لتدريب Claude Code","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم إنشاء بيئات تدريب مخصصة","تحسين عملية التدريب","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 plan-app","什么是 Claude Code","plan-app 安装指南","plan-app 代替工具","Claude Code 训练数据","AI 智能工具","开发环境设置","高效开发和部署"],"ja":["plan-app の使い方","Claude Code とは","plan-app インストールガイド","plan-app の代替ツール","Claude Code トレーニングデータ","AI エージェント","開発環境の設定","開発とデプロイの効率化"],"ko":["plan-app 사용 방법","Claude Code란","plan-app 설치 가이드","plan-app 대체 도구","Claude Code 교육 데이터","AI 에이전트","개발 환경 설정","개발과 배포의 효율화"],"es":["herramientas de AI","configuración de plan-app","entrenamiento de Claude Code","React","Node.js","CLI","desarrollo de software","optimización de código","alternativas a plan-app"],"fr":["outils d''IA","configuration de plan-app","formation de Claude Code","React","Node.js","CLI","développement de logiciels","optimisation de code","alternatives à plan-app"],"de":["KI-Tools","Einrichtung von plan-app","Ausbildung von Claude Code","React","Node.js","CLI","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Optimierung","Alternativen zu plan-app"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","configuração de workshops","treinamento de Claude Code","como usar plan-app","plan-app alternativa","plan-app vs Claude Code","instalação do plan-app","guia de configuração do plan-app"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","настройка мастерских","обучение Claude Code","как использовать plan-app","альтернативы plan-app","plan-app vs Claude Code","установка plan-app","руководство по настройке plan-app"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تهيئة ورش العمل","تدريب Claude Code","كيفية استخدام plan-app","بديل plan-app","plan-app مقابل Claude Code","تثبيت plan-app","دليل إعداد plan-app"]}},"owner":"teren-papercutlabs","repo":"pcl-workshop-setup","repoPath":"teren-papercutlabs/pcl-workshop-setup","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.731Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"plan-app","description":"MANDATORY INVOCATION: This skill MUST be invoked for building workshop apps. Guides the full flow from idea to deployed app: interview, screen flows, decomposition into sub-agents, parallel build, and merge. Trigger for: :plan-app macro, building an app, app planning, workshop app build.","bodyPreview":"# Plan App\n\nBuild a complete app in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution.\n\n## Flow (MANDATORY - IN ORDER)\n\nComplete each phase before moving to the next. Read the reference file at the START of each phase.\n\n### Phase 1: INTERVIEW\n**Read:** `reference/01-interview.md`\n**When:** Immediately after skill invoked\n**Goal:** Understand what they want to build, who uses it, core use cases\n**Done when:** You have clear app concept and can describe it back to them\n\n### Phase 2","body":"# Plan App\n\nBuild a complete app in ~2 hours through guided planning and parallel sub-agent execution.\n\n## Flow (MANDATORY - IN ORDER)\n\nComplete each phase before moving to the next. Read the reference file at the START of each phase.\n\n### Phase 1: INTERVIEW\n**Read:** `reference/01-interview.md`\n**When:** Immediately after skill invoked\n**Goal:** Understand what they want to build, who uses it, core use cases\n**Done when:** You have clear app concept and can describe it back to them\n\n### Phase 2: SCREEN FLOWS\n**Read:** `reference/02-screen-flows.md`\n**When:** Interview complete\n**Goal:** Create wireframes + user journeys (combined, not separate)\n**Done when:** Participant approves the screen flows\n\n### Phase 3: DECOMPOSITION\n**Read:** `reference/03-decomposition.md`\n**When:** Screen flows approved\n**Goal:** Split work into Foundation + Feature agents\n**Done when:** Sub-agent MD files written to `/docs/agents/`\n\n### Phase 4: DISPATCH\n**Read:** `reference/04-dispatch.md`\n**When:** MD files ready\n**Goal:** Run Foundation agent, then feature agents in parallel (same repo, file ownership prevents conflicts)\n**Done when:** All sub-agents have returned\n\n### Phase 5: TESTING\n**Read:** `reference/05-testing.md`\n**When:** All sub-agents complete\n**Goal:** Automated verification + user testing\n**Done when:** All checks pass, user confirms it works\n\n### Phase 6: DEPLOY\n**Read:** `reference/06-deploy.md`\n**When:** Testing complete\n**Goal:** Deploy to Vercel\n**Done when:** App running on Vercel with live URL\n\n## Project Location\n\nCreate the project folder in the current working directory. Use a slugified version of the app name:\n- \"Campaign Archive\" → `./campaign-archive/`\n- \"Team Wiki\" → `./team-wiki/`\n\nDo not ask the user where to put it. Just create it in the current directory.\n\n## Hard Limits\n\nEnforce these during interview. If app exceeds limits, help them cut scope.\n\n- **Max 4 screens**\n- **Max 2 tables**\n- **Max 2 external APIs**\n\n## Tech Stack (Non-negotiable)\n\nDo not offer choices. These are prescribed:\n\n- **Framework:** Next.js (App Router)\n- **Database:** Supabase (via Vercel integration)\n- **UI:** ShadCN\n- **Auth:** Supabase Auth with email/password (if needed)\n- **Hosting:** Vercel\n\n## Planning Outputs\n\nAll written to `/docs/` in the project:\n\n| File | Contents |\n|------|----------|\n| `/docs/screen-flows.md` | Wireframes + user journeys (approved by participant) |\n| `/docs/agents/foundation.md` | Foundation agent brief |\n| `/docs/agents/feature-*.md` | Feature agent briefs (one per feature) |"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:59:51.514Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing rapid application planning and parallel sub-agent execution.","zh":"非常适合需要快速应用规划和并行子代理执行的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが迅速なアプリケーション計画と並行したサブエージェントの実行を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"빠른 애플리케이션 계획 및 병렬 하위 에이전트 실행이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan una planificación de aplicación rápida y una ejecución paralela de subagentes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''une planification d''application rapide et d''une exécution parallèle de sous-agents.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine schnelle Anwendungsplanung und eine parallele Ausführung von Subagenten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de planejamento de aplicação rápido e execução paralela de sub-agentes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым требуется быстрое планирование приложений и параллельное выполнение субагентов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النشطين الذين يحتاجون إلى تخطيط تطبيق سريع وتشغيل متوازي للوكلاء الفرعيين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build complete apps in ~2 hours through guided planning, utilizing reference files like ''01-interview.md'' for comprehensive content analysis, and parallel sub-agent execution for efficient development, leveraging Claude Code training for enhanced functionality.","zh":"通过指导规划、利用参考文件（如''01-interview.md''）进行全面内容分析以及并行子代理执行来高效开发，利用Claude Code训练来增强功能，能够在~2小时内使代理构建完整的应用程序。","ja":"ガイド付きの計画、参考ファイル（例：''01-interview.md''）を使用した包括的なコンテンツ分析、および並行したサブエージェントの実行を通じて効率的な開発を行い、Claude Codeのトレーニングを利用して機能を強化することで、エージェントが~2時間で完全なアプリケーションを構築できるようにします。","ko":"가이드 계획을 통해, 참고 파일(''01-interview.md''와 같은)을 사용한 포괄적인 내용 분석 및 병렬 하위 에이전트 실행을 통해 효율적으로 개발하며, Claude Code 훈련을 활용하여 기능을 강화함으로써 에이전트가 ~2시간 내에 완전한 애플리케이션을 구축하도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones completas en ~2 horas a través de una planificación guiada, utilizando archivos de referencia como ''01-interview.md'' para un análisis de contenido integral, y una ejecución paralela de subagentes para un desarrollo eficiente, aprovechando la formación de Claude Code para una funcionalidad mejorada.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications complètes en ~2 heures grâce à une planification guidée, en utilisant des fichiers de référence tels que ''01-interview.md'' pour une analyse de contenu complète, et une exécution parallèle de sous-agents pour un développement efficace, en exploitant la formation Claude Code pour une fonctionnalité améliorée.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, in ~2 Stunden über eine guidierte Planung, unter Verwendung von Referenzdateien wie ''01-interview.md'' für eine umfassende Inhaltsanalyse und parallele Subagentenausführung für effiziente Entwicklung, komplette Apps zu erstellen, wobei die Claude Code-Schulung für eine verbesserte Funktionalität genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos completos em ~2 horas por meio de planejamento orientado, utilizando arquivos de referência como ''01-interview.md'' para análise de conteúdo abrangente e execução paralela de sub-agentes para desenvolvimento eficiente, aproveitando o treinamento Claude Code para funcionalidade aprimorada.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать полноценные приложения за ~2 часа посредством руководимого планирования, используя справочные файлы типа ''01-interview.md'' для всестороннего анализа контента и параллельного выполнения субагентов для эффективной разработки, используя обучение Claude Code для повышения функциональности.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات كاملة في ~2 ساعة من خلال التخطيط الموجه، باستخدام ملفات مرجعية مثل ''01-interview.md'' لتحليل محتوى شامل وتشغيل متوازي للوكلاء الفرعيين من أجل تطوير فعال، واستخدام تدريب Claude Code لتحسين الوظيفة."},"useCases":{"en":["Guiding workshop setup for Claude Code training","Building complete apps through phased development","Conducting comprehensive content analysis for app planning"],"zh":["为Claude Code训练指导工作坊设置","通过分阶段开发构建完整的应用程序","进行全面内容分析以进行应用程序规划"],"ja":["Claude Codeトレーニングのためのワークショップ設定のガイダンス","段階的な開発を通じて完全なアプリケーションを構築する","アプリケーション計画のための包括的なコンテンツ分析の実施"],"ko":["Claude Code 훈련을 위한 워크샵 설정 가이드","분阶段 개발을 통해 완전한 애플리케이션 구축","애플리케이션 계획을 위한 포괄적인 내용 분석 수행"],"es":["Guía de configuración del taller para la formación de Claude Code","Creación de aplicaciones completas a través de un desarrollo por fases","Realización de un análisis de contenido integral para la planificación de aplicaciones"],"fr":["Guidage de la configuration de l''atelier pour la formation Claude Code","Création d''applications complètes à travers un développement par phases","Réaltung d''une analyse de contenu complète pour la planification d''applications"],"de":["Guided-Workshop-Setup für Claude Code-Schulung","Erstellung von kompletten Apps durch Phasenentwicklung","Durchführung einer umfassenden Inhaltsanalyse für die App-Planung"],"pt":["Orientação para configuração de oficinas para treinamento Claude Code","Construção de aplicativos completos por meio de desenvolvimento faseado","Realização de análise de conteúdo abrangente para planejamento de aplicativos"],"ru":["Руководство по настройке семинаров для обучения Claude Code","Создание полноценных приложений посредством фазовой разработки","Проведение всестороннего анализа контента для планирования приложений"],"ar":["توجيه إعداد الحلقات الدراسية لتدريب Claude Code","بناء تطبيقات كاملة من خلال التطوير المرحلي","إجراء تحليل شامل للمحتوى لتخطيط التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code training setup","Phased development must be followed in order","Reference files like ''01-interview.md'' must be read at the start of each phase"],"zh":["需要Claude Code训练设置","分阶段开发必须按顺序进行","参考文件（如''01-interview.md''）必须在每个阶段开始时阅读"],"ja":["Claude Codeトレーニングの設定が必要","段階的な開発は順序通りに実行しなければならない","参考ファイル（例：''01-interview.md''）は各段階の開始時に読まなければならない"],"ko":["Claude Code 훈련 설정이 필요","분阶段 개발은 순서대로 진행되어야 함","참고 파일(''01-interview.md''와 같은)은 각 단계 시작 시 읽어야 함"],"es":["Requiere la configuración de la formación de Claude Code","El desarrollo por fases debe seguirse en orden","Los archivos de referencia como ''01-interview.md'' deben leerse al comienzo de cada fase"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration de la formation Claude Code","Le développement par phases doit être suivi dans l''ordre","Les fichiers de référence tels que ''01-interview.md'' doivent être lus au début de chaque phase"],"de":["Erfordert die Einrichtung der Claude Code-Schulung","Die Phasenentwicklung muss in der Reihenfolge befolgt werden","Referenzdateien wie ''01-interview.md'' müssen am Anfang jeder Phase gelesen werden"],"pt":["Exige configuração de treinamento Claude Code","O desenvolvimento faseado deve ser seguido em ordem","Arquivos de referência como ''01-interview.md'' devem ser lidos no início de cada fase"],"ru":["Требует настройки обучения Claude Code","Фазовая разработка должна проводиться в определенном порядке","Справочные файлы типа ''01-interview.md'' должны быть прочитаны в начале каждой фазы"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد تدريب Claude Code","يجب اتباع التطوير المرحلي بالترتيب","يجب قراءة ملفات المرجع مثل ''01-interview.md'' في بداية كل مرحلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1c32e69e715a2c9c4a55519b2ad122d5669ccfe3db1c29d7f1eaf55565557362","qualityScore":21}');
