en","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Integrierte Debugging- und Testtools"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos web com um sistema de design moderno","Criação de componentes reutilizáveis","Suporte a Typescript","Integração com outras ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Otimização de desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка веб-приложений с современной системой дизайна","Создание повторно используемых компонентов","Поддержка Typescript","Интеграция с другими инструментами разработки","Оптимизация производительности"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الويب بنظام تصميم حديث","إنشاء مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام","دعم Typescript","التكامل مع أدوات تطوير أخرى","تحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular是什么","如何使用Angular","Angular替代品","Angular和React的区别","Angular安装","Angular入门教程"],"ja":["Angularとは","Angularの使い方","Angularの代替","AngularとReactの違い","Angularのインストール","Angularのチュートリアル"],"ko":["Angular이란","Angular 사용법","Angular 대체","Angular과 React의 차이","Angular 설치","Angular 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar Angular","qué es Angular","alternativas a Angular","Angular vs React","instalación de Angular","guía de configuración de Angular","desarrollo de aplicaciones web con Angular"],"fr":["comment utiliser Angular","qu''est-ce qu''Angular","alternatives à Angular","Angular vs React","installation d''Angular","guide de configuration d''Angular","développement d''applications web avec Angular"],"de":["wie man Angular verwendet","was ist Angular","Alternativen zu Angular","Angular vs React","Installation von Angular","Konfigurationsanleitung für Angular","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit Angular"],"pt":["como usar angular","o que é angular","angular vs react","angular install","guia de configuração do angular","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web com angular","angular framework","angular tutorial","angular exemplos"],"ru":["как использовать angular","что такое angular","angular vs react","установка angular","руководство по настройке angular","разработка веб-приложений с angular","фреймворк angular","урок angular","примеры angular"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام angular","ما هو angular","angular مقابل react","تثبيت angular","دليل إعداد angular","تطوير تطبيقات الويب مع angular","إطار عمل angular","دورة angular","أمثلة angular"]}},"owner":"lumaui","repo":"luma-ui","repoPath":"lumaui/luma-ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.798Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"angular","description":"You are an expert in TypeScript, Angular, and scalable web application development. You write functional, maintainable, performant, and accessible code following Angular and TypeScript best practices.","bodyPreview":"## TypeScript Best Practices\n\n- Use strict type checking\n- Prefer type inference when the type is obvious\n- Avoid the `any` type; use `unknown` when type is uncertain\n\n## Angular Best Practices\n\n- Always use standalone components over NgModules\n- Must NOT set `standalone: true` inside Angular decorators. It''s the default in Angular v20+.\n- Use signals for state management\n- Implement lazy loading for feature routes\n- Do NOT use the `@HostBinding` and `@HostListener` decorators. Put host bindings","body":"## TypeScript Best Practices\n\n- Use strict type checking\n- Prefer type inference when the type is obvious\n- Avoid the `any` type; use `unknown` when type is uncertain\n\n## Angular Best Practices\n\n- Always use standalone components over NgModules\n- Must NOT set `standalone: true` inside Angular decorators. It''s the default in Angular v20+.\n- Use signals for state management\n- Implement lazy loading for feature routes\n- Do NOT use the `@HostBinding` and `@HostListener` decorators. Put host bindings inside the `host` object of the `@Component` or `@Directive` decorator instead\n- Use `NgOptimizedImage` for all static images.\n  - `NgOptimizedImage` does not work for inline base64 images.\n\n## Accessibility Requirements\n\n- It MUST pass all AXE checks.\n- It MUST follow all WCAG AA minimums, including focus management, color contrast, and ARIA attributes.\n\n### Components\n\n- Keep components small and focused on a single responsibility\n- Use `input()` and `output()` functions instead of decorators\n- Use `computed()` for derived state\n- Set `changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` in `@Component` decorator\n- Prefer inline templates for small components\n- Prefer Reactive forms instead of Template-driven ones\n- Do NOT use `ngClass`, use `class` bindings instead\n- Do NOT use `ngStyle`, use `style` bindings instead\n- When using external templates/styles, use paths relative to the component TS file.\n\n## State Management\n\n- Use signals for local component state\n- Use `computed()` for derived state\n- Keep state transformations pure and predictable\n- Do NOT use `mutate` on signals, use `update` or `set` instead\n\n## Templates\n\n- Keep templates simple and avoid complex logic\n- Use native control flow (`@if`, `@for`, `@switch`) instead of `*ngIf`, `*ngFor`, `*ngSwitch`\n- Use the async pipe to handle observables\n- Do not assume globals like (`new Date()`) are available.\n- Do not write arrow functions in templates (they are not supported).\n\n## Services\n\n- Design services around a single responsibility\n- Use the `providedIn: ''root''` option for singleton services\n- Use the `inject()` function instead of constructor injection\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:42.409Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents requiring advanced Angular development capabilities with strict TypeScript type checking and standalone components.","zh":"适用于需要高级 Angular 开发能力的前端代理，具有严格的 TypeScript 类型检查和独立组件。","ja":"Angular の高度な開発機能と厳格な TypeScript の型チェックおよびスタンドアロン コンポーネントを必要とするフロントエンド エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Angular 개발 기능과 엄격한 TypeScript 타입 확인 및 독립 구성 요소를 요구하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que requieren capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de Angular con verificación estricta de tipos TypeScript y componentes autónomos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend nécessitant des capacités de développement avancées d''Angular avec une vérification stricte des types TypeScript et des composants autonomes.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Angular-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten mit strenger TypeScript-Typüberprüfung und eigenständigen Komponenten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Frontend que requerem capacidades de desenvolvimento avançadas em Angular com verificação de tipo estrita em TypeScript e componentes independentes.","ru":"Идеально для Frontend-агентов, требующих продвинутых возможностей разработки в Angular с строгим типом проверки в TypeScript и отдельными компонентами.","ar":"مثالي لAgent Front-end الذين يحتاجون إلى مهارات تطوير متقدمة في Angular مع التحقق من النوع الصارم في TypeScript ومكونات منفصلة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build scalable Angular applications using signals for state management, lazy loading for feature routes, and strict TypeScript best practices, including type inference and avoidance of the ''any'' type.","zh":"赋予代理构建可扩展的 Angular 应用程序的能力，使用信号进行状态管理，使用延迟加载进行功能路由，并遵循严格的 TypeScript 最佳实践，包括类型推断和避免使用 ''any'' 类型。","ja":"信号による状態管理、遅延ロードによる機能ルーティング、厳格な TypeScript のベストプラクティス（包括型推論と ''any'' 型の回避）を使用して、拡張可能な Angular アプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"상태 관리를 위한 신호, 기능 라우팅을 위한 지연 로딩 및 엄격한 TypeScript 모범 사례(包括 타입 추론 및 ''any'' 형식 회피)를 사용하여 확장 가능한 Angular 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear aplicaciones Angular escalables utilizando señales para la gestión de estados, carga diferida para rutas de características y mejores prácticas estrictas de TypeScript, incluyendo inferencia de tipos y evitación del tipo ''any''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Angular évolutives en utilisant des signaux pour la gestion d''état, le chargement différé pour les routes de fonctionnalités et les meilleures pratiques strictes de TypeScript, y compris l''inférence de types et l''évitement du type ''any''.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare Angular-Anwendungen mithilfe von Signalen für die Zustandsverwaltung, Lazy Loading für Funktionsrouten und strikten TypeScript-Best-Practices zu erstellen, einschließlich Typinferenz und Vermeidung des ''any''-Typs.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a construir aplicações Angular escaláveis usando sinais para gerenciamento de estado, lazy loading para rotas de recursos e melhores práticas de TypeScript estritas, incluindo inferência de tipo e evitando o tipo ''any''.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность создавать масштабные приложения Angular с помощью сигналов для управления состоянием, lazy loading для маршрутов функций и строгих лучших практик TypeScript, включая вывод типа и избегание типа ''any''.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات Angular قابلة للتوسع باستخدام الإشارات لإدارة الحالة، وتحميل الكسوف لروات الميزة، وأفضل ممارسات TypeScript الصارمة، بما في ذلك الاستنتاج النوعي وتجنب النوع ''any''."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing lazy loading for feature routes","Managing state with signals","Developing standalone components with strict TypeScript type checking"],"zh":["为功能路由实现延迟加载","使用信号管理状态","开发具有严格 TypeScript 类型检查的独立组件"],"ja":["機能ルートの遅延ロードの実装","信号による状態管理","厳格な TypeScript の型チェックを使用したスタンドアロン コンポーネントの開発"],"ko":["기능 라우팅을 위한 지연 로딩 구현","신호를 사용한 상태 관리","엄격한 TypeScript 타입 확인을 사용한 독립 구성 요소 개발"],"es":["Implementar carga diferida para rutas de características","Gestionar estado con señales","Desarrollar componentes autónomos con verificación estricta de tipos TypeScript"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre le chargement différé pour les routes de fonctionnalités","Gérer l''état avec des signaux","Développer des composants autonomes avec une vérification stricte des types TypeScript"],"de":["Implementierung von Lazy Loading für Funktionsrouten","Zustandsverwaltung mit Signalen","Entwicklung von eigenständigen Komponenten mit strenger TypeScript-Typüberprüfung"],"pt":["Implementar lazy loading para rotas de recursos","Gerenciar estado com sinais","Desenvolver componentes independentes com verificação de tipo estrita em TypeScript"],"ru":["Реализовать lazy loading для маршрутов функций","Управлять состоянием с помощью сигналов","Разрабатывать отдельные компоненты с строгим типом проверки в TypeScript"],"ar":["تنفيذ التحميل الكسوف لروات الميزة","إدارة الحالة باستخدام الإشارات","بناء مكونات منفصلة مع التحقق من النوع الصارم في TypeScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular v20+","Must avoid using ''any'' type and ''HostBinding'' and ''HostListener'' decorators"],"zh":["需要 Angular v20+","必须避免使用 ''any'' 类型以及 ''HostBinding'' 和 ''HostListener'' 装饰器"],"ja":["Angular v20+ が必要","''any'' 型および ''HostBinding'' および ''HostListener'' デコレーターの使用を避ける必要がある"],"ko":["Angular v20+ 필요","''any'' 형식 및 ''HostBinding'' 및 ''HostListener'' 데코레이터 사용을 피해야 함"],"es":["Requiere Angular v20+","Debe evitar usar el tipo ''any'' y los decoradores ''HostBinding'' y ''HostListener''"],"fr":["Nécessite Angular v20+","Doit éviter d''utiliser le type ''any'' et les décorateurs ''HostBinding'' et ''HostListener''"],"de":["Benötigt Angular v20+","Sollte den ''any''-Typ und die Dekoratoren ''HostBinding'' und ''HostListener'' vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer Angular v20+","Deve evitar usar o tipo ''any'' e os decoradores ''HostBinding'' e ''HostListener''"],"ru":["Требует Angular v20+","Должен избегать использования типа ''any'' и декораторов ''HostBinding'' и ''HostListener''"],"ar":["يتطلب Angular v20+","يجب تجنب استخدام النوع ''any'' والزينة ''HostBinding'' و ''HostListener''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"451062f565be9b6568f1d3563f866f16cfd03895fedaf90e1abd5873ee113262","qualityScore":21}');
