"description":{"zh":"reference-core是一个AI智能工具，帮助开发者打造高性能、可靠的Web应用","ja":"reference-coreはAIエージェントであり、開発者が信頼性の高いWebアプリを実現することを支援します","ko":"reference-core는 AI 에이전트로서 개발자가 안정적인 웹 애플리케이션을 구축하도록 지원합니다","es":"Entrega aplicaciones web con confianza utilizando herramientas de referencia-core. Desarrolla con tecnologías como React, Python y Node.js","fr":"Livrez des applications web avec confiance en utilisant des outils de référence-core. Développez avec des technologies comme React, Python et Node.js","de":"Liefern Sie Webanwendungen mit Vertrauen mithilfe von Referenz-Core-Tools. Entwickeln Sie mit Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js","pt":"O reference-core é uma solução de confiança para entrega de aplicações web escaláveis e seguras","ru":"ИИ Агент reference-core является надежным решением для доставки веб-приложений с высокой масштабируемостью и безопасностью","ar":"reference-core هو حل موثوق به لتقديم تطبيقات الوب القابلة للتوسع والأمنة","en":"Deliver web apps with confidence 🚀"},"definition":{"en":"Deliver web apps with confidence 🚀"},"features":{"zh":["高性能Web应用打造","AI智能优化","开发效率提升","可靠性保证","易于集成"],"ja":["信頼性の高いWebアプリの実現","AIエージェントによる最適化","開発効率の向上","高可用性の保証","簡単な統合"],"ko":["안정적인 웹 애플리케이션 구축","AI 에이전트 최적화","개발 효율성 향상","고가용성 보장","쉬운 통합"],"es":["Desarrollo de aplicaciones web con React","Integración con Python y Node.js","Herramientas de referencia-core para aplicaciones web escalables","Implementación de la interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI)","Soporte para desarrolladores con Agent"],"fr":["Développement d''applications web avec React","Intégration avec Python et Node.js","Outils de référence-core pour des applications web évolutives","Mise en œuvre de l''interface de ligne de commande (CLI)","Prise en charge des développeurs avec Agent"],"de":["Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit React","Integration mit Python und Node.js","Referenz-Core-Tools für skalierbare Webanwendungen","Implementierung der Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI)","Unterstützung für Entwickler mit Agent"],"pt":["Entrega de aplicações web com confiança","Escalabilidade e segurança","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para desenvolvedores","Suporte a Agentes de IA"],"ru":["Доставка веб-приложений с уверенностью","Масштабируемость и безопасность","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для разработчиков","Поддержка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إيصال التطبيقات الوب مع الثقة","القدرة على التوسع والأمن","التكامل مع React, Python و Node.js","CLI للمطورين","دعم أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用reference-core","什么是AI智能工具","reference-core替代品","reference-core与竞争对手的比较","reference-core安装","reference-core设置指南","Web应用开发","AI智能优化"],"ja":["reference-coreの使い方","AIエージェントとは","reference-coreの代替","reference-coreと競合製品の比較","reference-coreのインストール","reference-coreの設定ガイド","Webアプリの開発","AIエージェントによる最適化"],"ko":["reference-core 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","reference-core 대체","reference-core와 경쟁사 비교","reference-core 설치","reference-core 설정 가이드","웹 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트 최적화"],"es":["cómo utilizar herramientas de referencia-core","qué es la referencia-core","alternativa a herramientas de referencia-core","herramientas de referencia-core vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de referencia-core","guía de configuración de herramientas de referencia-core","desarrollo de aplicaciones web con React y Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de référence-core","qu''est-ce que la référence-core","alternative aux outils de référence-core","outils de référence-core vs concurrents","installation des outils de référence-core","guide de configuration des outils de référence-core","développement d''applications web avec React et Python"],"de":["wie man Referenz-Core-Tools verwendet","was ist Referenz-Core","Alternative zu Referenz-Core-Tools","Referenz-Core-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Referenz-Core-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Referenz-Core-Tools","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit React und Python"],"pt":["como usar reference-core","o que é reference-core","reference-core alternativa","reference-core vs outros","instalar reference-core","guia de configuração do reference-core"],"ru":["как использовать reference-core","что такое reference-core","reference-core альтернатива","reference-core vs другие","установить reference-core","руководство по настройке reference-core"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام reference-core","ما هو reference-core","بديل reference-core","reference-core مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت reference-core","دليل إعداد reference-core"]}},"owner":"angular","repo":"angular","repoPath":"angular/angular","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.889Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reference-core","description":"Explains the mental model and architecture of the code under `packages/core`. You MUST use this skill any time you plan to work with code in `packages/core`","bodyPreview":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.","body":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.  **Reactivity**: Signals and Zone.js integration.\n\n## 2. Rendering Engine (Ivy / Render3)\n\nThe rendering engine (located in `packages/core/src/render3`) uses an **instruction-based** approach.\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Instructions**: The Angular compiler transforms templates into a sequence of instruction calls (e.g., `ɵɵelementStart`, `ɵɵtext`, `ɵɵproperty`). These instructions are executed at runtime to create and update the view.\n  - _Location_: `packages/core/src/render3/instructions`\n\n- **LView (Logical View)**: An array containing the _state_ of a specific view instance. It holds:\n  - DOM nodes (`RElement`, `RText`).\n  - Binding values (for change detection).\n  - Directive/Component instances.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **TView (Template View)**: An array containing the _static structure_ of a view. It is shared across all instances (`LView`s) of the same component/template. It holds:\n  - Property names for bindings.\n  - Node relationship information.\n  - Compiled directive definitions.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **Memory Layout**: `LView` and `TView` are parallel arrays. Index `i` in `LView` corresponds to metadata at index `i` in `TView`.\n  - `HEADER`: Fixed size, contains context (Parent, Host, etc.).\n  - `DECLS`: Static nodes (elements, text, pipes).\n  - `VARS`: Binding values.\n  - `EXPANDO`: Dynamic data (host bindings, injectors).\n\n### The Render Cycle\n\n1.  **Creation Mode**: Instructions create DOM nodes and store them in `LView`.\n2.  **Update Mode**: Instructions check current values against previous values stored in `LView`. If changed, they update the DOM.\n\n## 3. Dependency Injection (DI)\n\nDI in Angular is hierarchical and split into two systems that interact:\n\n### Module Injector (`R3Injector`)\n\n- Configured via `@NgModule.providers` or `providedIn: ''root''`.\n- Stored in a hierarchy of `R3Injector` instances.\n- _Location_: `packages/core/src/di/r3_injector.ts`\n\n### Node Injector\n\n- Configured via `@Component.providers` or `@Directive.providers`.\n- **Not a class**, but a data structure embedded in the `LView` (\"Expando\" section).\n- Uses **Bloom Filters** (`TView.data`) to quickly check if a token is present at a specific node index before traversing up the tree.\n- Resolves tokens starting from the current node, walking up the view tree (Element Injector hierarchy), and falling back to the Module Injector if not found.\n\n## 4. Change Detection\n\n- **Dirty Checking**: Angular checks if values bound in templates have changed.\n- **Strategies**:\n  - `Default`: Checks everything.\n  - `OnPush`: Checks only if inputs change, events fire, or signals update.\n- **Signals**: The new reactivity primitive. Signals notify the scheduler when they change, potentially allowing for fine-grained updates (Zoneless).\n\n## 5. Key Directories to Know\n\n- `src/render3`: The Ivy rendering engine.\n  - `instructions`: The runtime instructions called by compiled code.\n  - `interfaces`: `LView`, `TView`, `TNode` definitions.\n- `src/di`: Dependency injection system.\n- `src/change_detection`: Change detection logic.\n- `src/zone`: Zone.js integration.\n- `src/signal`: Signals implementation (if present in this version, otherwise likely in `primitives`).\n\n## 6. Conventions & Gotchas\n\n- **Prefixes**: Private/Internal exports often start with `ɵ`.\n- **Global State**: Ivy relies heavily on global state (e.g., `getLView()`) during instruction execution to avoid passing context arguments everywhere. This is for performance and code size.\n- **Performance**: The code is highly optimized for performance and memory. You will see arrays used instead of objects, bitmasks, and manual memory management patterns. **Respect these patterns.**\n\n## 7. How to Modify Core\n\n1.  **Understand the Instruction**: If modifying runtime behavior, find the corresponding instruction in `src/render3/instructions`.\n2.  **Check `LView`/`TView` Impact**: If adding state, understand where it fits in the `LView` array.\n3.  **Tests**: Core has extensive tests. Run them using Bazel.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:54:05.293Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing in-depth Angular framework understanding, particularly with Ivy/Render3 and Dependency Injection (DI).","zh":"非常适合需要深入理解Angular框架的前端代理，特别是Ivy/Render3和依赖注入（DI）","ja":"Angularフレームワークを深く理解しているフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。特にIvy/Render3とDependency Injection（DI）","ko":"Angular 프레임워크를 깊이 이해해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Ivy/Render3와 의존성 주입(DI)","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una comprensión en profundidad del framework Angular, particularmente con Ivy/Render3 y Inyección de Dependencias (DI).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une compréhension approfondie du framework Angular, en particulier avec Ivy/Render3 et l''Injection de Dépendances (DI).","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein tiefes Verständnis des Angular-Frameworks benötigen, insbesondere mit Ivy/Render3 und Abhängigkeitsinjektion (DI).","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de compreensão aprofundada do framework Angular, particularmente com Ivy/Render3 e Injeção de Dependência (DI).","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется глубокое понимание фреймворка Angular, особенно с Ivy/Render3 и Внедрением Зависимостей (DI).","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى فهم عميق لطراز Angular، خاصة مع Ivy/Render3 و الحقن التابع (DI)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deliver web apps with confidence by mastering the Angular Core mental model, leveraging rendering, dependency injection, and change detection capabilities, and utilizing protocols like DOM updates.","zh":"通过掌握Angular Core的心理模型，利用渲染、依赖注入和更改检测功能，并使用诸如DOM更新的协议，赋予代理在Web应用程序交付中充满信心的能力","ja":"Angular Coreの心的モデルをマスターし、レンダリング、依存性注入、変更検出機能を利用し、DOM更新などのプロトコルを使用して、Webアプリケーションの提供で自信を持ってエージェントを提供する力を与える","ko":"Angular Core的心理 모델을 마스터하고 렌더링, 의존성 주입, 변경 검색 기능을 활용하고 DOM 업데이트와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션 제공에서 자신감을 갖고 에이전트를 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a entregar aplicaciones web con confianza al dominar el modelo mental de Angular Core, aprovechando la renderización, la inyección de dependencias y las capacidades de detección de cambios, y utilizando protocolos como actualizaciones de DOM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de livrer des applications Web avec confiance en maîtrisant le modèle mental d''Angular Core, en exploitant le rendu, l''injection de dépendances et les capacités de détection de changements, et en utilisant des protocoles tels que des mises à jour de DOM.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Webanwendungen mit Vertrauen zu liefern, indem sie das mentale Modell von Angular Core beherrschen, die Rendering-, Abhängigkeitsinjektions- und Änderungserkennungsfunktionen nutzen und Protokolle wie DOM-Updates verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a entregar aplicativos web com confiança, dominando o modelo mental do Angular Core, aproveitando a renderização, injeção de dependência e capacidades de detecção de alterações, e utilizando protocolos como atualizações do DOM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью доставлять веб-приложения с уверенностью, осваивая умственную модель Angular Core, используя рендеринг, внедрение зависимостей и возможности обнаружения изменений, и используя протоколы, такие как обновления DOM.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تسليم تطبيقات الويب بثقة من خلال إتقان نموذج Angular Core العقلي، واستخدام العرض والتوجيه التابع وقدرات اكتشاف التغيير، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحديثات DOM."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex template rendering issues","Optimizing dependency injection for improved performance","Implementing efficient change detection strategies"],"zh":["调试复杂模板渲染问题","优化依赖注入以提高性能","实施高效的更改检测策略"],"ja":["複雑なテンプレートレンダリングの問題をデバッグ","パフォーマンスの向上のために依存性注入を最適化","効率的な変更検出戦略を実装"],"ko":["복잡한 템플릿 렌더링 문제 디버깅","성능 개선을 위한 의존성 주입 최적화","효율적인 변경 검색 전략 구현"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de renderizado de plantillas complejas","Optimización de la inyección de dependencias para un mejor rendimiento","Implementación de estrategias de detección de cambios eficientes"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes de rendu de modèles complexes","Optimisation de l''injection de dépendances pour une meilleure performance","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de détection de changements efficaces"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei komplexen Template-Renderproblemen","Optimierung der Abhängigkeitsinjektion für eine bessere Leistung","Implementierung effizienter Änderungserkennungsstrategien"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de renderização de modelos complexos","Otimização da injeção de dependência para melhor desempenho","Implementação de estratégias de detecção de alterações eficientes"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем рендеринга шаблонов","Оптимизация внедрения зависимостей для улучшения производительности","Реализация эффективных стратегий обнаружения изменений"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء عرض القوالب المعقدة","تحسين الحقن التابع من أجل أداء أفضل","تنفيذ استراتيجيات اكتشاف التغييرات بشكل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Angular framework","Limited to Angular Core (packages/core) functionality"],"zh":["需要Angular框架的知识","仅限于Angular Core（packages/core）功能"],"ja":["Angularフレームワークの知識が必要","Angular Core（packages/core）機能に限定"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","Angular Core（packages/core）기능에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework Angular","Limitado a la funcionalidad de Angular Core (packages/core)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances du framework Angular","Limité à la fonctionnalité d''Angular Core (packages/core)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Angular-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf die Funktionalität von Angular Core (packages/core)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do framework Angular","Limitado à funcionalidade do Angular Core (packages/core)"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка Angular","Ограничен функциональностью Angular Core (packages/core)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار Angular","محدود بالوظائف الأساسية ل Angular (packages/core)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c4c1c69569c62394fd6727ed0d0