I-Agents","Organisation der Familienhistorie","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de árvore genealógica personalizada","Interface de usuário amigável e responsiva","Integração com IA para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos e plataformas","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Создание индивидуального дерева рода","Удобный и адаптивный интерфейс пользователя","Интеграция с ИИ для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Поддержка нескольких устройств и платформ","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["بناء شجرة عائلة مخصصة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام ومتجاوبة","التكامل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","دعم الأجهزة والمنصات المتعددة","الкод المفتوح والقابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Kith-ux-polisher","什么是家族树应用","Kith-ux-polisher安装","Kith-ux-polisher设置指南","Kith-ux-polisher替代品","Kith-ux-polisher vs 其他家族树应用"],"ja":["Kith-ux-polisherの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Kith-ux-polisherのインストール","Kith-ux-polisherの設定ガイド","Kith-ux-polisherの代替品","Kith-ux-polisher vs 他の家族樹アプリ"],"ko":["Kith-ux-polisher 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","Kith-ux-polisher 설치","Kith-ux-polisher 설정 가이드","Kith-ux-polisher 대체품","Kith-ux-polisher vs 다른 가족 나무 애플리케이션"],"es":["cómo usar Kith-ux-polisher","qué es un árbol genealógico","Kith-ux-polisher alternativa","Kith-ux-polisher vs otras herramientas","instalación de Kith-ux-polisher","guía de configuración de Kith-ux-polisher","herramientas de árbol genealógico","Agentes de IA para la genealogía"],"fr":["comment utiliser Kith-ux-polisher","qu''est-ce qu''un arbre généalogique","Kith-ux-polisher alternative","Kith-ux-polisher vs d''autres outils","installation de Kith-ux-polisher","guide de configuration de Kith-ux-polisher","outils d''arbre généalogique","Agents de IA pour la généalogie"],"de":["wie man Kith-ux-polisher verwendet","was ist ein Genealogie-Tool","Kith-ux-polisher Alternative","Kith-ux-polisher vs andere Tools","Installation von Kith-ux-polisher","Setup-Anleitung für Kith-ux-polisher","Genealogie-Tools","KI-Agents für die Genealogie"],"pt":["como usar Kith-UX-Polisher","o que é Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher alternativa","Kith-UX-Polisher vs outras ferramentas","instalar Kith-UX-Polisher","guia de configuração do Kith-UX-Polisher","desenvolvimento de árvore genealógica","ferramentas de IA para árvore genealógica"],"ru":["как использовать Kith-UX-Polisher","что такое Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher альтернатива","Kith-UX-Polisher vs другие инструменты","установить Kith-UX-Polisher","руководство по настройке Kith-UX-Polisher","создание дерева рода","инструменты ИИ для дерева рода"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Kith-UX-Polisher","ما هو Kith-UX-Polisher","بديل Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Kith-UX-Polisher","دليل إعداد Kith-UX-Polisher","بناء شجرة العائلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لشجرة العائلة"]}},"owner":"sf-bcca","repo":"Kith","repoPath":"sf-bcca/Kith","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.899Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kith-ux-polisher","description":"Enforces the Kith design system (Tailwind+Material), accessibility standards, and responsive behaviors. Use when creating new UI components, styling visualization charts (SVG/Canvas), or auditing UX consistency.","bodyPreview":"# Kith UX Polisher\n\nThis skill acts as the guardian of Kith''s visual identity and user experience.\n\n## Design System\n\n### 1. Core Aesthetics\n- **Rounded Corners**: Use `rounded-3xl` for main containers/modals, `rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for inputs/buttons.\n- **Shadows**: Use soft, colored shadows for depth (e.g., `shadow-lg shadow-primary/20`).\n- **Glassmorphism**: Use `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/80`) for overlays and sticky headers.\n\n### 2. Interact","body":"# Kith UX Polisher\n\nThis skill acts as the guardian of Kith''s visual identity and user experience.\n\n## Design System\n\n### 1. Core Aesthetics\n- **Rounded Corners**: Use `rounded-3xl` for main containers/modals, `rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for inputs/buttons.\n- **Shadows**: Use soft, colored shadows for depth (e.g., `shadow-lg shadow-primary/20`).\n- **Glassmorphism**: Use `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/80`) for overlays and sticky headers.\n\n### 2. Interaction Patterns\n- **Modals**: Must have `animate-in fade-in zoom-in` entrance animations and close on backdrop click.\n- **Buttons**:\n    - Primary: `bg-primary text-white shadow-lg hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]`\n    - Secondary: `bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200`\n- **Feedback**: All interactive elements must provide visual feedback (hover, active, focus states).\n\n### 3. Data Visualization (Trees & Charts)\n- **Consistency**: Use consistent node sizes (`w-40`, `h-16`) and stroke widths (`stroke-2`) across different tree views.\n- **Lines**: Use orthogonal (right-angle) connectors with rounded corners for hierarchy.\n- **Controls**: All charts must support Pan & Zoom interactions via consistent controls (top-right overlay).\n\n## Accessibility & Responsiveness\n\n### 1. Accessibility (a11y)\n- **Contrast**: Ensure text passes WCAG AA. Use `text-slate-500` for secondary text, never lighter unless on dark backgrounds.\n- **Labels**: All icon-only buttons MUST have an `aria-label` or `title`.\n- **Keyboard**: Ensure all interactive elements are focusable and have visible focus rings (`focus:ring-2`).\n\n### 2. Responsive Strategy\n- **Mobile First**: Design for touch targets (min 44px) on small screens.\n- **Overflow**: Complex charts should overflow with scroll (`overflow-auto`) on mobile rather than shrinking to illegibility.\n- **Navigation**: Use the bottom navigation bar (`BottomNav.tsx`) pattern for mobile views."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:40.541Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI/UX design system integration with Kith''s visual identity.","zh":"非常适合需要与Kith视觉身份集成高级UI/UX设计系统的前端代理。","ja":"Kithの視覚的なアイデンティティと統合された高度なUI/UXデザインシステムを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Kith의 시각적 정체성과 통합된 고급 UI/UX 디자인 시스템이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada del sistema de diseño de UI/UX con la identidad visual de Kith.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend nécessitant une intégration avancée du système de conception d''UI/UX à l''identité visuelle de Kith.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration des UI/UX-Designsystems mit der visuellen Identität von Kith benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração avançada do sistema de design UI/UX com a identidade visual da Kith.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция системы дизайна UI/UX с визуальной идентичностью Kith.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم لنظام التصميم UI/UX مع الهوية البصرية لشركة Kith."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a consistent design language using rounded corners, soft shadows, and glassmorphism, streamlining user experience with `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds like `bg-white/80`.","zh":"赋予代理人使用圆角、软阴影和玻璃化等一致的设计语言，通过`backdrop-blur-md`和半透明背景如`bg-white/80`简化用户体验。","ja":"エージェントに丸みを帯びた角、ソフトな影、ガラス化などの一貫したデザイン言語を使用して、`backdrop-blur-md`や`bg-white/80`などの半透明背景でユーザーエクスペリエンスを簡素化する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트에게 일관된 디자인 언어를 사용하여丸무늬 모서리, 軟한 그림자, 유리화 등으로 `backdrop-blur-md`와 반투명 배경인 `bg-white/80`로 사용자 경험을 간소화하는力を 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un lenguaje de diseño coherente utilizando esquinas redondeadas, sombras suaves y glassmorphism, simplificando la experiencia del usuario con `backdrop-blur-md` y fondos semitransparentes como `bg-white/80`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un langage de conception cohérent en utilisant des coins arrondis, des ombres douces et du glassmorphism, simplifiant l''expérience utilisateur avec `backdrop-blur-md` et des arrières-plans semi-transparents comme `bg-white/80`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine konsistente Designsprache mithilfe abgerundeter Ecken, weicher Schatten und Glassmorphismus anzuwenden, wodurch die Benutzeroberfläche mit `backdrop-blur-md` und halbtransparenten Hintergründen wie `bg-white/80` gestreamlined wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes imponham uma linguagem de design consistente usando cantos arredondados, sombras suaves e glassmorphism, simplificando a experiência do usuário com `backdrop-blur-md` e fundos semi-transparentes como `bg-white/80`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечить согласованность языка дизайна, используя закругленные углы, мягкие тени и эффект стекла, упрощая опыт пользователя с помощью `backdrop-blur-md` и полупрозрачных фонов, таких как `bg-white/80`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض لغة تصميم متسقة باستخدام زوايا مدورة وأضواء ناعمة وتصميم زجاجي، وبذلك يبسطون تجربة المستخدم مع `backdrop-blur-md` وخلفيات شبه شفافة مثل `bg-white/80`."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing UI components with `rounded-3xl` and `rounded-2xl` classes","Enhancing modal and card designs with `shadow-lg` and `shadow-primary/20`","Implementing overlays with `backdrop-blur-md` for improved visual depth"],"zh":["使用`rounded-3xl`和`rounded-2xl`类标准化UI组件","使用`shadow-lg`和`shadow-primary/20`增强模态和卡片设计","使用`backdrop-blur-md`实现覆盖层以提高视觉深度"],"ja":["`rounded-3xl`と`rounded-2xl`クラスを使用してUIコンポーネントを標準化する","`shadow-lg`と`shadow-primary/20`を使用してモーダルとカードのデザインを強化する","`backdrop-blur-md`を使用してオーバーレイを実装して視覚的な深度を高める"],"ko":["`rounded-3xl`와 `rounded-2xl` 클래스를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 표준화하는 것","`shadow-lg`와 `shadow-primary/20`를 사용하여 모달과 카드 디자인을 강화하는 것","`backdrop-blur-md`를 사용하여 오버레이를 구현하여 시각적 깊이를 높이는 것"],"es":["Establecer estándares para los componentes de UI con clases `rounded-3xl` y `rounded-2xl`","Mejorar los diseños de modales y tarjetas con `shadow-lg` y `shadow-primary/20`","Implementar superposiciones con `backdrop-blur-md` para una mayor profundidad visual"],"fr":["Standardiser les composants d''UI avec des classes `rounded-3xl` et `rounded-2xl`","Améliorer les conceptions de modales et de cartes avec `shadow-lg` et `shadow-primary/20`","Mettre en œuvre des superpositions avec `backdrop-blur-md` pour une plus grande profondeur visuelle"],"de":["Standardisieren von UI-Komponenten mit den Klassen `rounded-3xl` und `rounded-2xl`","Verbessern der Modal- und Karten-Designs mit `shadow-lg` und `shadow-primary/20`","Implementieren von Überlagerungen mit `backdrop-blur-md` für eine verbesserte visuelle Tiefe"],"pt":["Padronizar componentes da interface do usuário com classes `rounded-3xl` e `rounded-2xl`","Melhorar designs de modal e cartão com `shadow-lg` e `shadow-primary/20`","Implementar sobreposições com `backdrop-blur-md` para melhorar a profundidade visual"],"ru":["Стандартизировать компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью классов `rounded-3xl` и `rounded-2xl`","Улучшить дизайн модальных окон и карточек с помощью `shadow-lg` и `shadow-primary/20`","Реализовать наложения с помощью `backdrop-blur-md` для улучшения визуальной глубины"],"ar":["توحيد مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام فئات `rounded-3xl` و `rounded-2xl`","تحسين تصاميم النماذج والبطاقات باستخدام `shadow-lg` و `shadow-primary/20`","تنفيذ التأثيرات العلوية باستخدام `backdrop-blur-md` لتحسين العمق البصري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kith application integration","Limited to specific design system components like containers, modals, and cards"],"zh":["需要Kith应用程序集成","仅限于特定的设计系统组件，如容器、模态和卡片"],"ja":["Kithアプリケーションの統合が必要","コンテナ、モーダル、カードなどの特定のデザインシステムコンポーネントに限定される"],"ko":["Kith 애플리케이션 통합이 필요","컨테이너, 모달, 카드 등과 같은 특정 디자인 시스템 컴포넌트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con la aplicación Kith","Limitado a componentes específicos del sistema de diseño como contenedores, modales y tarjetas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''application Kith","Limité à des composants spécifiques du système de conception tels que des conteneurs, des modales et des cartes"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit der Kith-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Designsystemkomponenten wie Container, Modale und Karten"],"pt":["Exige integração com aplicativo da Kith","Limitado a componentes específicos do sistema de design, como contêineres, modais e cartões"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с приложением Kith","Ограничен конкретными компонентами системы дизайна, такими как контейнеры, модальные окна и карточки"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع تطبيق Kith","محدود بمكونات محددة من نظام التصميم، مثل الحاويات والنماذج والبطاقات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4936dd91d11dc69c2995d6b623aa11d07722c8fbcb32c8d568f7ac793f9c17d0","qualityScore":21}');
