","es":"La colección definitiva de habilidades de AI Agent para el ecosistema React, con Tailwind para una mayor eficiencia","fr":"La collection ultime de compétences AI Agent pour l''écosystème React, avec Tailwind pour une efficacité accrue","de":"Die ultimative Sammlung von AI-Agent-Fähigkeiten für das React-Ökosystem, mit Tailwind für eine höhere Effizienz","pt":"O Tailwind é uma coleção de habilidades de agente de IA para o ecossistema React, melhorando a produtividade do desenvolvedor.","ru":"Tailwind - это коллекция навыков ИИ Агентов для экосистемы React, повышающая производительность разработчика.","ar":"Tailwind هو مجموعة من مهارات عميل الذكاء الاصطناعي للرياكت، مما يحسن إنتاجية المطور.","en":"The Ultimate AI Agent Skills Collection for the React Ecosystem"},"definition":{"en":"The Ultimate AI Agent Skills Collection for the React Ecosystem"},"features":{"zh":["支持React开发","提供AI智能代理技能","提高开发效率","简化React应用开发","支持多种AI工具"],"ja":["React開発対応","AIエージェントスキル提供","開発効率の向上","Reactアプリケーション開発の簡素化","多種のAIツール対応"],"ko":["React 개발 지원","AI 에이전트 기술 제공","개발 효율성 향상","React 애플리케이션 개발 단순화","다양한 AI 도구 지원"],"es":["Integración con React","Herramientas de productividad de Tailwind","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Documentación y soporte técnico","Personalización y flexibilidad"],"fr":["Intégration avec React","Outils de productivité de Tailwind","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Documentation et support technique","Personnalisation et flexibilité"],"de":["Integration mit React","Produktivitätstools von Tailwind","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Dokumentation und technischer Support","Anpassung und Flexibilität"],"pt":["Otimização de layouts","Estilização de componentes","Melhoria da acessibilidade","Integração com bibliotecas React","Suporte a diferentes dispositivos"],"ru":["Оптимизация макетов","Стилизация компонентов","Улучшение доступности","Интеграция с библиотеками React","Поддержка разных устройств"],"ar":["تحسين تخطيطات","تجميل المكونات","تحسين سهولة الوصول","التكامل مع مكتبات الرياكت","دعم الأجهزة المختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind AI智能代理技能","React开发工具","AI工具","如何使用Tailwind","Tailwind与React","Tailwind安装","React开发指南"],"ja":["Tailwind AIエージェントスキル","React開発ツール","AIエージェント","Tailwindの使い方","TailwindとReact","Tailwindのインストール","React開発ガイド"],"ko":["Tailwind AI 에이전트 기술","React 개발 도구","AI 도구","Tailwind 사용법","Tailwind와 React","Tailwind 설치","React 개발 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI Agent para React"," Tailwind para React","cómo usar Tailwind","qué es Tailwind","alternativas a Tailwind","Tailwind vs otros frameworks","instalación de Tailwind","guía de configuración de Tailwind"],"fr":["outils AI Agent pour React","Tailwind pour React","comment utiliser Tailwind","qu''est-ce que Tailwind","alternatives à Tailwind","Tailwind vs autres frameworks","installation de Tailwind","guide de configuration de Tailwind"],"de":["AI-Agent-Tools für React","Tailwind für React","wie man Tailwind verwendet","was ist Tailwind","Alternativen zu Tailwind","Tailwind vs andere Frameworks","Installation von Tailwind","Konfigurationsanleitung für Tailwind"],"pt":["como usar Tailwind","o que é Tailwind","alternativas para Tailwind","Tailwind vs Bootstrap","instalar Tailwind","guia de configuração do Tailwind"],"ru":["как использовать Tailwind","что такое Tailwind","альтернативы для Tailwind","Tailwind vs Bootstrap","установить Tailwind","руководство по настройке Tailwind"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Tailwind","ما هو Tailwind","بديل ل Tailwind","Tailwind مقابل Bootstrap","تثبيت Tailwind","دليل إعداد Tailwind"]}},"owner":"thongdn-it","repo":"react-agent-skills","repoPath":"thongdn-it/react-agent-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.956Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwind","description":"Tailwind CSS v4 performance optimization and best practices guidelines (formerly tailwindcss-v4-style). This skill should be used when writing, reviewing, or refactoring Tailwind CSS v4 code to ensure optimal build performance, minimal CSS output, and correct usage of v4 features. Triggers on tasks involving Tailwind configuration, @theme directive, utility classes, responsive design, dark mode, container queries, or CSS generation optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind Labs Tailwind CSS v4 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Tailwind CSS v4 applications, maintained by Tailwind Labs. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling (Vite plugin, PostCSS, CLI)\n- Writing or migrating styles using v4''s CSS-first approach\n- Optimizing CSS bundle size and build performa","body":"# Tailwind Labs Tailwind CSS v4 Best Practices\n\nComprehensive performance optimization guide for Tailwind CSS v4 applications, maintained by Tailwind Labs. Contains 42 rules across 8 categories, prioritized by impact to guide automated refactoring and code generation.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling (Vite plugin, PostCSS, CLI)\n- Writing or migrating styles using v4''s CSS-first approach\n- Optimizing CSS bundle size and build performance\n- Implementing responsive designs with breakpoints or container queries\n- Setting up theming with @theme directive and design tokens\n\n## Rule Categories by Priority\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | Build Configuration | CRITICAL | `build-` |\n| 2 | CSS Generation | CRITICAL | `gen-` |\n| 3 | Bundle Optimization | HIGH | `bundle-` |\n| 4 | Utility Patterns | HIGH | `util-` |\n| 5 | Component Architecture | MEDIUM-HIGH | `comp-` |\n| 6 | Theming & Design Tokens | MEDIUM | `theme-` |\n| 7 | Responsive & Adaptive | MEDIUM | `resp-` |\n| 8 | Animation & Transitions | LOW-MEDIUM | `anim-` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### 1. Build Configuration (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`build-vite-plugin`](references/build-vite-plugin.md) - Use Vite Plugin Over PostCSS\n- [`build-css-import`](references/build-css-import.md) - Use CSS Import Over @tailwind Directives\n- [`build-content-detection`](references/build-content-detection.md) - Leverage Automatic Content Detection\n- [`build-node-version`](references/build-node-version.md) - Use Node.js 20+ for Optimal Performance\n- [`build-postcss-simplify`](references/build-postcss-simplify.md) - Remove Redundant PostCSS Plugins\n- [`build-cli-package`](references/build-cli-package.md) - Use Correct CLI Package\n\n### 2. CSS Generation (CRITICAL)\n\n- [`gen-css-first-config`](references/gen-css-first-config.md) - Use CSS-First Configuration Over JavaScript\n- [`gen-avoid-theme-bloat`](references/gen-avoid-theme-bloat.md) - Avoid Excessive Theme Variables\n- [`gen-oklch-colors`](references/gen-oklch-colors.md) - Use OKLCH Color Space for Vivid Colors\n- [`gen-utility-directive`](references/gen-utility-directive.md) - Use @utility for Custom Utilities\n- [`gen-dynamic-utilities`](references/gen-dynamic-utilities.md) - Use Dynamic Utility Values\n- [`gen-css-variable-syntax`](references/gen-css-variable-syntax.md) - Use Parentheses for CSS Variable References\n\n### 3. Bundle Optimization (HIGH)\n\n- [`bundle-remove-unused-plugins`](references/bundle-remove-unused-plugins.md) - Remove Built-in Plugins\n- [`bundle-avoid-preprocessors`](references/bundle-avoid-preprocessors.md) - Avoid Sass/Less Preprocessors\n- [`bundle-css-minification`](references/bundle-css-minification.md) - Enable CSS Minification in Production\n- [`bundle-avoid-cdn-production`](references/bundle-avoid-cdn-production.md) - Avoid Play CDN in Production\n- [`bundle-split-critical-css`](references/bundle-split-critical-css.md) - Extract Critical CSS for Initial Render\n\n### 4. Utility Patterns (HIGH)\n\n- [`util-renamed-utilities`](references/util-renamed-utilities.md) - Use Renamed Utility Classes\n- [`util-important-modifier`](references/util-important-modifier.md) - Use Trailing Important Modifier\n- [`util-variant-stacking`](references/util-variant-stacking.md) - Use Left-to-Right Variant Stacking\n- [`util-explicit-colors`](references/util-explicit-colors.md) - Use Explicit Border and Ring Colors\n- [`util-opacity-modifier`](references/util-opacity-modifier.md) - Use Slash Opacity Modifier\n- [`util-gradient-via-none`](references/util-gradient-via-none.md) - Use via-none to Reset Gradient Stops\n\n### 5. Component Architecture (MEDIUM-HIGH)\n\n- [`comp-avoid-apply-overuse`](references/comp-avoid-apply-overuse.md) - Avoid Overusing @apply\n- [`comp-reference-directive`](references/comp-reference-directive.md) - Use @reference for CSS Module Integration\n- [`comp-utility-file-scope`](references/comp-utility-file-scope.md) - Understand Utility File Scope\n- [`comp-smart-sorting`](references/comp-smart-sorting.md) - Leverage Smart Utility Sorting\n- [`comp-container-customize`](references/comp-container-customize.md) - Customize Container with @utility\n\n### 6. Theming & Design Tokens (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`theme-semantic-tokens`](references/theme-semantic-tokens.md) - Use Semantic Design Token Names\n- [`theme-dark-mode-class`](references/theme-dark-mode-class.md) - Use Class-Based Dark Mode for Control\n- [`theme-prefix-variables`](references/theme-prefix-variables.md) - Use Prefix for Variable Namespacing\n- [`theme-runtime-variables`](references/theme-runtime-variables.md) - Leverage Runtime CSS Variables\n- [`theme-color-scheme`](references/theme-color-scheme.md) - Set color-scheme for Native Dark Mode\n\n### 7. Responsive & Adaptive (MEDIUM)\n\n- [`resp-mobile-first`](references/resp-mobile-first.md) - Use Mobile-First Responsive Design\n- [`resp-container-queries`](references/resp-container-queries.md) - Use Container Queries for Component-Level Responsiveness\n- [`resp-custom-breakpoints`](references/resp-custom-breakpoints.md) - Define Custom Breakpoints in @theme\n- [`resp-hover-capability`](references/resp-hover-capability.md) - Understand Hover Behavior on Touch Devices\n- [`resp-logical-properties`](references/resp-logical-properties.md) - Use Logical Properties for RTL Support\n\n### 8. Animation & Transitions (LOW-MEDIUM)\n\n- [`anim-gpu-accelerated`](references/anim-gpu-accelerated.md) - Use GPU-Accelerated Transform Properties\n- [`anim-starting-style`](references/anim-starting-style.md) - Use @starting-style for Entry Animations\n- [`anim-gradient-interpolation`](references/anim-gradient-interpolation.md) - Use OKLCH Gradient Interpolation\n- [`anim-3d-transforms`](references/anim-3d-transforms.md) - Use Built-in 3D Transform Utilities\n\n## How to Use\n\nRead individual reference files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [Section definitions](references/_sections.md) - Category structure and impact levels\n- [Rule template](assets/templates/_template.md) - Template for adding new rules\n\n## Full Compiled Document\n\nFor a complete guide with all rules expanded, see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).\n\n## Reference Files\n\n| File | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) | Complete compiled guide with all rules |\n| [references/_sections.md](references/_sections.md) | Category definitions and ordering |\n| [assets/templates/_template.md](assets/templates/_template.md) | Template for new rules |\n| [metadata.json](metadata.json) | Version and reference information |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:13.750Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced CSS optimization and automated refactoring capabilities with Tailwind CSS v4","zh":"适用于需要高级CSS优化和自动重构功能的前端代理，特别是使用Tailwind CSS v4","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4を使用して高度なCSS最適化と自動リファクタリング機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに適しています","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4를 사용하여 고급 CSS 최적화 및 자동 리팩토링 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan una optimización avanzada de CSS y capacidades de refactorización automatizada con Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une optimisation avancée de CSS et de capacités de refactoring automatisées avec Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte CSS-Optimierung und automatisierte Refactoring-Funktionen mit Tailwind CSS v4 benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de otimização avançada de CSS e capacidades de refatoração automatizada com Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая оптимизация CSS и автоматические возможности рефакторинга с Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى تحسين متقدم لCSS وقدرات إعادة هيكلة أوتوماتيكية مع Tailwind CSS v4"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize CSS bundle size and build performance using Tailwind Labs'' 42 rules across 8 categories, leveraging Vite plugin, PostCSS, and CLI for automated refactoring and code generation with Tailwind CSS v4''s CSS-first approach","zh":"赋予代理优化CSS包大小和构建性能的能力，使用Tailwind Labs的42条规则跨8个类别，利用Vite插件、PostCSS和CLI进行自动重构和代码生成，采用Tailwind CSS v4的CSS首先的方法","ja":"エージェントがCSSバンドルサイズとビルド性能を最適化する能力を提供します。Tailwind Labsの42のルールを8つのカテゴリにわたって使用し、Viteプラグイン、PostCSS、CLIを利用して自動リファクタリングとコード生成を行い、Tailwind CSS v4のCSSファーストアプローチを採用します","ko":"에이전트가 CSS 번들 크기와 빌드 성능을 최적화하는 기능을 제공합니다. Tailwind Labs의 42개 규칙을 8개 범주에 걸쳐 사용하며, Vite 플러그인, PostCSS 및 CLI를 활용하여 자동 리팩토링 및 코드 생성을 수행하고, Tailwind CSS v4의 CSS 우선 접근 방식을 사용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar el tamaño del paquete de CSS y el rendimiento de la compilación utilizando las 42 reglas de Tailwind Labs en 8 categorías, aprovechando el plugin Vite, PostCSS y CLI para el refactoring y la generación de código automatizados con el enfoque CSS-first de Tailwind CSS v4","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser la taille du bundle CSS et les performances de construction en utilisant les 42 règles de Tailwind Labs dans 8 catégories, en exploitant le plugin Vite, PostCSS et CLI pour le refactoring et la génération de code automatisés avec l''approche CSS-first de Tailwind CSS v4","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die CSS-Bundle-Größe und den Build-Prozess zu optimieren, indem sie die 42 Regeln von Tailwind Labs in 8 Kategorien nutzen, den Vite-Plugin, PostCSS und CLI für automatisiertes Refactoring und Code-Generierung mit dem CSS-First-Ansatz von Tailwind CSS v4","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar o tamanho do pacote CSS e o desempenho da compilação usando as 42 regras da Tailwind Labs em 8 categorias, aproveitando o plugin Vite, PostCSS e CLI para refatoração e geração de código automatizadas com a abordagem CSS-first do Tailwind CSS v4","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать размер пакета CSS и производительность сборки, используя 42 правила Tailwind Labs в 8 категориях, используя плагин Vite, PostCSS и CLI для автоматической рефакторинга и генерации кода с подходом CSS-first Tailwind CSS v4","ar":"تمكّن العميل من تحسين حجم حزمة CSS وأداء البناء باستخدام 42 قاعدة من Tailwind Labs في 8 فئات، مع استخدام إضافة Vite و PostCSS و CLI لتحسين و生成 الشفرة آليًا مع نهج CSS-first من Tailwind CSS v4"},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Tailwind CSS v4 build tooling for optimal performance","Automating CSS code generation and refactoring with PostCSS and CLI","Optimizing CSS bundle size for faster web application loading"],"zh":["为Tailwind CSS v4构建工具配置最优性能","使用PostCSS和CLI自动生成和重构CSS代码","优化CSS包大小以实现更快的Web应用程序加载"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4ビルドツールを最適なパフォーマンスで構成する","PostCSSとCLIを使用してCSSコードを自動生成およびリファクタリングする","CSSバンドルサイズを最適化してWebアプリケーションの読み込みを高速化する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4 빌드 도구를 최적의 성능으로 구성하기","PostCSS 및 CLI를 사용하여 CSS 코드 자동 생성 및 리팩토링하기","CSS 번들 크기 최적화하여 웹 애플리케이션 로딩을 더 빠르게 하기"],"es":["Configuración de la herramienta de construcción de Tailwind CSS v4 para un rendimiento óptimo","Automatización de la generación y el refactoring de código CSS con PostCSS y CLI","Optimización del tamaño del paquete de CSS para una carga más rápida de aplicaciones web"],"fr":["Configuration de l''outil de construction de Tailwind CSS v4 pour des performances optimales","Automatisation de la génération et du refactoring de code CSS avec PostCSS et CLI","Optimisation de la taille du bundle CSS pour un chargement plus rapide des applications web"],"de":["Konfiguration des Build-Tools von Tailwind CSS v4 für optimale Leistung","Automatisierung der CSS-Code-Generierung und des Refactorings mit PostCSS und CLI","Optimierung der CSS-Bundle-Größe für ein schnelleres Laden von Webanwendungen"],"pt":["Configurando a ferramenta de compilação do Tailwind CSS v4 para desempenho ótimo","Automatizando a geração e refatoração de código CSS com PostCSS e CLI","Otimizando o tamanho do pacote CSS para carregamento mais rápido de aplicações web"],"ru":["Настройка инструмента сборки Tailwind CSS v4 для оптимальной производительности","Автоматизация генерации и рефакторинга кода CSS с помощью PostCSS и CLI","Оптимизация размера пакета CSS для более быстрой загрузки веб-приложений"],"ar":["تكوين أداة البناء Tailwind CSS v4 لأداء مثالي","تحسين وتحويل آلي للشفرة CSS باستخدام PostCSS و CLI","تحسين حجم حزمة CSS لتحميل تطبيقات الويب بشكل أسرع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Tailwind CSS v4","Limited to CSS optimization and refactoring"],"zh":["需要Tailwind CSS v4","仅限于CSS优化和重构"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS v4が必要","CSS最適化とリファクタリングのみに限定される"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS v4가 필요","CSS 최적화 및 리팩토링에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere Tailwind CSS v4","Limitado a la optimización y el refactoring de CSS"],"fr":["Nécessite Tailwind CSS v4","Limité à l''optimisation et au refactoring de CSS"],"de":["Benötigt Tailwind CSS v4","Begrenzt auf CSS-Optimierung und Refactoring"],"pt":["Exige Tailwind CSS v4","Limitado à otimização e refatoração de CSS"],"ru":["Требуется Tailwind CSS v4","Ограниченная оптимизация и рефакторинга CSS"],"ar":["يتطلب Tailwind CSS v4","محدود بتحسين وتنظيم الشفرة CSS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ba473b96fa12e924c6387a037a1c58dcd7f7619ff4119fd247fc858b67d04ec0","qualityScore":21}');
