de IA"],"ru":["Очистка данных","Организация данных","Интеграция с robot_sf","Использование в пространстве имен ll7","Разработка решений ИИ"],"ar":["تنظيف البيانات","تنظيم البيانات","التكامل مع robot_sf","استخدام في مساحة الاسم ll7","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具清理","robot_sf","ll7命名空间","AI技术","清理和优化","高效的清理","AI智能工具的应用","如何使用robot_sf","robot_sf的优点"],"ja":["AIエージェントのクリーンアップ","robot_sf","ll7名前空間","AI技術","クリーンアップと最適化","高性能のクリーンアップ","AIエージェントの応用","robot_sfの使い方","robot_sfの利点"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 정리","robot_sf","ll7 네임스페이스","AI 기술","정리와 최적화","효율적인 정리","AI 에이전트의 응용","robot_sf의 사용법","robot_sf의 장점"],"es":["cómo usar clean-up","qué es clean-up","clean-up vs otros herramientas de limpieza","instalación de clean-up","guía de configuración de clean-up","herramientas de limpieza de Agentes de IA","mejora de la eficiencia de los Agentes de IA","optimización de rendimiento de robot_sf","compatibilidad con React y Node.js"],"fr":["comment utiliser clean-up","qu''est-ce que clean-up","clean-up vs autres outils de nettoyage","installation de clean-up","guide de configuration de clean-up","outils de nettoyage d''Agents d''IA","amélioration de l''efficacité des Agents d''IA","optimisation des performances de robot_sf","compatibilité avec React et Node.js"],"de":["wie man clean-up verwendet","was ist clean-up","clean-up vs andere Reinigungstools","installation von clean-up","anleitung zur konfiguration von clean-up","reinigungstools für KI-Agents","verbesserung der effizienz von KI-Agents","optimierung der leistung von robot_sf","kompatibilität mit React und Node.js"],"pt":["como usar clean-up","o que é clean-up","ferramentas de ia","clean-up vs outras ferramentas","instalar clean-up","guia de configuração do clean-up","desenvolvimento de soluções de ia","utilizando robot_sf"],"ru":["как использовать clean-up","что такое clean-up","инструменты ии","clean-up vs другие инструменты","установить clean-up","руководство по настройке clean-up","разработка решений ии","используя robot_sf"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام clean-up","ما هو clean-up","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","clean-up مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت clean-up","دليل إعداد clean-up","تطوير حلول الذكاء الاصطناعي","استخدام robot_sf"]}},"owner":"ll7","repo":"robot_sf_ll7","repoPath":"ll7/robot_sf_ll7","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T01:58:23.323Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"clean-up","description":"Clean up the current branch in the Robot SF repo by following docs/dev_guide.md and reusable scripts/dev commands; use when asked to tidy a branch, run Ruff format/fix, or run parallel pytest before sharing changes.","bodyPreview":"# Clean Up\n\n## Overview\n\nClean and validate the current branch for the Robot SF repo by applying the dev guide\nworkflow, running Ruff format/fix, and running parallel tests.\n\n## Cleanup Workflow\n\n1. Confirm repo and guidance\n   - Verify the working directory looks like the Robot SF repo (e.g., `.git`,\n     `docs/dev_guide.md`, `.specify/memory/constitution.md`, and\n     `.github/copilot-instructions.md` exist).\n   - Read `docs/dev_guide.md`, `.specify/memory/constitution.md`, and\n     `.github/c","body":"# Clean Up\n\n## Overview\n\nClean and validate the current branch for the Robot SF repo by applying the dev guide\nworkflow, running Ruff format/fix, and running parallel tests.\n\n## Cleanup Workflow\n\n1. Confirm repo and guidance\n   - Verify the working directory looks like the Robot SF repo (e.g., `.git`,\n     `docs/dev_guide.md`, `.specify/memory/constitution.md`, and\n     `.github/copilot-instructions.md` exist).\n   - Read `docs/dev_guide.md`, `.specify/memory/constitution.md`, and\n     `.github/copilot-instructions.md` to align with required rules.\n\n2. Ensure environment\n   - If `VIRTUAL_ENV` is empty and `.venv/bin/activate` exists, run\n     `source .venv/bin/activate`.\n   - If `.venv/bin/activate` is missing, follow dev guide setup:\n     `uv sync --all-extras`, `source .venv/bin/activate`, and\n     `uv run pre-commit install`.\n\n3. Run formatting and fixes first\n   - Use the shared script:\n     `scripts/dev/ruff_fix_format.sh`\n   - If Ruff reports issues, fix them and rerun until clean.\n\n4. Run tests in parallel\n   - Use the shared script:\n     `scripts/dev/run_tests_parallel.sh`\n   - Default behavior is fail-fast + failed-first ordering:\n     `pytest -n auto -x --failed-first`\n   - Optional ordering toggle:\n     `scripts/dev/run_tests_parallel.sh --new-first`\n   - To disable fail-fast when you need a full failure set:\n     `scripts/dev/run_tests_parallel.sh --no-fast-fail`\n   - If tests fail, evaluate test value first (Constitution Principle XIII /\n     dev guide testing strategy). Classify failures and decide whether to fix,\n     defer, or ask for direction before removing or relaxing tests.\n\n5. Run diff-based quality gates and fix them.\n   - Run changed-files coverage check:\n     `BASE_REF=origin/main scripts/dev/check_changed_coverage.sh`\n     - If you changed any test files, run these new tests locally.\n   - Run touched-definition TODO docstring check:\n     `BASE_REF=origin/main scripts/dev/check_docstring_todos_diff.sh`\n\n6. Report and follow-ups\n   - Summarize commands run and results.\n   - Note remaining failures, flaky tests, or follow-up tasks (for example,\n     GUI tests if rendering changes were made, or CHANGELOG updates for\n     user-facing changes).\n  - Suggest commit batches and messages for any uncommited changes.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T02:47:55.147Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Maintenance Agents requiring automated repository validation and formatting.","zh":"适用于需要自动仓库验证和格式化的代码维护代理。","ja":"コードメンテナンスエージェントが自動リポジトリ検証とフォーマットが必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 저장소 검증 및 형식 지정이 필요한 코드 유지 보수 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Mantenimiento de Código que requieren una validación y formato de repositorio automatizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Maintenance de Code nécessitant une validation et un formatage de référentiel automatisés.","de":"Ideal für Code-Wartungsagenten, die eine automatisierte Repository-Validierung und -Formatierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Manutenção de Código que exigem validação e formatação de repositório automatizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по техническому обслуживанию кода, требующих автоматической проверки и форматирования репозитория.","ar":"مثالي لعميل صيانة الشفرة الذي يتطلب التحقق والتنسيق التلقائي لمستودع"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce code standards by running Ruff format/fix and parallel tests, ensuring a clean and validated codebase with consistent formatting and adherence to the dev guide workflow.","zh":"通过运行Ruff格式/修复和并行测试，使代理能够强制执行代码标准，确保代码库干净、经过验证、格式一致，并遵循开发指南工作流。","ja":"Ruffフォーマット/修正と並列テストを実行することで、エージェントがコード規格を強制できるようにし、クリーンで検証済みのコードベースと一貫したフォーマット、および開発ガイドのワークフローに従ったものを保証します。","ko":"Ruff 형식/수정 및 병렬 테스트를 실행하여 에이전트가 코드 표준을 적용할 수 있도록 하여 코드베이스가 깨끗하고 검증되며 형식이 일관적이고 개발 가이드 워크플로를 따르도록 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir los estándares de código ejecutando Ruff format/fix y pruebas paralelas, asegurando una base de código limpia y validada con un formato consistente y adherencia al flujo de trabajo de la guía de desarrollo.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter les normes de code en exécutant Ruff format/fix et des tests parallèles, garantissant une base de code propre et validée avec un formatage cohérent et une adhésion au flux de travail de la guide de développement.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Code-Standards durch Ausführen von Ruff format/fix und parallelen Tests durchzusetzen, um eine saubere und validierte Codebasis mit konsistentem Formatierung und Einhaltung des Entwicklerleitfaden-Workflows sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões de código executando Ruff format/fix e testes paralelos, garantindo uma base de código limpa e validada com formatação consistente e aderência ao fluxo de trabalho do guia de desenvolvedores.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение стандартов кода путем запуска Ruff format/fix и параллельных тестов, гарантируя чистую и проверенную базу кода с последовательным форматированием и соблюдением рабочего процесса руководства разработчиков.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء صلاحية فرض معايير الشفرة من خلال تشغيل Ruff format/fix والاختبارات الموازية، مما يضمن قاعدة شفرة نظيفة وتم التحقق منها بنسق موحد والامتثال لسير عمل دليل المطورين."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating repository structure","Automating code formatting with Ruff","Running parallel tests for code validation"],"zh":["验证仓库结构","使用Ruff自动代码格式化","运行并行测试以验证代码"],"ja":["リポジトリ構造の検証","Ruffを使用したコードの自動フォーマット","コード検証のための並列テストの実行"],"ko":["저장소 구조 검증","Ruff를 사용한 코드 자동 형식화","코드 검증을 위한 병렬 테스트 실행"],"es":["Validar la estructura del repositorio","Automatizar el formato de código con Ruff","Ejecutar pruebas paralelas para la validación de código"],"fr":["Valider la structure du référentiel","Automatiser le formatage de code avec Ruff","Exécuter des tests parallèles pour la validation de code"],"de":["Die Struktur des Repositorys überprüfen","Automatisieren des Code-Formatierungs mit Ruff","Ausführen von parallelen Tests für die Code-Validierung"],"pt":["Validação da estrutura do repositório","Automatização da formatação de código com Ruff","Execução de testes paralelos para validação de código"],"ru":["Проверка структуры репозитория","Автоматизация форматирования кода с помощью Ruff","Запуск параллельных тестов для проверки кода"],"ar":["التحقق من بنية المستودع","التنسيق التلقائي للشفرة باستخدام Ruff","تشغيل الاختبارات الموازية للتحقق من الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to the Robot SF repository","Dependent on Ruff format/fix and parallel test tools"],"zh":["需要访问Robot SF仓库","依赖Ruff格式/修复和并行测试工具"],"ja":["Robot SFリポジトリへのアクセスが必要","Ruffフォーマット/修正および並列テストツールに依存"],"ko":["Robot SF 저장소에 액세스해야 함","Ruff 형식/수정 및 병렬 테스트 도구에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio Robot SF","Dependiente de las herramientas Ruff format/fix y de pruebas paralelas"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel Robot SF","Dépendant des outils Ruff format/fix et de tests parallèles"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das Robot SF-Repository","Abhängig von den Ruff format/fix- und parallelen Test-Tools"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Robot SF","Dependente das ferramentas Ruff format/fix e testes paralelos"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Robot SF","Зависит от инструментов Ruff format/fix и параллельных тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع Robot SF","يعتمد على أدوات Ruff format/fix والاختبارات الموازية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1fb768f345f9dbe0f0193711f85e727c6953bf5f50c076dded4fd8975b7ab778","qualityScore":21}');
